#. type: Title =
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/connect-payg.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Connect {payg} instance"
msgstr "ເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ {payg} ອິນສະແຕນຊ໌"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/connect-payg.adoc:2
msgid "In the three major public cloud providers (AWS, GCP and Azure), SUSE:"
msgstr "ໃນສາມຜູ້ໃຫ້ບໍລິການພັບບລິກຄລາວຫຼັກ (AWS, GCP ແລະ Azure), SUSE:"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/connect-payg.adoc:3
msgid "provides customized {payg} product images for SLES, SLES for SAP, etc."
msgstr "ໃຫ້ບໍລິການອິມເມຈຜະລິດຕະພັນ {payg} ທີ່ປັບແຕ່ງມາສະເພາະສຳລັບ SLES, SLES for SAP ແລະ ອື່ນໆ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/connect-payg.adoc:4
msgid ""
"operates per-region RMT Servers mirroring repositories for products "
"available as {payg}"
msgstr "ດຳເນີນການ RMT Servers ແຍກຕາມພາກພື້ນ ເພື່ອທຳການ mirror ບ່ອນເກັບຂໍ້ມູນ (repositories) ສຳລັບຜະລິດຕະພັນທີ່ມີໃຫ້ໃຊ້ແບບ {payg}"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/connect-payg.adoc:5
msgid ""
"This document describes how to connect existing {payg} instance to "
"{productname} server, and gives basic information about credentials "
"collection from the instance.  The goal of this connection is to extract "
"authentication data so the {productname} Server can connect to a cloud RMT "
"host.  Then the {productname} Server has access to products on the RMT host "
"that are not already available with the {scc} organization credentials."
msgstr "ເອກະສານນີ້ອະທິບາຍວິທີການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ {payg} ອິນສະແຕນຊ໌ທີ່ມີຢູ່ແລ້ວເຂົ້າກັບ {productname} ເຊີເວີ, ແລະ ໃຫ້ຂໍ້ມູນພື້ນຖານກ່ຽວກັບການເກັບລວບລວມຂໍ້ມູນປະຈຳຕົວ (credentials) ຈາກອິນສະແຕນຊ໌. ເປົ້າໝາຍຂອງການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ນີ້ແມ່ນເພື່ອດຶງຂໍ້ມູນການຢືນຢັນຕົວຕົນ ເພື່ອໃຫ້ {productname} ເຊີເວີ ສາມາດເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ກັບ cloud RMT host ໄດ້. ຈາກນັ້ນ {productname} ເຊີເວີ ຈະສາມາດເຂົ້າເຖິງຜະລິດຕະພັນໃນ RMT host ທີ່ຍັງບໍ່ທັນມີໃຫ້ໃຊ້ດ້ວຍຂໍ້ມູນປະຈຳຕົວຂອງອົງກອນ {scc}."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/connect-payg.adoc:6
msgid "Before using {payg} feature make sure that:"
msgstr "ກ່ອນຈະໃຊ້ຄຸນສົມບັດ {payg} ໃຫ້ໝັ້ນໃຈວ່າ:"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/connect-payg.adoc:7
msgid ""
"The {payg} instance is launched from the correct SUSE product image (for "
"example, SLES, SLES for SAP, or SLE HPC) to allow access to the desired "
"repositories."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/connect-payg.adoc:8
msgid ""
"{productname} Server has connectivity, directly or via a bastion, to the "
"{payg} connection endpoint, which must be in the same region as the Server."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/connect-payg.adoc:9
msgid ""
"A basic {scc} account is required. Enter your valid {scc} credentials in "
"menu:Admin[Setup Wizard > Organization Credentials]. This account is "
"required for accessing the {productname} client tools for boostrapping "
"regardless of {payg} instances."
msgstr "ຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງມີບັນຊີ {scc} ພື້ນຖານ. ປ້ອນຂໍ້ມູນປະຈຳຕົວ {scc} ທີ່ໃຊ້ໄດ້ຂອງທ່ານໃນ menu:Admin[Setup Wizard > Organization Credentials]. ບັນຊີນີ້ແມ່ນຈຳເປັນສຳລັບການເຂົ້າເຖິງເຄື່ອງມືໄຄລແອນຂອງ {productname} ເພື່ອເຮັດ bootstrap ໂດຍບໍ່ຄຳນຶງເຖິງ {payg} ອິນສະແຕນຊ໌."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/connect-payg.adoc:10
msgid ""
"If you bootstrap the {payg} instance to SUSE Manager, SUSE Manager will "
"disable its {payg} repositories then add repositories from where it mirrored "
"the data from the RMT server. The final result will be {payg} instances "
"acquiring the same repositories from the RMT servers but through the SUSE "
"Manager server itself. Of course repositories can still be setup primarily "
"from SCC."
msgstr "ຫາກທ່ານ bootstrap {payg} ອິນສະແຕນຊ໌ ໄປຍັງ SUSE Manager, SUSE Manager ຈະປິດການໃຊ້ງານ {payg} repositories ຂອງມັນ ແລ້ວເພີ່ມ repositories ຈາກບ່ອນທີ່ມັນ mirrored ຂໍ້ມູນມາຈາກ RMT server. ຜົນສຸດທ້າຍແມ່ນ {payg} ອິນສະແຕນຊ໌ ຈະໄດ້ຮັບ repositories ດຽວກັນຈາກ RMT servers ແຕ່ຜ່ານ SUSE Manager server ເອງ. ແນ່ນອນວ່າ repositories ຍັງສາມາດຕັ້ງຄ່າຫຼັກຈາກ SCC ໄດ້ຄືເກົ່າ."

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/connect-payg.adoc:11
#, no-wrap
msgid "Connecting {payg} instance"
msgstr "ກຳລັງເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ {payg} ອິນສະແຕນຊ໌"

#. type: Block title
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/connect-payg.adoc:12
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Connecting new {payg} instance"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ {payg} ອິນສະແຕນຊ໌ໃໝ່"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/connect-payg.adoc:13
msgid ""
"In the {productname} {webui}, navigate to menu:Admin[Setup Wizard > {payg}], "
"and click btn:[Add {payg}]."
msgstr "ໃນ {productname} {webui}, ໃຫ້ໄປທີ່ menu:Admin[Setup Wizard > {payg}], ແລະ ຄລິກ btn:[Add {payg}]."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/connect-payg.adoc:14
msgid "Start with the page section [guimenu]``{payg} connection Description``."
msgstr "ເລີ່ມຈາກພາກສ່ວນຂອງໜ້າ [guimenu]``{payg} connection Description``."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/connect-payg.adoc:15
msgid "In the [guimenu]``Description`` field, add the description."
msgstr "ໃນຊ່ອງ [guimenu]``Description``, ໃຫ້ເພີ່ມຄຳອະທິບາຍ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/connect-payg.adoc:16
msgid "Move to the page section [guimenu]``Instance SSH connection data``."
msgstr "ໄປທີ່ພາກສ່ວນຂອງໜ້າ [guimenu]``Instance SSH connection data``."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/connect-payg.adoc:17
msgid ""
"In the [guimenu]``Host`` field, enter the instance DNS or IP address to "
"connect from {productname}."
msgstr "ໃນຊ່ອງ [guimenu]``Host``, ໃຫ້ປ້ອນ DNS ຫຼື ທີ່ຢູ່ IP ຂອງອິນສະແຕນຊ໌ ເພື່ອເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ຈາກ {productname}."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/connect-payg.adoc:18
msgid ""
"In the [guimenu]``SSH Port`` field, enter the port number or use default "
"value 22."
msgstr "ໃນຊ່ອງ [guimenu]``SSH Port``, ໃຫ້ປ້ອນໝາຍເລກພອດ ຫຼື ໃຊ້ຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ 22."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/connect-payg.adoc:19
msgid ""
"In the [guimenu]``User`` field, enter the username as specified in the "
"cloud."
msgstr "ໃນຊ່ອງ [guimenu]``User``, ໃຫ້ປ້ອນຊື່ຜູ້ໃຊ້ຕາມທີ່ກຳນົດໄວ້ໃນຄລາວ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/connect-payg.adoc:20
msgid "In the [guimenu]``Password`` field, enter the password."
msgstr "ໃນຊ່ອງ [guimenu]``Password``, ໃຫ້ປ້ອນລະຫັດຜ່ານ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/connect-payg.adoc:21
msgid "In the [guimenu]``SSH Private Key`` field, enter the instance key."
msgstr "ໃນຊ່ອງ [guimenu]``SSH Private Key``, ໃຫ້ປ້ອນຄີ (key) ຂອງອິນສະແຕນຊ໌."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/connect-payg.adoc:22
msgid ""
"In the [guimenu]``SSH Private Key Passphrase`` field, enter the key "
"passphrase."
msgstr "ໃນຊ່ອງ [guimenu]``SSH Private Key Passphrase``, ໃຫ້ປ້ອນລະຫັດຜ່ານຂອງຄີ (key passphrase)."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/connect-payg.adoc:23
msgid "Authentication keys must always be in PEM format."
msgstr "ຄີສຳລັບການຢືນຢັນຕົວຕົນ (Authentication keys) ຕ້ອງຢູ່ໃນຮູບແບບ PEM ສະເໝີ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/connect-payg.adoc:24
msgid ""
"If you are not connecting directly to the instance, but via SSH bastion, "
"proceed with <<proc-adding-ssh-bastion-connection-data>>."
msgstr "ຫາກທ່ານບໍ່ໄດ້ເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ໂດຍກົງກັບອິນສະແຕນຊ໌, ແຕ່ຜ່ານ SSH bastion, ໃຫ້ດຳເນີນການຕໍ່ດ້ວຍ <<proc-adding-ssh-bastion-connection-data>>."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/connect-payg.adoc:25
msgid "Otherwise, continue with <<proc-finishing-payg-connecting>>."
msgstr "ຖ້າບໍ່ດັ່ງນັ້ນ, ໃຫ້ດຳເນີນການຕໍ່ດ້ວຍ <<proc-finishing-payg-connecting>>."

#. type: Block title
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/connect-payg.adoc:26
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Adding SSH bastion connection data"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການເພີ່ມຂໍ້ມູນການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ SSH bastion"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/connect-payg.adoc:27
msgid "Navigate to the page section [guimenu]``Bastion SSH connection data``."
msgstr "ໄປທີ່ພາກສ່ວນຂອງໜ້າ [guimenu]``Bastion SSH connection data``."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/connect-payg.adoc:28
msgid "In the [guimenu]``Host`` field, enter the bastion hostname."
msgstr "ໃນຊ່ອງ [guimenu]``Host``, ໃຫ້ປ້ອນ hostname ຂອງ bastion."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/connect-payg.adoc:29
msgid "In the [guimenu]``SSH Port`` field, enter the bastion port number."
msgstr "ໃນຊ່ອງ [guimenu]``SSH Port``, ໃຫ້ປ້ອນໝາຍເລກພອດຂອງ bastion."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/connect-payg.adoc:30
msgid "In the [guimenu]``User`` field, enter the bastion username."
msgstr "ໃນຊ່ອງ [guimenu]``User``, ໃຫ້ປ້ອນຊື່ຜູ້ໃຊ້ຂອງ bastion."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/connect-payg.adoc:31
msgid "In the [guimenu]``Password`` field, enter the bastion password."
msgstr "ໃນຊ່ອງ [guimenu]``Password``, ໃຫ້ປ້ອນລະຫັດຜ່ານຂອງ bastion."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/connect-payg.adoc:32
msgid "In the [guimenu]``SSH Private Key`` field, enter the bastion key."
msgstr "ໃນຊ່ອງ [guimenu]``SSH Private Key``, ໃຫ້ປ້ອນຄີຂອງ bastion."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/connect-payg.adoc:33
msgid ""
"In the [guimenu]``SSH Private Key Passphrase`` field, enter the bastion key "
"passphrase."
msgstr "ໃນຊ່ອງ [guimenu]``SSH Private Key Passphrase``, ໃຫ້ປ້ອນລະຫັດຜ່ານຂອງຄີ bastion."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/connect-payg.adoc:34
msgid "Complete the setup process with with <<proc-finishing-payg-connecting>>."
msgstr "ສຳເລັດຂັ້ນຕອນການຕັ້ງຄ່າດ້ວຍ <<proc-finishing-payg-connecting>>."

#. type: Block title
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/connect-payg.adoc:35
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Finishing {payg} connecting"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການສິ້ນສຸດການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ {payg}"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/connect-payg.adoc:36
msgid "To complete adding new {payg} connection data, click btn:[Create]."
msgstr "ເພື່ອໃຫ້ການເພີ່ມຂໍ້ມູນການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ {payg} ໃໝ່ສຳເລັດ, ໃຫ້ຄລິກ btn:[Create]."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/connect-payg.adoc:37
msgid "Return to {payg} connection data [guimenu]``Details`` page."
msgstr "ກັບຄືນໄປທີ່ໜ້າ [guimenu]``Details`` ຂອງຂໍ້ມູນການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ {payg}."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/connect-payg.adoc:38
msgid ""
"The updated connection status is displayed on the top section named "
"[guimenu]``Information``."
msgstr "ສະຖານະການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ທີ່ອັບເດດແລ້ວ ຈະສະແດງຢູ່ໃນພາກສ່ວນເທິງທີ່ຊື່ວ່າ [guimenu]``Information``."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/connect-payg.adoc:39
msgid ""
"Connection status is shown in [guimenu]``Admin > Setup Wizard > "
"Pay-as-you-go`` screen too."
msgstr "ສະຖານະການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ຍັງສະແດງຢູ່ໃນໜ້າຈໍ [guimenu]``Admin > Setup Wizard > Pay-as-you-go`` ອີກດ້ວຍ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/connect-payg.adoc:40
msgid ""
"If the authentication data for the instance are correct, the column "
"[guimenu]``Status`` shows \"Credentials successfully updated.\""
msgstr "ຫາກຂໍ້ມູນການຢືນຢັນຕົວຕົນຂອງອິນສະແຕນຊ໌ຖືກຕ້ອງ, ໃນຖັນ [guimenu]``Status`` ຈະສະແດງຂໍ້ຄວາມ \"Credentials successfully updated.\""

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/connect-payg.adoc:41
msgid ""
"If the invalid data are entered at any point, the newly created instance is "
"shown in [guimenu]``Admin > Setup Wizard > {payg}``, with column "
"[guimenu]``Status`` displaying error message."
msgstr "ຫາກມີການປ້ອນຂໍ້ມູນທີ່ບໍ່ຖືກຕ້ອງໃນຂັ້ນຕອນໃດໜຶ່ງ, ອິນສະແຕນຊ໌ທີ່ສ້າງຂຶ້ນໃໝ່ຈະສະແດງໃນ [guimenu]``Admin > Setup Wizard > {payg}``, ໂດຍໃນຖັນ [guimenu]``Status`` ຈະສະແດງຂໍ້ຄວາມຜິດພາດ (error message)."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/connect-payg.adoc:42
msgid ""
"As soon as the authentication data is available on the server, the list of "
"available products is updated."
msgstr "ທັນທີທີ່ຂໍ້ມູນການຢືນຢັນຕົວຕົນພ້ອມໃຊ້ງານໃນເຊີເວີ, ລາຍຊື່ຜະລິດຕະພັນທີ່ມີໃຫ້ໃຊ້ຈະຖືກອັບເດດ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/connect-payg.adoc:43
msgid ""
"Available products are all versions of the same product family and "
"architecture as the one installed in the {payg} instance.  For example, if "
"the instance has the {sles}{nbsp}15 SP1 product installed, {sles}{nbsp}15 "
"SP2, {sles}{nbsp}15 SP3, {sles}{nbsp}15 SP4 and {sles}{nbsp}15 SP5 are "
"automatically shown in [guimenu]``Admin > Setup Wizard > Products``."
msgstr "ຜະລິດຕະພັນທີ່ມີໃຫ້ໃຊ້ແມ່ນທຸກເວີຊັນຂອງກຸ່ມຜະລິດຕະພັນ ແລະ ສະຖາປັດຕະຍະກຳດຽວກັນກັບທີ່ຕິດຕັ້ງໃນ {payg} ອິນສະແຕນຊ໌. ຕົວຢ່າງ: ຫາກອິນສະແຕນຊ໌ມີຜະລິດຕະພັນ {sles}{nbsp}15 SP1 ຕິດຕັ້ງຢູ່, {sles}{nbsp}15 SP2, {sles}{nbsp}15 SP3, {sles}{nbsp}15 SP4 ແລະ {sles}{nbsp}15 SP5 ຈະສະແດງຂຶ້ນໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດໃນ [guimenu]``Admin > Setup Wizard > Products``."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/connect-payg.adoc:44
msgid ""
"Once the products are shown as available, the user can add a product to "
"{productname} by selecting the checkbox next to the product name and "
"clicking btn:[Add product]."
msgstr "ເມື່ອຜະລິດຕະພັນສະແດງຂຶ້ນວ່າມີໃຫ້ໃຊ້ແລ້ວ, ຜູ້ໃຊ້ສາມາດເພີ່ມຜະລິດຕະພັນເຂົ້າໃນ {productname} ໂດຍການເລືອກຊ່ອງໝາຍ (checkbox) ຖັດຈາກຊື່ຜະລິດຕະພັນ ແລະ ຄລິກ btn:[Add product]."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/connect-payg.adoc:45
msgid ""
"After the success message you can verify the newly added channels in the "
"{webui}, by navigating to [guimenu]``Software > Channel List > All``."
msgstr "ຫຼັງຈາກຂໍ້ຄວາມແຈ້ງຄວາມສຳເລັດປາກົດຂຶ້ນ, ທ່ານສາມາດກວດສອບຊ່ອງທາງ (channels) ທີ່ເພີ່ມເຂົ້າໃໝ່ໄດ້ໃນ {webui} ໂດຍໄປທີ່ [guimenu]``Software > Channel List > All``."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/connect-payg.adoc:46
msgid ""
"To monitor the syncing progress of each channel, check the log files in the "
"[path]``/var/log/rhn/reposync`` directory on the {productname} Server."
msgstr "ເພື່ອຕິດຕາມຄວາມຄືບໜ້າຂອງການ syncing ຂອງແຕ່ລະຊ່ອງທາງ, ໃຫ້ກວດສອບໄຟລ໌ log ໃນໄດເຣັກທໍຣີ [path]``/var/log/rhn/reposync`` ໃນ {productname} ເຊີເວີ."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/connect-payg.adoc:47
msgid ""
"If a product is provided by both the {payg} instance and one of the {scc} "
"subscriptions, it will appear only once in the products list."
msgstr "ຫາກຜະລິດຕະພັນມີໃຫ້ໃຊ້ທັງຈາກ {payg} ອິນສະແຕນຊ໌ ແລະ ຈາກການສະໝັກໃຊ້ (subscription) {scc}, ມັນຈະປາກົດພຽງຄັ້ງດຽວໃນລາຍຊື່ຜະລິດຕະພັນ."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/connect-payg.adoc:48
msgid ""
"When the channels belonging to that product are synced, the data might still "
"come from the SCC subscription, and not from the Pay-As-You-Go instance."
msgstr "ເມື່ອຊ່ອງທາງທີ່ເປັນຂອງຜະລິດຕະພັນນັ້ນຖືກ synced, ຂໍ້ມູນອາດຈະຍັງມາຈາກການສະໝັກໃຊ້ SCC ແລະ ບໍ່ໄດ້ມາຈາກ Pay-As-You-Go ອິນສະແຕນຊ໌."

#. type: Title ===
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/connect-payg.adoc:49
#, no-wrap
msgid "Deleting the instance connection data"
msgstr "ການລຶບຂໍ້ມູນການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ຂອງອິນສະແຕນຊ໌"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/connect-payg.adoc:50
msgid ""
"The following procedure describes how to delete SSH connection data of the "
"instance."
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນຕໍ່ໄປນີ້ອະທິບາຍວິທີການລຶບຂໍ້ມູນການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ SSH ຂອງອິນສະແຕນຊ໌."

#. type: Block title
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/connect-payg.adoc:51
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Deleting connection data to instance"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການລຶບຂໍ້ມູນການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ໄປຫາອິນສະແຕນຊ໌"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/connect-payg.adoc:52
msgid "Open [guimenu]``Admin > Setup Wizard > {payg}``."
msgstr "ເປີດ [guimenu]``Admin > Setup Wizard > {payg}``."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/connect-payg.adoc:53
msgid "Find the instance on the list of existing instances."
msgstr "ຄົ້ນຫາອິນສະແຕນຊ໌ໃນລາຍຊື່ຂອງອິນສະແຕນຊ໌ທີ່ມີຢູ່."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/connect-payg.adoc:54
msgid "Click on the instance details."
msgstr "ຄລິກທີ່ລາຍລະອຽດຂອງອິນສະແຕນຊ໌."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/connect-payg.adoc:55
msgid "Select btn:[Delete] and confirm your selection."
msgstr "ເລືອກ btn:[Delete] ແລະ ຢືນຢັນການເລືອກຂອງທ່ານ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/connect-payg.adoc:56
msgid "You are returned to the list of instances."
msgstr "ທ່ານຈະຖືກສົ່ງກັບຄືນໄປທີ່ລາຍຊື່ຂອງອິນສະແຕນຊ໌."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/connect-payg.adoc:57
msgid "The one that was just deleted is no longer shown."
msgstr "ອັນທີ່ຫາກໍ່ລຶບໄປນັ້ນຈະບໍ່ສະແດງໃຫ້ເຫັນອີກ."

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/connect-payg.adoc:58
#, no-wrap
msgid "Instance credential collect status"
msgstr "ສະຖານະການເກັບລວບລວມຂໍ້ມູນປະຈຳຕົວຂອງອິນສະແຕນຊ໌"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/connect-payg.adoc:59
msgid ""
"{productname} server uses credentails collected from the instance to connect "
"to the RMT server and to download the packages using reposync.  These "
"credentials are refreshed every 10 minutes by taskomatic using the defined "
"SSH connection data. Connection to RMT server always uses the last known "
"authentication credentials collected from the {payg} instance."
msgstr "{productname} ເຊີເວີ ໃຊ້ຂໍ້ມູນປະຈຳຕົວທີ່ເກັບມາຈາກອິນສະແຕນຊ໌ ເພື່ອເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ກັບ RMT server ແລະ ເພື່ອດາວໂຫຼດແພັກເກດໂດຍໃຊ້ reposync. ຂໍ້ມູນປະຈຳຕົວເຫຼົ່ານີ້ຈະຖືກຣີເຟຣຊ (refreshed) ທຸກໆ 10 ນາທີ ໂດຍ taskomatic ໂດຍໃຊ້ຂໍ້ມູນການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ SSH ທີ່ກຳນົດໄວ້. ການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ກັບ RMT server ຈະໃຊ້ຂໍ້ມູນປະຈຳຕົວການຢືນຢັນຕົວຕົນຫຼ້າສຸດທີ່ເກັບມາຈາກ {payg} ອິນສະແຕນຊ໌ ສະເໝີ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/connect-payg.adoc:60
msgid ""
"The status of the {payg} instance credentials collect is shown in the column "
"[literal]``Status`` or on the instance details page.  When the instance is "
"not reachable, the credential update process will fail."
msgstr "ສະຖານະຂອງການເກັບລວບລວມຂໍ້ມູນປະຈຳຕົວຂອງ {payg} ອິນສະແຕນຊ໌ ຈະສະແດງໃນຖັນ [literal]``Status`` ຫຼື ໃນໜ້າລາຍລະອຽດຂອງອິນສະແຕນຊ໌. ເມື່ອບໍ່ສາມາດເຂົ້າເຖິງອິນສະແຕນຊ໌ໄດ້, ຂະບວນການອັບເດດຂໍ້ມູນປະຈຳຕົວຈະຫຼົ້ມເຫຼວ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/connect-payg.adoc:61
msgid ""
"When the instance is unreachable, the credential update process will fail "
"and the credentials will become invalid after the second failed refresh.  "
"Synchronization of channels will fail when the credentials are invalid.  To "
"avoid this keep the connected instances running."
msgstr "ເມື່ອອິນສະແຕນຊ໌ບໍ່ສາມາດເຂົ້າເຖິງໄດ້, ຂະບວນການອັບເດດຂໍ້ມູນປະຈຳຕົວຈະຫຼົ້ມເຫຼວ ແລະ ຂໍ້ມູນປະຈຳຕົວຈະກາຍເປັນໃຊ້ບໍ່ໄດ້ ຫຼັງຈາກການຣີເຟຣຊຫຼົ້ມເຫຼວຄັ້ງທີສອງ. ການ Synchronization ຂອງຊ່ອງທາງຈະຫຼົ້ມເຫຼວເມື່ອຂໍ້ມູນປະຈຳຕົວໃຊ້ບໍ່ໄດ້. ເພື່ອຫຼີກເວັ້ນບັນຫານີ້ ໃຫ້ເປີດອິນສະແຕນຊ໌ທີ່ເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ໄວ້ໃຫ້ເຮັດວຽກຢູ່ສະເໝີ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/connect-payg.adoc:62
msgid ""
"{payg} instance remains connected to {productname} server unless SSH "
"connection data is explicitly deleted.  To delete the SSH connection data to "
"the instance, use <<proc-deleting-connection-data-to-instance>>."
msgstr "{payg} ອິນສະແຕນຊ໌ ຈະຍັງຄົງເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ກັບ {productname} ເຊີເວີ ຈົນກວ່າຂໍ້ມູນການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ SSH ຈະຖືກລຶບອອກໂດຍກົງ. ເພື່ອລຶບຂໍ້ມູນການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ SSH ໄປຫາອິນສະແຕນຊ໌, ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ <<proc-deleting-connection-data-to-instance>>."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/connect-payg.adoc:63
msgid ""
"{payg} instance may not be accessible from the {productname} server at all "
"times."
msgstr "{payg} ອິນສະແຕນຊ໌ ອາດຈະບໍ່ສາມາດເຂົ້າເຖິງໄດ້ຈາກ {productname} ເຊີເວີ ຕະຫຼອດເວລາ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/connect-payg.adoc:64
msgid ""
"If the instance exists, but is stopped, the last known credentials will be "
"used to try to connect to the instance."
msgstr "ຫາກອິນສະແຕນຊ໌ມີຢູ່ ແຕ່ຖືກຢຸດໄວ້ (stopped), ຂໍ້ມູນປະຈຳຕົວຫຼ້າສຸດທີ່ຮູ້ຈັກຈະຖືກນຳມາໃຊ້ເພື່ອພະຍາຍາມເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ກັບອິນສະແຕນຊ໌."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/connect-payg.adoc:65
msgid "How long the credentials remain valid depends on the cloud provider."
msgstr "ໄລຍະເວລາທີ່ຂໍ້ມູນປະຈຳຕົວຈະຍັງໃຊ້ໄດ້ນັ້ນ ຂຶ້ນຢູ່ກັບຜູ້ໃຫ້ບໍລິການຄລາວ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/connect-payg.adoc:66
msgid ""
"If the instance no longer exists, but is still registered with SUMA, its "
"credentials are no longer valid and the authentication will fail."
msgstr "ຫາກອິນສະແຕນຊ໌ບໍ່ມີຢູ່ແລ້ວ ແຕ່ຍັງຄົງລົງທະບຽນກັບ SUMA ຢູ່, ຂໍ້ມູນປະຈຳຕົວຂອງມັນຈະບໍ່ສາມາດໃຊ້ໄດ້ອີກຕໍ່ໄປ ແລະ ການຢືນຢັນຕົວຕົນຈະຫຼົ້ມເຫຼວ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/connect-payg.adoc:67
msgid "The error message is shown in the column Status."
msgstr "ຂໍ້ຄວາມຜິດພາດຈະສະແດງຢູ່ໃນຖັນ Status."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/connect-payg.adoc:68
msgid ""
"The error message only indicates that the instance is not available.  "
"Further diagnostics about the status of the instance needs to be done on the "
"cloud provider."
msgstr "ຂໍ້ຄວາມຜິດພາດພຽງແຕ່ບອກວ່າອິນສະແຕນຊ໌ບໍ່ພ້ອມໃຊ້ງານ. ການກວດສອບລາຍລະອຽດເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບສະຖານະຂອງອິນສະແຕນຊ໌ ຕ້ອງເຮັດໃນລະບົບຂອງຜູ້ໃຫ້ບໍລິການຄລາວ."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/connect-payg.adoc:69
msgid ""
"Any of the following actions or changes in the {payg} instance will lead to "
"credentials failing:"
msgstr "ການກະທຳ ຫຼື ການປ່ຽນແປງໃດໆ ຕໍ່ໄປນີ້ໃນ {payg} ອິນສະແຕນຊ໌ ຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ຂໍ້ມູນປະຈຳຕົວຫຼົ້ມເຫຼວ:"

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/connect-payg.adoc:70
msgid "removing zypper credentials files"
msgstr "ການລຶບໄຟລ໌ຂໍ້ມູນປະຈຳຕົວຂອງ zypper"

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/connect-payg.adoc:71
msgid "removing the imported certificates"
msgstr "ການລຶບໃບຮັບຮອງ (certificates) ທີ່ນຳເຂົ້າໄວ້"

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/connect-payg.adoc:72
msgid "removing cloud-specific entries from [path]``/etc/hosts``"
msgstr "ການລຶບລາຍການທີ່ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງກັບຄລາວອອກຈາກ [path]``/etc/hosts``"

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/connect-payg.adoc:73
#, no-wrap
msgid "Registering {payg} system as a client"
msgstr "ການລົງທະບຽນລະບົບ {payg} ເປັນໄຄລແອນ"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/connect-payg.adoc:74
msgid ""
"You can register a {payg} instance from where you harvest the credentials as "
"a {salt} client.  The instance needs to have a valid cloud connection "
"registered, otherwise it will not have access to channels.  If the user "
"removes the cloud packages, the credentials harvesting may stop working."
msgstr "ທ່ານສາມາດລົງທະບຽນ {payg} ອິນສະແຕນຊ໌ (ບ່ອນທີ່ທ່ານເກັບຂໍ້ມູນປະຈຳຕົວມາ) ເປັນໄຄລແອນ {salt} ໄດ້. ອິນສະແຕນຊ໌ຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງມີການລົງທະບຽນການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ຄລາວທີ່ຖືກຕ້ອງ, ຖ້າບໍ່ດັ່ງນັ້ນມັນຈະບໍ່ສາມາດເຂົ້າເຖິງຊ່ອງທາງຕ່າງໆ ໄດ້. ຫາກຜູ້ໃຊ້ລຶບແພັກເກດຄລາວອອກ, ການເກັບຂໍ້ມູນປະຈຳຕົວອາດຈະຢຸດເຮັດວຽກ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/connect-payg.adoc:75
msgid ""
"First set up the {payg} instance to collect authentication data, so it can "
"synchronize the channels."
msgstr "ກ່ອນອື່ນ ໃຫ້ຕັ້ງຄ່າ {payg} ອິນສະແຕນຊ໌ ເພື່ອເກັບລວບລວມຂໍ້ມູນການຢືນຢັນຕົວຕົນ ເພື່ອໃຫ້ມັນສາມາດ synchronize ຊ່ອງທາງຕ່າງໆ ໄດ້."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/connect-payg.adoc:76
msgid ""
"The rest of the process is the same as for any non-public-cloud client and "
"consists of synchronizing channels, automatic bootstrap script creation, "
"activation key creation and starting the registration."
msgstr "ຂະບວນການທີ່ເຫຼືອແມ່ນຄືກັນກັບໄຄລແອນທີ່ບໍ່ແມ່ນພັບບລິກຄລາວທົ່ວໄປ ເຊິ່ງປະກອບດ້ວຍການ synchronize ຊ່ອງທາງ, ການສ້າງ bootstrap script ອັດຕະໂນມັດ, ການສ້າງ activation key ແລະ ເລີ່ມການລົງທະບຽນ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/connect-payg.adoc:77
msgid ""
"For more about registering clients, see "
"xref:client-configuration:registration-overview.adoc[]."
msgstr "ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບການລົງທະບຽນໄຄລແອນ, ເບິ່ງທີ່ xref:client-configuration:registration-overview.adoc[]."

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/connect-payg.adoc:78
#, no-wrap
msgid "Troubleshooting "
msgstr "ການແກ້ໄຂບັນຫາ "

#. type: Labeled list
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/connect-payg.adoc:79
#, no-wrap
msgid "Checking the credentials"
msgstr "ການກວດສອບຂໍ້ມູນປະຈຳຕົວ"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/connect-payg.adoc:80
msgid ""
"If the script fails to collect the credentials, it should provide a proper "
"error message in the logs and in the {webui}."
msgstr "ຫາກ script ຫຼົ້ມເຫຼວໃນການເກັບລວບລວມຂໍ້ມູນປະຈຳຕົວ, ມັນຄວນຈະສະແດງຂໍ້ຄວາມຜິດພາດທີ່ເໝາະສົມໃນ logs ແລະ ໃນ {webui}."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/connect-payg.adoc:81
msgid ""
"If the credentials are not working, [literal]``reposync`` should show the "
"proper error."
msgstr "ຫາກຂໍ້ມູນປະຈຳຕົວໃຊ້ການບໍ່ໄດ້, [literal]``reposync`` ຄວນສະແດງຂໍ້ຜິດພາດທີ່ຖືກຕ້ອງ."

#. type: Labeled list
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/connect-payg.adoc:82
#, no-wrap
msgid "Using [literal]``registercloudguest``"
msgstr "ການໃຊ້ [literal]``registercloudguest``"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/connect-payg.adoc:83
msgid ""
"Refreshing or changing the [literal]``registercloudguest`` connection to the "
"public cloud update infrastructure should not interfere with the credentials "
"usage."
msgstr "ການຣີເຟຣຊ ຫຼື ການປ່ຽນແປງການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ [literal]``registercloudguest`` ກັບໂຄງລ່າງພື້ນຖານການອັບເດດຂອງພັບບລິກຄລາວ ບໍ່ຄວນຈະສົ່ງຜົນກະທົບຕໍ່ການໃຊ້ຂໍ້ມູນປະຈຳຕົວ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/connect-payg.adoc:84
msgid ""
"Running [literal]```registercloudguest --clean`` will cause problems if no "
"new cloud connection is registered with the cloud guest command."
msgstr "ການເປີດໃຊ້ຄຳສັ່ງ [literal]```registercloudguest --clean`` ຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ເກີດບັນຫາ ຫາກບໍ່ມີການລົງທະບຽນການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ຄລາວໃໝ່ດ້ວຍຄຳສັ່ງ cloud guest."

#. type: Title =
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/containerized-proxy-deployment.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Containerized proxy deployment using internal registry"
msgstr "ການຕິດຕັ້ງໃຊ້ງານພຣັອກຊີແບບຄອນເທນເນີ ໂດຍໃຊ້ internal registry"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/containerized-proxy-deployment.adoc:2
msgid ""
"It is possible to deploy containerized images in an environment without an "
"internet connection.  In such case, the images can be copied from {suse} "
"registry to an internal registry, or saved to a [literal]``tar`` file."
msgstr "ມັນເປັນໄປໄດ້ທີ່ຈະຕິດຕັ້ງໃຊ້ງານ containerized images ໃນສະພາບແວດລ້ອມທີ່ບໍ່ມີການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ອິນເຕີເນັດ. ໃນກໍລະນີດັ່ງກ່າວ, ສາມາດກັອບປີ້ images ຈາກ {suse} registry ໄປຫາ internal registry ຫຼື ບັນທຶກເປັນໄຟລ໌ [literal]``tar``."

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/containerized-proxy-deployment.adoc:3
#, no-wrap
msgid "Image copying from {suse} registry to internal registry "
msgstr "ການກັອບປີ້ image ຈາກ {suse} registry ໄປຫາ internal registry "

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/containerized-proxy-deployment.adoc:4
msgid "This example illustrates deployment of {salt} proxies only."
msgstr "ຕົວຢ່າງນີ້ສະແດງເຖິງການຕິດຕັ້ງໃຊ້ງານ {salt} proxies ເທົ່ານັ້ນ."

#. type: Block title
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/containerized-proxy-deployment.adoc:5
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Deploying {salt} Proxy from an internal image registry"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການຕິດຕັ້ງໃຊ້ງານ {salt} Proxy ຈາກ internal image registry"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/containerized-proxy-deployment.adoc:6
msgid ""
"On a machine with access to [literal]``registry.suse.com`` install "
"[literal]``skopeo``:"
msgstr "ໃນເຄື່ອງທີ່ສາມາດເຂົ້າເຖິງ [literal]``registry.suse.com`` ໄດ້ ໃຫ້ຕິດຕັ້ງ [literal]``skopeo``:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/containerized-proxy-deployment.adoc:7
#, no-wrap
msgid "zypper in skopeo\n"
msgstr "zypper in skopeo\n"

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/containerized-proxy-deployment.adoc:8
msgid "This can be {productname} Server."
msgstr "ເຄື່ອງນີ້ອາດຈະເປັນ {productname} ເຊີເວີ ກໍ່ໄດ້."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/containerized-proxy-deployment.adoc:9
msgid "Copy images between registries:"
msgstr "ກັອບປີ້ images ລະຫວ່າງ registries:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/containerized-proxy-deployment.adoc:10
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"for image in httpd salt-broker squid ssh tftpd; do\n"
"    skopeo copy "
"docker://registry.suse.com/suse/manager/4.3/proxy-$image:latest "
"docker://<your_server>/registry.suse.com/suse/manager/4.3/proxy-$image\n"
"done\n"
"skopeo copy docker://k8s.gcr.io/pause:latest "
"docker://<your_server>/k8s.gcr.io/pause:latest\n"
msgstr ""
"for image in httpd salt-broker squid ssh tftpd; do\n"
"    skopeo copy docker://registry.suse.com/suse/manager/4.3/proxy-$image:latest docker://<your_server>/registry.suse.com/suse/manager/4.3/proxy-$image\n"
"done\n"
"skopeo copy docker://k8s.gcr.io/pause:latest docker://<your_server>/k8s.gcr.io/pause:latest\n"

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/containerized-proxy-deployment.adoc:11
msgid ""
"For every [literal]``skopeo`` command add "
"[literal]``--dest-tls-verify=false`` if the registry is not secured."
msgstr "ສຳລັບທຸກໆ ຄຳສັ່ງ [literal]``skopeo`` ໃຫ້ຕື່ມ [literal]``--dest-tls-verify=false`` ຫາກ registry ນັ້ນບໍ່ປອດໄພ (ບໍ່ມີ SSL)."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/containerized-proxy-deployment.adoc:12
msgid ""
"If the registry is unsecured, for example not configured with SSL, add the "
"registry domain to the section [literal]``registries.insecure`` on the "
"containerized proxy virtual machine by editing:"
msgstr "ຫາກ registry ບໍ່ປອດໄພ, ຕົວຢ່າງເຊັ່ນ ບໍ່ໄດ້ຕັ້ງຄ່າ SSL, ໃຫ້ເພີ່ມ registry domain ເຂົ້າໃນພາກສ່ວນ [literal]``registries.insecure`` ໃນ containerized proxy virtual machine ໂດຍການແກ້ໄຂໄຟລ໌:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/containerized-proxy-deployment.adoc:13
#, no-wrap
msgid "/etc/containers/registries.conf\n"
msgstr "/etc/containers/registries.conf\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/containerized-proxy-deployment.adoc:14
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/containerized-proxy-deployment.adoc:21
msgid ""
"Before starting the pod, point the Podman where to get the "
"[literal]``pause`` image from on the internal registry:"
msgstr "ກ່ອນທີ່ຈະເລີ່ມ pod, ໃຫ້ບອກ Podman ວ່າຈະໄປເອົາ [literal]``pause`` image ມາຈາກໃສໃນ internal registry:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/containerized-proxy-deployment.adoc:15
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/containerized-proxy-deployment.adoc:22
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"echo -e '[engine]\\ninfra_image = "
"\"<your_server>/pause:latest\"'>>/etc/containers/containers.conf\n"
msgstr ""
"echo -e '[engine]\\n"
"infra_image = \"<your_server>/pause:latest\"'>>/etc/containers/containers.conf\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/containerized-proxy-deployment.adoc:16
msgid ""
"To start using the images from the internal registry please adapt the "
"[literal]``NAMESPACE`` value in file "
"`/etc/sysconfig/uyuni-proxy-systemd-services.config`."
msgstr "ເພື່ອເລີ່ມໃຊ້ງານ images ຈາກ internal registry ໃຫ້ປັບປ່ຽນຄ່າ [literal]``NAMESPACE`` ໃນໄຟລ໌ `/etc/sysconfig/uyuni-proxy-systemd-services.config`."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/containerized-proxy-deployment.adoc:17
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/containerized-proxy-deployment.adoc:27
msgid ""
"For the k3s deployment, add [literal]``--set repository=<your_server>`` to "
"the helm install command line."
msgstr "ສຳລັບການຕິດຕັ້ງໃຊ້ງານ k3s, ໃຫ້ຕື່ມ [literal]``--set repository=<your_server>`` ເຂົ້າໃນຄຳສັ່ງ helm install."

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/containerized-proxy-deployment.adoc:18
#, no-wrap
msgid "Air-gapped solution for Podman"
msgstr "ວິທີແກ້ໄຂແບບ Air-gapped ສຳລັບ Podman"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/containerized-proxy-deployment.adoc:19
msgid ""
"This example illustrates deployment of containerized image on a machine with "
"no access to internet."
msgstr "ຕົວຢ່າງນີ້ສະແດງເຖິງການຕິດຕັ້ງໃຊ້ງານ containerized image ໃນເຄື່ອງທີ່ບໍ່ສາມາດເຂົ້າເຖິງອິນເຕີເນັດໄດ້."

#. type: Block title
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/containerized-proxy-deployment.adoc:20
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Deploying air-gapped proxy"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການຕິດຕັ້ງໃຊ້ງານ air-gapped proxy"

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/containerized-proxy-deployment.adoc:23
msgid "This command does not work on SLE 15 SP3 and earlier container hosts."
msgstr "ຄຳສັ່ງນີ້ບໍ່ສາມາດໃຊ້ໄດ້ກັບ SLE 15 SP3 ແລະ container hosts ເວີຊັນກ່ອນໜ້ານັ້ນ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/containerized-proxy-deployment.adoc:24
msgid "On a machine with internet access run:"
msgstr "ໃນເຄື່ອງທີ່ສາມາດເຂົ້າເຖິງອິນເຕີເນັດໄດ້ ໃຫ້ເປີດໃຊ້ຄຳສັ່ງ:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/containerized-proxy-deployment.adoc:25
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"for image in httpd salt-broker squid ssh tftpd; do\n"
"    podman pull registry.suse.com/suse/manager/4.3/proxy-$image\n"
"done\n"
"podman pull k8s.gcr.io/pause\n"
msgstr ""
"for image in httpd salt-broker squid ssh tftpd; do\n"
"    podman pull registry.suse.com/suse/manager/4.3/proxy-$image\n"
"done\n"
"podman pull k8s.gcr.io/pause\n"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/containerized-proxy-deployment.adoc:26
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"podman save -m -o proxy-images.tar \\\n"
"    k8s.gcr.io/pause \\\n"
"    registry.suse.com/suse/manager/4.3/proxy-httpd \\\n"
"    registry.suse.com/suse/manager/4.3/proxy-salt-broker \\\n"
"    registry.suse.com/suse/manager/4.3/proxy-squid \\\n"
"    registry.suse.com/suse/manager/4.3/proxy-ssh \\\n"
"    registry.suse.com/suse/manager/4.3/proxy-tftpd\n"
msgstr ""
"podman save -m -o proxy-images.tar \\\n"
"    k8s.gcr.io/pause \\\n"
"    registry.suse.com/suse/manager/4.3/proxy-httpd \\\n"
"    registry.suse.com/suse/manager/4.3/proxy-salt-broker \\\n"
"    registry.suse.com/suse/manager/4.3/proxy-squid \\\n"
"    registry.suse.com/suse/manager/4.3/proxy-ssh \\\n"
"    registry.suse.com/suse/manager/4.3/proxy-tftpd\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/containerized-proxy-deployment.adoc:28
msgid "Transfer the [literal]``proxy-images.tar`` to the air-gapped proxy."
msgstr "ສົ່ງໄຟລ໌ [literal]``proxy-images.tar`` ໄປຫາ air-gapped proxy."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/containerized-proxy-deployment.adoc:29
msgid "To make images available to be started when needed, run the command:"
msgstr "ເພື່ອໃຫ້ images ພ້ອມທີ່ຈະເລີ່ມໃຊ້ງານໄດ້ເມື່ອຕ້ອງການ, ໃຫ້ເປີດໃຊ້ຄຳສັ່ງ:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/containerized-proxy-deployment.adoc:30
#, no-wrap
msgid "podman load -i proxy-images.tar\n"
msgstr "podman load -i proxy-images.tar\n"

#. type: Title =
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/db-intro.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Upgrade the Database"
msgstr "ອັບເກຣດຖານຂໍ້ມູນ"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/db-intro.adoc:2
msgid ""
"To successfully perform a major {productname} update, you might need to "
"upgrade the underlying database."
msgstr "ເພື່ອໃຫ້ການອັບເດດ {productname} ເວີຊັນຫຼັກສຳເລັດ, ທ່ານອາດຈະຕ້ອງອັບເກຣດຖານຂໍ້ມູນທີ່ໃຊ້ຢູ່."

