#. type: Title =
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/db-migration-xy.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Database Migration to Latest Version"
msgstr "ການຍ້າຍຖານຂໍ້ມູນໄປຫາເວີຊັນຫຼ້າສຸດ"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/db-migration-xy.adoc:2
msgid ""
"This section covers upgrading the PostgreSQL database to the latest "
"version.  If you are already using PostgreSQL 14, you do not need to perform "
"this migration."
msgstr "ພາກສ່ວນນີ້ກວມເອົາການອັບເກຣດຖານຂໍ້ມູນ PostgreSQL ໄປຫາເວີຊັນຫຼ້າສຸດ. ຫາກທ່ານໃຊ້ PostgreSQL 14 ຢູ່ແລ້ວ, ທ່ານບໍ່ຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງເຮັດການຍ້າຍຂໍ້ມູນນີ້."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/db-migration-xy.adoc:3
msgid ""
"If you want to upgrade to the latest {productname} version, you must be "
"using PostgreSQL version 13 or 14, depending on the underlying operating "
"system:"
msgstr "ຫາກທ່ານຕ້ອງການອັບເກຣດເປັນ {productname} ເວີຊັນຫຼ້າສຸດ, ທ່ານຕ້ອງໃຊ້ PostgreSQL ເວີຊັນ 13 ຫຼື 14, ເຊິ່ງຂຶ້ນຢູ່ກັບລະບົບປະຕິບັດການທີ່ໃຊ້ຢູ່:"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/db-migration-xy.adoc:4
msgid "If you are running {sles} 15 SP3, use PostgreSQL 13."
msgstr "ຫາກທ່ານກຳລັງໃຊ້ {sles} 15 SP3, ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ PostgreSQL 13."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/db-migration-xy.adoc:5
msgid "If you are running {sles} 15 SP4, use PostgreSQL 14."
msgstr "ຫາກທ່ານກຳລັງໃຊ້ {sles} 15 SP4, ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ PostgreSQL 14."

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/db-migration-xy.adoc:6
#, no-wrap
msgid "Prepare to Upgrade"
msgstr "ການກຽມຕົວເພື່ອອັບເກຣດ"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/db-migration-xy.adoc:7
msgid ""
"Before you begin the upgrade, prepare your existing {productname} Server and "
"create a database backup."
msgstr "ກ່ອນທີ່ທ່ານຈະເລີ່ມການອັບເກຣດ, ໃຫ້ກຽມ {productname} ເຊີເວີ ທີ່ມີຢູ່ຂອງທ່ານ ແລະ ສ້າງການສຳຮອງຂໍ້ມູນຖານຂໍ້ມູນ (database backup)."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/db-migration-xy.adoc:8
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/db-migration-xy.adoc:21
msgid "PostgreSQL stores data at [path]``/var/lib/pgsql/data/``."
msgstr "PostgreSQL ເກັບຂໍ້ມູນໄວ້ທີ່ [path]``/var/lib/pgsql/data/``."

#. type: Block title
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/db-migration-xy.adoc:9
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Preparing to Upgrade"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການກຽມຕົວເພື່ອອັບເກຣດ"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/db-migration-xy.adoc:10
msgid "Check the active PostgreSQL version:"
msgstr "ກວດສອບເວີຊັນ PostgreSQL ທີ່ກຳລັງໃຊ້ງານຢູ່:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/db-migration-xy.adoc:11
#, no-wrap
msgid "psql --version\n"
msgstr "psql --version\n"

#. If you are using PostgreSQL{nbsp}10 or 12, you can upgrade to PostgreSQL{nbsp}13.
#. If you are already using PostgreSQL version 13, you do not need to perform this migration.
#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/db-migration-xy.adoc:12
msgid "Check the active smdba version:"
msgstr "ກວດສອບເວີຊັນ smdba ທີ່ກຳລັງໃຊ້ງານຢູ່:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/db-migration-xy.adoc:13
#, no-wrap
msgid "rpm -q smdba\n"
msgstr "rpm -q smdba\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/db-migration-xy.adoc:14
msgid "PostgreSQL{nbsp}14 requires ``smdba`` version 1.7.6 or later."
msgstr "PostgreSQL{nbsp}14 ຕ້ອງການ ``smdba`` ເວີຊັນ 1.7.6 ຫຼື ໃໝ່ກວ່າ."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/db-migration-xy.adoc:15
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/db-migration-xy.adoc:25
msgid ""
"Perform a database backup.  For more information on backing up, see "
"xref:administration:backup-restore.adoc[]."
msgstr "ເຮັດການສຳຮອງຂໍ້ມູນຖານຂໍ້ມູນ. ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບການສຳຮອງຂໍ້ມູນ, ເບິ່ງທີ່ xref:administration:backup-restore.adoc[]."

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/db-migration-xy.adoc:16
#, no-wrap
msgid "Upgrade PostgreSQL"
msgstr "ອັບເກຣດ PostgreSQL"

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/db-migration-xy.adoc:17
msgid "Always create a database backup before performing a migration."
msgstr "ສ້າງການສຳຮອງຂໍ້ມູນຖານຂໍ້ມູນສະເໝີ ກ່ອນທີ່ຈະເຮັດການຍ້າຍຂໍ້ມູນ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/db-migration-xy.adoc:18
msgid ""
"PostgreSQL upgrades can be performed in two ways: a regular upgrade, or a "
"fast upgrade:"
msgstr "ການອັບເກຣດ PostgreSQL ສາມາດເຮັດໄດ້ສອງວິທີ: ການອັບເກຣດແບບປົກກະຕິ (regular upgrade), ຫຼື ການອັບເກຣດແບບໄວ (fast upgrade):"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/db-migration-xy.adoc:19
msgid ""
"A regular upgrade creates a complete copy of the database, so you need "
"double the existing database size of space available.  Regular upgrades can "
"take a considerable amount of time, depending on the size of the database "
"and the speed of the storage system."
msgstr "ການອັບເກຣດແບບປົກກະຕິຈະສ້າງຖານຂໍ້ມູນສຳເນົາຄົບຊຸດ, ດັ່ງນັ້ນທ່ານຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງມີພື້ນທີ່ວ່າງສອງເທົ່າຂອງຂະໜາດຖານຂໍ້ມູນທີ່ມີຢູ່. ການອັບເກຣດແບບປົກກະຕິອາດຈະໃຊ້ເວລາດົນ, ເຊິ່ງຂຶ້ນຢູ່ກັບຂະໜາດຂອງຖານຂໍ້ມູນ ແລະ ຄວາມໄວຂອງລະບົບເກັບຂໍ້ມູນ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/db-migration-xy.adoc:20
msgid ""
"A fast upgrade only takes a few minutes, and uses almost no additional disk "
"space.  However, if a fast upgrade fails, you must restore the database from "
"the backup.  A fast upgrade reduces the risk of running out of disk space, "
"but increases the risk of data lose when a backup does not exist or cannot "
"be replayed.  A regular upgrade will copy the database files instead of "
"creating hard links between the files."
msgstr "ການອັບເກຣດແບບໄວຈະໃຊ້ເວລາພຽງສອງສາມນາທີ ແລະ ແທບຈະບໍ່ໃຊ້ພື້ນທີ່ດິສກ໌ເພີ່ມເຕີມ. ແນວໃດກໍ່ຕາມ, ຫາກການອັບເກຣດແບບໄວຫຼົ້ມເຫຼວ, ທ່ານຕ້ອງກູ້ຄືນຖານຂໍ້ມູນຈາກການສຳຮອງຂໍ້ມູນ. ການອັບເກຣດແບບໄວຊ່ວຍຫຼຸດຄວາມສ່ຽງຂອງພື້ນທີ່ດິສກ໌ເຕັມ, ແຕ່ເພີ່ມຄວາມສ່ຽງຂອງການສູນເສຍຂໍ້ມູນຫາກບໍ່ມີການສຳຮອງຂໍ້ມູນ ຫຼື ບໍ່ສາມາດນຳຂໍ້ມູນສຳຮອງມາກູ້ຄືນໄດ້. ການອັບເກຣດແບບປົກກະຕິຈະກັອບປີ້ໄຟລ໌ຖານຂໍ້ມູນແທນທີ່ຈະສ້າງ hard links ລະຫວ່າງໄຟລ໌."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/db-migration-xy.adoc:22
msgid ""
"Before running the DB upgrade make sure that the PostgreSQL user exists on "
"the system.  The [path]``/etc/passwd`` entry should look as follows:"
msgstr "ກ່ອນທີ່ຈະເປີດໃຊ້ການອັບເກຣດ DB ໃຫ້ໝັ້ນໃຈວ່າຜູ້ໃຊ້ PostgreSQL ມີຢູ່ໃນລະບົບ. ລາຍການໃນ [path]``/etc/passwd`` ຄວນມີລັກສະນະດັ່ງນີ້:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/db-migration-xy.adoc:23
#, no-wrap
msgid "postgres:x:26:26:PostgreSQL Server:/var/lib/pgsql:/bin/bash\n"
msgstr "postgres:x:26:26:PostgreSQL Server:/var/lib/pgsql:/bin/bash\n"

#. type: Block title
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/db-migration-xy.adoc:24
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Performing a Regular Upgrade"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການເຮັດການອັບເກຣດແບບປົກກະຕິ"

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/db-migration-xy.adoc:26
msgid "Start the upgrade.  Run the script:"
msgstr "ເລີ່ມການອັບເກຣດ. ເປີດໃຊ້ script:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/db-migration-xy.adoc:27
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/server-major-upgrade-uyuni.adoc:13
#, no-wrap
msgid "/usr/lib/susemanager/bin/pg-migrate-x-to-y.sh\n"
msgstr "/usr/lib/susemanager/bin/pg-migrate-x-to-y.sh\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/db-migration-xy.adoc:28
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/db-migration-xy.adoc:42
msgid ""
"When the upgrade has successfully completed, you can safely delete the old "
"database directory and reclaim lost disk space.  The old directory is "
"renamed to [path]``/var/lib/pgsql/data-pg12`` or "
"[path]``/var/lib/pgsql/data-pg10``, depending on the version you started "
"from."
msgstr "ເມື່ອການອັບເກຣດສຳເລັດແລ້ວ, ທ່ານສາມາດລຶບໄດເຣັກທໍຣີຖານຂໍ້ມູນເກົ່າໄດ້ຢ່າງປອດໄພເພື່ອເອົາພື້ນທີ່ດິສກ໌ຄືນມາ. ໄດເຣັກທໍຣີເກົ່າຈະຖືກປ່ຽນຊື່ເປັນ [path]``/var/lib/pgsql/data-pg12`` ຫຼື [path]``/var/lib/pgsql/data-pg10``, ຂຶ້ນຢູ່ກັບເວີຊັນທີ່ທ່ານເລີ່ມຕົ້ນມາ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/db-migration-xy.adoc:29
msgid "The [path]``pg-migrate-x-to-y.sh`` script performs these operations:"
msgstr "script [path]``pg-migrate-x-to-y.sh`` ຈະເຮັດໜ້າທີ່ດັ່ງນີ້:"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/db-migration-xy.adoc:30
msgid "Stop spacewalk services"
msgstr "ຢຸດການບໍລິການ spacewalk"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/db-migration-xy.adoc:31
msgid "Shut down the running database"
msgstr "ປິດຖານຂໍ້ມູນທີ່ກຳລັງເຮັດວຽກຢູ່"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/db-migration-xy.adoc:32
msgid "Check if the latest PostgreSQL is installed and install it if necessary"
msgstr "ກວດສອບວ່າໄດ້ຕິດຕັ້ງ PostgreSQL ເວີຊັນຫຼ້າສຸດແລ້ວຫຼືບໍ່ ແລະ ຕິດຕັ້ງຫາກຈຳເປັນ"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/db-migration-xy.adoc:33
msgid ""
"Switch from previous version of PostgreSQL{nbsp} to the latest as the new "
"default"
msgstr "ປ່ຽນຈາກ PostgreSQL ເວີຊັນກ່ອນໜ້າ ໄປຫາເວີຊັນຫຼ້າສຸດໃຫ້ເປັນຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນໃໝ່"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/db-migration-xy.adoc:34
msgid "Initiate the database migration"
msgstr "ເລີ່ມການຍ້າຍຖານຂໍ້ມູນ"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/db-migration-xy.adoc:35
msgid "Create a PostgreSQL configuration file tuned for use by {productname}"
msgstr "ສ້າງໄຟລ໌ກຳນົດຄ່າ PostgreSQL ທີ່ປັບແຕ່ງມາສຳລັບການໃຊ້ງານໂດຍ {productname}"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/db-migration-xy.adoc:36
msgid "Start the database and spacewalk services"
msgstr "ເລີ່ມການບໍລິການຖານຂໍ້ມູນ ແລະ spacewalk"

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/db-migration-xy.adoc:37
msgid ""
"If the upgrade fails, the migration script will attempt to restore the "
"database to its original state."
msgstr "ຫາກການອັບເກຣດຫຼົ້ມເຫຼວ, script ການຍ້າຍຂໍ້ມູນຈະພະຍາຍາມກູ້ຄືນຖານຂໍ້ມູນກັບໄປສູ່ສະພາບເດີມ."

#. type: Block title
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/db-migration-xy.adoc:38
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Performing a Fast PostgreSQL Upgrade"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການເຮັດການອັບເກຣດ PostgreSQL ແບບໄວ"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/db-migration-xy.adoc:39
msgid ""
"Perform a database backup.  Without a verified database backup, you must not "
"initiate a fast upgrade.  For more information on backing up, see "
"xref:administration:backup-restore.adoc[]."
msgstr "ເຮັດການສຳຮອງຂໍ້ມູນຖານຂໍ້ມູນ. ຫາກບໍ່ມີການສຳຮອງຂໍ້ມູນຖານຂໍ້ມູນທີ່ໄດ້ຮັບການຢືນຢັນແລ້ວ, ທ່ານຕ້ອງບໍ່ເລີ່ມການອັບເກຣດແບບໄວ. ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບການສຳຮອງຂໍ້ມູນ, ເບິ່ງທີ່ xref:administration:backup-restore.adoc[]."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/db-migration-xy.adoc:40
msgid "Start the upgrade.  Run the script."
msgstr "ເລີ່ມການອັບເກຣດ. ເປີດໃຊ້ script."

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/db-migration-xy.adoc:41
#, no-wrap
msgid "/usr/lib/susemanager/bin/pg-migrate-x-to-y.sh -f\n"
msgstr "/usr/lib/susemanager/bin/pg-migrate-x-to-y.sh -f\n"

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/db-migration-xy.adoc:43
msgid ""
"After a successful database migration, the old version of the {postgresql} "
"database software is no longer needed."
msgstr "ຫຼັງຈາກການຍ້າຍຖານຂໍ້ມູນສຳເລັດແລ້ວ, ຊອບແວຖານຂໍ້ມູນ {postgresql} ເວີຊັນເກົ່າແມ່ນບໍ່ຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງໃຊ້ອີກຕໍ່ໄປ."

#. type: Title =
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/general-requirements.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "General Requirements"
msgstr "ຂໍ້ກຳນົດທົ່ວໄປ"

#.  REMARK this list needs to be cleaned up
#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/general-requirements.adoc:2
msgid "Before you begin installation, ensure that you have:"
msgstr "ກ່ອນທີ່ທ່ານຈະເລີ່ມການຕິດຕັ້ງ, ໃຫ້ໝັ້ນໃຈວ່າທ່ານມີ:"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/general-requirements.adoc:3
msgid "Current {scc} organization credentials"
msgstr "ຂໍ້ມູນປະຈຳຕົວຂອງອົງກອນ {scc} ໃນປັດຈຸບັນ"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/general-requirements.adoc:4
msgid "Access to installation media"
msgstr "ການເຂົ້າເຖິງສື່ການຕິດຕັ້ງ"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/general-requirements.adoc:5
msgid "Environment meets the hardware and networking requirements"
msgstr "ສະພາບແວດລ້ອມທີ່ກົງຕາມຂໍ້ກຳນົດດ້ານຮາດແວ ແລະ ເຄືອຂ່າຍ"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/general-requirements.adoc:6
msgid "Any required SSL certificates for your environment"
msgstr "ໃບຮັບຮອງ SSL ໃດໆ ທີ່ຈຳເປັນສຳລັບສະພາບແວດລ້ອມຂອງທ່ານ"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/general-requirements.adoc:7
msgid "This section contains more information on each of these requirements."
msgstr "ພາກສ່ວນນີ້ມີຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບແຕ່ລະຂໍ້ກຳນົດເຫຼົ່ານີ້."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/general-requirements.adoc:8
msgid ""
"For a complete list of supported clients and features, see "
"xref:client-configuration:supported-features.adoc[]."
msgstr "ສຳລັບລາຍຊື່ໄຄລແອນ ແລະ ຄຸນສົມບັດທີ່ຮອງຮັບທັງໝົດ, ເບິ່ງທີ່ xref:client-configuration:supported-features.adoc[]."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/general-requirements.adoc:9
msgid ""
"{productname} {productnumber} is based on SLES {sles-version} {sp-base} as "
"the host operating system.  {productname} comes with a maintenance lifecycle "
"of two years.  For more information, see "
"link:https://www.suse.com/lifecycle/[]."
msgstr "{productname} {productnumber} ອີງໃສ່ SLES {sles-version} {sp-base} ເປັນລະບົບປະຕິບັດການຫຼັກ. {productname} ມາພ້ອມກັບວົງຈອນຊີວິດການບຳລຸງຮັກສາສອງປີ. ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມ, ເບິ່ງທີ່ link:https://www.suse.com/lifecycle/[]."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/general-requirements.adoc:10
msgid ""
"Long Term Service Pack Support (LTSS) for {sles-version} cannot be added to "
"{productname}.  It is also not possible to use SLES for SAP as a base for "
"{productname} to increase the lifecycle of the underlying operating system."
msgstr "ບໍ່ສາມາດເພີ່ມ Long Term Service Pack Support (LTSS) ສຳລັບ {sles-version} ເຂົ້າໃນ {productname} ໄດ້. ນອກຈາກນີ້ ຍັງບໍ່ສາມາດໃຊ້ SLES for SAP ເປັນພື້ນຖານສຳລັບ {productname} ເພື່ອເພີ່ມວົງຈອນຊີວິດຂອງລະບົບປະຕິບັດການທີ່ໃຊ້ຢູ່ໄດ້."

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/general-requirements.adoc:11
#, no-wrap
msgid "Obtain Your SUSE Customer Center Credentials"
msgstr "ການຮັບຂໍ້ມູນປະຈຳຕົວ SUSE Customer Center ຂອງທ່ານ"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/general-requirements.adoc:12
msgid ""
"Create an account with {scc} before installation of {sles} and "
"{productname}."
msgstr "ສ້າງບັນຊີກັບ {scc} ກ່ອນການຕິດຕັ້ງ {sles} ແລະ {productname}."

#. type: Block title
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/general-requirements.adoc:13
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Obtaining Your SCC Organization Credentials"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການຮັບຂໍ້ມູນປະຈຳຕົວຂອງອົງກອນ SCC ຂອງທ່ານ"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/general-requirements.adoc:14
msgid "Navigate to https://scc.suse.com/login in your Web browser."
msgstr "ໄປທີ່ https://scc.suse.com/login ໃນເວັບບຣາວເຊີຂອງທ່ານ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/general-requirements.adoc:15
msgid "Log in to your SCC account, or follow the prompts to create a new account."
msgstr "ເຂົ້າສູ່ລະບົບ SCC ຂອງທ່ານ, ຫຼື ເຮັດຕາມຂັ້ນຕອນເພື່ອສ້າງບັນຊີໃໝ່."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/general-requirements.adoc:16
msgid ""
"If you have not yet done so, click btn:[Connect to an Organization] and type "
"or search for your organization."
msgstr "ຫາກທ່ານຍັງບໍ່ທັນໄດ້ເຮັດ, ໃຫ້ຄລິກ btn:[Connect to an Organization] ແລະ ພິມ ຫຼື ຄົ້ນຫາອົງກອນຂອງທ່ານ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/general-requirements.adoc:17
msgid ""
"Click btn:[Manage my Organizations] and select your organization from the "
"list by clicking on the organization name."
msgstr "ຄລິກ btn:[Manage my Organizations] ແລະ ເລືອກອົງກອນຂອງທ່ານຈາກລາຍຊື່ໂດຍການຄລິກທີ່ຊື່ອົງກອນ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/general-requirements.adoc:18
msgid ""
"Click the btn:[Organization] tab, and then select the btn:[Organization "
"Credentials] tab."
msgstr "ຄລິກທີ່ແຖບ btn:[Organization], ແລ້ວເລືອກແຖບ btn:[Organization Credentials]."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/general-requirements.adoc:19
msgid "Record your login information for use during {productname} setup."
msgstr "ບັນທຶກຂໍ້ມູນການເຂົ້າສູ່ລະບົບຂອງທ່ານໄວ້ເພື່ອໃຊ້ໃນລະຫວ່າງການຕັ້ງຄ່າ {productname}."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/general-requirements.adoc:20
msgid ""
"Depending on your organization's setup, you might also need to activate your "
"subscription, using the btn:[Activate Subscriptions] menu."
msgstr "ອີງຕາມການຕັ້ງຄ່າຂອງອົງກອນຂອງທ່ານ, ທ່ານອາດຈະຕ້ອງເປີດໃຊ້ການສະໝັກໃຊ້ (subscription) ຂອງທ່ານ ໂດຍໃຊ້ເມນູ btn:[Activate Subscriptions]."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/general-requirements.adoc:21
msgid "For more information about using SCC, see https://scc.suse.com/docs/help."
msgstr "ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບການໃຊ້ SCC, ເບິ່ງທີ່ https://scc.suse.com/docs/help."

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/general-requirements.adoc:22
#, no-wrap
msgid "{unifiedinstaller}"
msgstr "{unifiedinstaller}"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/general-requirements.adoc:23
msgid "{susemgr} Server and Proxy are installed with the {sle} {unifiedinstaller}."
msgstr "{susemgr} ເຊີເວີ ແລະ ພຣັອກຊີ ແມ່ນຖືກຕິດຕັ້ງດ້ວຍ {sle} {unifiedinstaller}."

#. REMARK What about Uyuni?
#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/general-requirements.adoc:24
msgid ""
"You only require a valid registration code for {productname}, for example "
"from a \"SUSE Manager Lifecycle Management+\" subscription.  For more "
"information, see SUSE Terms and Conditions at "
"https://www.suse.com/products/terms_and_conditions.pdf.  You do not require "
"a separate code for SLES{nbsp}{sles-version} {sp-base}."
msgstr "ທ່ານພຽງແຕ່ຕ້ອງການລະຫັດລົງທະບຽນທີ່ຖືກຕ້ອງສຳລັບ {productname}, ຕົວຢ່າງເຊັ່ນ ຈາກການສະໝັກໃຊ້ \"SUSE Manager Lifecycle Management+\". ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມ, ເບິ່ງທີ່ຂໍ້ກຳນົດ ແລະ ເງື່ອນໄຂຂອງ SUSE ທີ່ https://www.suse.com/products/terms_and_conditions.pdf. ທ່ານບໍ່ຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງມີລະຫັດແຍກຕ່າງຫາກສຳລັບ SLES{nbsp}{sles-version} {sp-base}."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/general-requirements.adoc:25
msgid ""
"If not already done, download the {sle} {unifiedinstaller} from "
"https://download.suse.com."
msgstr "ຫາກຍັງບໍ່ທັນໄດ້ເຮັດ, ໃຫ້ດາວໂຫຼດ {sle} {unifiedinstaller} ຈາກ https://download.suse.com."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/general-requirements.adoc:26
msgid ""
"Direct link to {sle} {sles-version} {sp-base}, required to install SUSE "
"Manager https://www.suse.com/download/suse-manager."
msgstr "ລິ້ງໂດຍກົງໄປຫາ {sle} {sles-version} {sp-base}, ທີ່ຈຳເປັນສຳລັບການຕິດຕັ້ງ SUSE Manager https://www.suse.com/download/suse-manager."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/general-requirements.adoc:27
msgid ""
"For a later version or a different architecture, such as {ibmz}, select the "
"respective item.  With the {unifiedinstaller} you can install many SLE-based "
"base products such as SLES, SLES for SAP Applications, or {susemgr}."
msgstr "ສຳລັບເວີຊັນໃໝ່ກວ່າ ຫຼື ສະຖາປັດຕະຍະກຳທີ່ແຕກຕ່າງ ເຊັ່ນ {ibmz}, ໃຫ້ເລືອກລາຍການທີ່ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງ. ດ້ວຍ {unifiedinstaller} ທ່ານສາມາດຕິດຕັ້ງຜະລິດຕະພັນພື້ນຖານທີ່ອີງໃສ່ SLE ໄດ້ຫຼາຍຢ່າງ ເຊັ່ນ SLES, SLES for SAP Applications, ຫຼື {susemgr}."

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/general-requirements.adoc:28
#, no-wrap
msgid "Supported Browsers for the {susemgr} {webui}"
msgstr "ບຣາວເຊີທີ່ຮອງຮັບສຳລັບ {susemgr} {webui}"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/general-requirements.adoc:29
msgid ""
"In order to use the {webui} to manage your {susemgr} environment, you will "
"need to ensure you are running an up to date web browser."
msgstr "ເພື່ອທີ່ຈະໃຊ້ {webui} ໃນການຈັດການສະພາບແວດລ້ອມ {susemgr} ຂອງທ່ານ, ທ່ານຕ້ອງໝັ້ນໃຈວ່າທ່ານກຳລັງໃຊ້ເວັບບຣາວເຊີທີ່ທັນສະໄໝ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/general-requirements.adoc:30
msgid "{susemgr} is supported on:"
msgstr "{susemgr} ໄດ້ຮັບການຮອງຮັບໃນ:"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/general-requirements.adoc:31
msgid "Latest Firefox browser shipped with {sles}"
msgstr "ບຣາວເຊີ Firefox ເວີຊັນຫຼ້າສຸດທີ່ມາກັບ {sles}"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/general-requirements.adoc:32
msgid "Latest Chrome browser on all operating systems"
msgstr "ບຣາວເຊີ Chrome ເວີຊັນຫຼ້າສຸດໃນທຸກລະບົບປະຕິບັດການ"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/general-requirements.adoc:33
msgid "Latest Edge browser shipped with Windows"
msgstr "ບຣາວເຊີ Edge ເວີຊັນຫຼ້າສຸດທີ່ມາກັບ Windows"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/general-requirements.adoc:34
msgid ""
"Windows Internet Explorer is not supported.  The {productname} {webui} will "
"not render correctly under Windows Internet Explorer."
msgstr "Windows Internet Explorer ແມ່ນບໍ່ໄດ້ຮັບການຮອງຮັບ. {productname} {webui} ຈະສະແດງຜົນບໍ່ຖືກຕ້ອງໃນ Windows Internet Explorer."

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/general-requirements.adoc:35
#, no-wrap
msgid "SSL Certificates"
msgstr "ໃບຮັບຮອງ SSL"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/general-requirements.adoc:36
msgid ""
"{productname} uses SSL certificates to ensure that clients are registered to "
"the correct server.  By default, {productname} uses a self-signed "
"certificate.  If you have certificates signed by a third-party CA, you can "
"import them to your {productname} installation."
msgstr "{productname} ໃຊ້ໃບຮັບຮອງ SSL ເພື່ອໃຫ້ໝັ້ນໃຈວ່າໄຄລແອນຖືກລົງທະບຽນກັບເຊີເວີທີ່ຖືກຕ້ອງ. ໂດຍເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ, {productname} ຈະໃຊ້ໃບຮັບຮອງທີ່ລົງນາມດ້ວຍຕົນເອງ (self-signed certificate). ຫາກທ່ານມີໃບຮັບຮອງທີ່ລົງນາມໂດຍ CA ພາຍນອກ, ທ່ານສາມາດນຳເຂົ້າມາໃນການຕິດຕັ້ງ {productname} ຂອງທ່ານໄດ້."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/general-requirements.adoc:37
msgid ""
"For more on self-signed certificates, see "
"xref:administration:ssl-certs-selfsigned.adoc[]."
msgstr "ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບໃບຮັບຮອງທີ່ລົງນາມດ້ວຍຕົນເອງ, ເບິ່ງທີ່ xref:administration:ssl-certs-selfsigned.adoc[]."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/general-requirements.adoc:38
msgid ""
"For more on imported certificates, see "
"xref:administration:ssl-certs-imported.adoc[]."
msgstr "ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບໃບຮັບຮອງທີ່ນຳເຂົ້າ, ເບິ່ງທີ່ xref:administration:ssl-certs-imported.adoc[]."

#. type: Block title
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/hardware-requirements.adoc:1
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/install-ibmz.adoc:13
#, no-wrap
msgid "Hardware Requirements"
msgstr "ຂໍ້ກຳນົດດ້ານຮາດແວ"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/hardware-requirements.adoc:2
msgid ""
"This table outlines hardware and software requirements for the {productname} "
"Server and Proxy, on {x86_64} and {ppc64le} architecture."
msgstr "ຕາຕະລາງນີ້ສະແດງລາຍລະອຽດຂໍ້ກຳນົດດ້ານຮາດແວ ແລະ ຊອບແວສຳລັບ {productname} ເຊີເວີ ແລະ ພຣັອກຊີ ໃນສະຖາປັດຕະຍະກຳ {x86_64} ແລະ {ppc64le}."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/hardware-requirements.adoc:3
msgid ""
"This table outlines hardware and software requirements for the {productname} "
"Server and Proxy on {x86_64} architecture."
msgstr "ຕາຕະລາງນີ້ສະແດງລາຍລະອຽດຂໍ້ກຳນົດດ້ານຮາດແວ ແລະ ຊອບແວສຳລັບ {productname} ເຊີເວີ ແລະ ພຣັອກຊີ ໃນສະຖາປັດຕະຍະກຳ {x86_64}."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/hardware-requirements.adoc:4
msgid ""
"For {ibmz} hardware requirements, see "
"xref:installation-and-upgrade:install-ibmz.adoc[]."
msgstr "ສຳລັບຂໍ້ກຳນົດດ້ານຮາດແວຂອງ {ibmz}, ເບິ່ງທີ່ xref:installation-and-upgrade:install-ibmz.adoc[]."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/hardware-requirements.adoc:5
msgid ""
"For {productname} {smr} hardware requirements, see "
"xref:retail:retail-requirements.adoc[]."
msgstr "ສຳລັບຂໍ້ກຳນົດດ້ານຮາດແວຂອງ {productname} {smr}, ເບິ່ງທີ່ xref:retail:retail-requirements.adoc[]."

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/hardware-requirements.adoc:6
#, no-wrap
msgid "Server Hardware Requirements"
msgstr "ຂໍ້ກຳນົດດ້ານຮາດແວຂອງເຊີເວີ"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/hardware-requirements.adoc:7
msgid ""
"{productname} Server stores packages in the [path]``/var/spacewalk/`` "
"directory.  Repository synchronization fails if this directory runs out of "
"disk space.  You can estimate how much space the [path]``/var/spacewalk/`` "
"directory requires based on the clients and repositories you plan to mirror."
msgstr "{productname} ເຊີເວີ ເກັບແພັກເກດໄວ້ໃນໄດເຣັກທໍຣີ [path]``/var/spacewalk/``. ການ Synchronization ບ່ອນເກັບຂໍ້ມູນ (Repository) ຈະຫຼົ້ມເຫຼວຫາກໄດເຣັກທໍຣີນີ້ພື້ນທີ່ດິສກ໌ເຕັມ. ທ່ານສາມາດປະເມີນພື້ນທີ່ທີ່ໄດເຣັກທໍຣີ [path]``/var/spacewalk/`` ຕ້ອງການ ໂດຍອີງຕາມໄຄລແອນ ແລະ ບ່ອນເກັບຂໍ້ມູນທີ່ທ່ານວາງແຜນຈະ mirror."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/hardware-requirements.adoc:8
msgid ""
"For more information about filesystem and partitioning details, see "
"xref:installation-and-upgrade:hardware-requirements.adoc#install-hardware-requirements-storage[]."
msgstr "ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບລາຍລະອຽດລະບົບໄຟລ໌ ແລະ ການແບ່ງພາກສ່ວນ (partitioning), ເບິ່ງທີ່ xref:installation-and-upgrade:hardware-requirements.adoc#install-hardware-requirements-storage[]."

