msgstr "ດຳເນີນການລົງທະບຽນ {productname} Proxy ທີ່ຕິດຕັ້ງແລ້ວໃນຖານະເປັນໄຄເອັນ: xref:installation-and-upgrade:proxy-registration.adoc[]."

#. type: Title =
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/install-proxy-uyuni.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
