msgstr "{productname} Proxy ສາມາດຕິດຕັ້ງໄດ້ໃນ {opensuse} Leap {opensuse-version}."

#. type: Block title
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/install-proxy-uyuni.adoc:3
#, no-wrap
