msgstr "ຕິດຕັ້ງແພັດເທີນ (pattern) ສຳລັບ {productname} Proxy:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/install-proxy-uyuni.adoc:14
#, no-wrap
msgid "zypper in patterns-uyuni_proxy\n"
msgstr "zypper in patterns-uyuni_proxy\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/install-proxy-uyuni.adoc:15
msgid "Reboot the {productname} Proxy."
msgstr "ເລີ່ມລະບົບ (Reboot) {productname} Proxy ໃໝ່."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/install-proxy-uyuni.adoc:16
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/install-uyuni.adoc:18
msgid ""
"For more information about the stable version of {productname}, see "
"https://www.uyuni-project.org/pages/stable-version.html."
msgstr "ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບ {productname} ເວີຊັນທີ່ສະຖຽນ (stable), ເບິ່ງໄດ້ທີ່ https://www.uyuni-project.org/pages/stable-version.html."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/install-proxy-uyuni.adoc:17
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/install-uyuni.adoc:19
msgid ""
"For more information about the development version of {productname}, see "
"https://www.uyuni-project.org/pages/devel-version.html."
msgstr "ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບ {productname} ເວີຊັນກຳລັງພັດທະນາ (development), ເບິ່ງໄດ້ທີ່ https://www.uyuni-project.org/pages/devel-version.html."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/install-proxy-uyuni.adoc:18
msgid ""
"When the installation is complete, you can continue with {productname} "
"setup.  For more information, see "
"xref:installation-and-upgrade:uyuni-proxy-registration.adoc[]."
msgstr "ເມື່ອການຕິດຕັ້ງສຳເລັດແລ້ວ, ທ່ານສາມາດດຳເນີນການຕັ້ງຄ່າ {productname} ຕໍ່ໄດ້. ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມ, ເບິ່ງໄດ້ທີ່ xref:installation-and-upgrade:uyuni-proxy-registration.adoc[]."

#. type: Title =
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/install-proxy-vm.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Install {productname} Proxy in a Virtual Machine Environment Using "
"{productname} Proxy KVM Image"
msgstr "ຕິດຕັ້ງ {productname} Proxy ໃນສະພາບແວດລ້ອມເຄື່ອງສະເໝືອນ (Virtual Machine) ໂດຍໃຊ້ {productname} Proxy KVM Image"

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/install-proxy-vm.adoc:2
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/install-vm.adoc:5
#, no-wrap
msgid "Virtual Machine Manager Settings"
msgstr "ການຕັ້ງຄ່າຕົວຈັດການເຄື່ອງສະເໝືອນ (Virtual Machine Manager)"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/install-proxy-vm.adoc:3
msgid ""
"This chapter provides the required Kernel Virtual Machine (KVM) settings for "
"{productname} Proxy.  KVM combined with Virtual Machine Manager "
"(_virt-manager_) will be used as a sandbox for this installation."
msgstr "ບົດນີ້ຈະໃຫ້ຂໍ້ມູນການຕັ້ງຄ່າ Kernel Virtual Machine (KVM) ທີ່ຈຳເປັນສຳລັບ {productname} Proxy. ໂດຍຈະໃຊ້ KVM ຮ່ວມກັບ Virtual Machine Manager (_virt-manager_) ເປັນສະພາບແວດລ້ອມທົດລອງ (sandbox) ສຳລັບການຕິດຕັ້ງນີ້."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/install-proxy-vm.adoc:4
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/install-proxy-vmdk.adoc:3
msgid ""
"You will find the VM images for {productname} {productnumber} Proxy in "
"various formats.  It includes {sles} {sles-version} {sp-base} as the "
"underlying operating system and the {productname} Proxy software current at "
"the time of build.  Download the appropriate {productname} Proxy image for "
"your environment from https://download.suse.com/."
msgstr "ທ່ານຈະພົບອິມເມຈ VM ສຳລັບ {productname} {productnumber} Proxy ໃນຮູບແບບຕ່າງໆ. ເຊິ່ງລວມມີ {sles} {sles-version} {sp-base} ເປັນລະບົບປະຕິບັດການພື້ນຖານ ແລະ ຊອບແວ {productname} Proxy ເວີຊັນຫຼ້າສຸດໃນເວລານັ້ນ. ດາວໂຫຼດອິມເມຈ {productname} Proxy ທີ່ເໝາະສົມກັບສະພາບແວດລ້ອມຂອງທ່ານໄດ້ຈາກ https://download.suse.com/."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/install-proxy-vm.adoc:5
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/install-proxy-vmdk.adoc:4
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/install-vm.adoc:7
msgid ""
"This table specifies the minimum requirements.  These are suitable for a "
"quick test installation, such as a server with one client.  If you want to "
"use a production environment, review the requirements listed in "
"xref:installation-and-upgrade:hardware-requirements.adoc[]."
msgstr "ຕາຕະລາງນີ້ລະບຸຄວາມຕ້ອງການຂັ້ນຕ່ຳ. ເໝາະສຳລັບການຕິດຕັ້ງເພື່ອທົດສອບແບບໄວ, ເຊັ່ນ: ເຊີເວີທີ່ມີໄຄເອັນດຽວ. ຫາກທ່ານຕ້ອງການໃຊ້ໃນສະພາບແວດລ້ອມການໃຊ້ງານຈິງ (production), ໃຫ້ກວດສອບຄວາມຕ້ອງການທີ່ລະບຸໄວ້ໃນ xref:installation-and-upgrade:hardware-requirements.adoc[]."

