msgid ""
"For more information on {sle} Virtualization, see "
"https://documentation.suse.com/sles/15-SP4/html/SLES-all/book-virtualization.html."
msgstr "ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບ {sle} Virtualization, ເບິ່ງໄດ້ທີ່ https://documentation.suse.com/sles/15-SP4/html/SLES-all/book-virtualization.html."

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/install-proxy-vm.adoc:8
#, no-wrap
msgid "Install {productname} Proxy Virtual Machine"
msgstr "ຕິດຕັ້ງ {productname} Proxy ໃນເຄື່ອງສະເໝືອນ"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/install-proxy-vm.adoc:9
msgid ""
"Create virtual machine with additional virtual disks required for the "
"{productname} Proxy storage partitions."
msgstr "ສ້າງເຄື່ອງສະເໝືອນພ້ອມກັບດິສກ໌ສະເໝືອນເພີ່ມເຕີມທີ່ຈຳເປັນສຳລັບ ພາທິຊັນເກັບຂໍ້ມູນຂອງ {productname} Proxy."

#.  FIXME: add details on networking (bridge).
#. type: Block title
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/install-proxy-vm.adoc:10
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Procedure: Creating the VM and Additional Partitions with "
"[command]``virt-manager``"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການສ້າງ VM ແລະ ພາທິຊັນເພີ່ມເຕີມດ້ວຍ [command]``virt-manager``"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/install-proxy-vm.adoc:11
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/install-vm.adoc:13
msgid "In [command]``virt-manager``, open menu:File[New Virtual Machine]."
msgstr "ໃນ [command]``virt-manager``, ເປີດ menu:File[New Virtual Machine]."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/install-proxy-vm.adoc:12
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/install-vm.adoc:14
msgid ""
"In the [guimenu]``Create a new virtual machine`` dialog, select "
"[guimenu]``Import existing disk image`` and confirm with btn:[Forward]."
msgstr "ໃນໜ້າຕ່າງ [guimenu]``Create a new virtual machine``, ເລືອກ [guimenu]``Import existing disk image`` ແລ້ວຍືນຍັນດ້ວຍ btn:[Forward]."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/install-proxy-vm.adoc:13
msgid ""
"Enter the filename of the downloaded {productname} Proxy KVM image and set "
"[literal]``SUSE Linux Enterprise 15 SP4`` as the operating system.  Confirm "
"with btn:[Forward]."
msgstr "ປ້ອນຊື່ໄຟລ໌ຂອງອິມເມຈ {productname} Proxy KVM ທີ່ດາວໂຫຼດມາ ແລະ ຕັ້ງຄ່າ [literal]``SUSE Linux Enterprise 15 SP4`` ເປັນລະບົບປະຕິບັດການ. ຍືນຍັນດ້ວຍ btn:[Forward]."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/install-proxy-vm.adoc:14
msgid ""
"Configure RAM and number of CPUs (at least 8 GB RAM and 2 CPUs).  Confirm "
"with btn:[Forward]."
msgstr "ກຳນົດຄ່າ RAM ແລະ ຈຳນວນ CPU (ຢ່າງຕ່ຳ 8 GB RAM ແລະ 2 CPU). ຍືນຍັນດ້ວຍ btn:[Forward]."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/install-proxy-vm.adoc:15
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/install-vm.adoc:17
msgid ""
"Set the name of your VM and select the [guimenu]``Customize configuration "
"before install`` check box."
msgstr "ຕັ້ງຊື່ VM ຂອງທ່ານ ແລະ ເລືອກຊ່ອງ [guimenu]``Customize configuration before install``."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/install-proxy-vm.adoc:16
msgid ""
"With the [guimenu]``Network selection`` drop-down menu select the configured "
"bridge device."
msgstr "ໃນເມນູເລືອກ [guimenu]``Network selection`` ໃຫ້ເລືອກອຸປະກອນ bridge ທີ່ໄດ້ຕັ້ງຄ່າໄວ້."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/install-proxy-vm.adoc:17
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/install-vm.adoc:19
msgid "Confirm with btn:[Finish]."
msgstr "ຍືນຍັນດ້ວຍ btn:[Finish]."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/install-proxy-vm.adoc:18
msgid ""
"In the overview dashboard, at the bottom of the left navigation bar, click "
"btn:[Add Hardware] to create additional virtual disks.  These disks will be "
"partitioned and mounted later."
msgstr "ໃນແຜງຄວບຄຸມພາບລວມ, ທີ່ສ່ວນລຸ່ມຂອງແຖບນຳທາງເບື້ອງຊ້າຍ, ຄລິກ btn:[Add Hardware] ເພື່ອສ້າງດິສກ໌ສະເໝືອນເພີ່ມເຕີມ. ດິສກ໌ເຫຼົ່ານີ້ຈະຖືກແບ່ງພາທິຊັນ ແລະ mount ໃນພາຍຫຼັງ."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/install-proxy-vm.adoc:19
msgid ""
"Storage size values are the absolute minimum—only suitable for a small test "
"or demo installation.  Also consider to create a separate partition for "
"[path]``/srv/tftpboot/`` where images on Retail Branchservers are stored."
msgstr "ຄ່າຂະໜາດພື້ນທີ່ເກັບຂໍ້ມູນແມ່ນຂັ້ນຕ່ຳສຸດ—ເໝາະສຳລັບການທົດສອບຂະໜາດນ້ອຍ ຫຼື ການສາທິດເທົ່ານັ້ນ. ຄວນພິຈາລະນາສ້າງພາທິຊັນແຍກສຳລັບ [path]``/srv/tftpboot/`` ເຊິ່ງເປັນບ່ອນເກັບອິມເມຈໃນ Retail Branchservers."

#. type: Table
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/install-proxy-vm.adoc:20
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| VirtIO Storage Disks | Name       | Sizing\n"
"| VirtIO Disk 2        | squidcache | 101{nbsp}GB\n"
"| VirtIO Disk 3        | tftpboot   | 100{nbsp}GB\n"
msgstr ""
"| ດິສກ໌ເກັບຂໍ້ມູນ VirtIO | ຊື່       | ຂະໜາດ\n"
"| VirtIO Disk 2        | squidcache | 101{nbsp}GB\n"
"| VirtIO Disk 3        | tftpboot   | 100{nbsp}GB\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/install-proxy-vm.adoc:21
msgid ""
"Above the left navigation bar, click btn:[Begin Installation] to boot the "
"new VM from the {productname} Proxy image.  Wait until the [guimenu]``JeOS "
"Firstboot`` start option is presented."
msgstr "ຢູ່ເທິງແຖບນຳທາງເບື້ອງຊ້າຍ, ຄລິກ btn:[Begin Installation] ເພື່ອບູດ VM ໃໝ່ຈາກອິມເມຈ {productname} Proxy. ລໍຖ້າຈົນກວ່າຕົວເລືອກເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ [guimenu]``JeOS Firstboot`` ຈະປະກົດຂຶ້ນ."

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/install-proxy-vm.adoc:22
#, no-wrap
msgid "Run JeOS Firstboot Setup"
msgstr "ດຳເນີນການຕັ້ງຄ່າ JeOS Firstboot"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/install-proxy-vm.adoc:23
msgid "Confirm to start the [guimenu]``JeOS Firstboot`` setup."
msgstr "ຍືນຍັນເພື່ອເລີ່ມການຕັ້ງຄ່າ [guimenu]``JeOS Firstboot``."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/install-proxy-vm.adoc:24
msgid "Select system locale such as [literal]``en_US``."
msgstr "ເລືອກທ້ອງຖິ່ນຂອງລະບົບ (locale) ເຊັ່ນ [literal]``en_US``."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/install-proxy-vm.adoc:25
msgid "Select keyboard layout such as [literal]``us``."
msgstr "ເລືອກຮູບແບບແປ້ນພິມ ເຊັ່ນ [literal]``us``."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/install-proxy-vm.adoc:26
msgid "Check end user license agreement."
msgstr "ກວດສອບຂໍ້ຕົກລົງໃບອະນຸຍາດຜູ້ໃຊ້ (EULA)."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/install-proxy-vm.adoc:27
msgid "Select time zone such as [literal]``UTC``."
msgstr "ເລືອກເຂດເວລາ ເຊັ່ນ [literal]``UTC``."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/install-proxy-vm.adoc:28
msgid "Enter and confirm root password.  Keep note of the root password."
msgstr "ປ້ອນ ແລະ ຍືນຍັນລະຫັດຜ່ານ root. ກະລຸນາຈົດຈຳລະຫັດຜ່ານ root ໄວ້."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/install-proxy-vm.adoc:29
msgid "Wait until the login prompt is presented."
msgstr "ລໍຖ້າຈົນກວ່າໜ້າຈໍເຂົ້າສູ່ລະບົບຈະປະກົດຂຶ້ນ."

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/install-proxy-vm.adoc:30
#, no-wrap
msgid "Preparing virtual machine for {productname} Proxy"
msgstr "ກຳລັງກຽມເຄື່ອງສະເໝືອນສຳລັບ {productname} Proxy"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/install-proxy-vm.adoc:31
msgid ""
"Before starting, obtain a registration code for this image from SUSE "
"Customer Center - https://scc.suse.com."
msgstr "ກ່ອນເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ, ໃຫ້ຂໍລະຫັດລົງທະບຽນສຳລັບອິມເມຈນີ້ຈາກ SUSE Customer Center - https://scc.suse.com."

#. type: Block title
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/install-proxy-vm.adoc:32
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Preparing for {productname} Proxy run"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການກຽມພ້ອມສຳລັບການເປີດໃຊ້ {productname} Proxy"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/install-proxy-vm.adoc:33
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/install-proxy.adoc:22
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/install-vm.adoc:43
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/lts.adoc:5
msgid "Log in as `root`."
msgstr "ເຂົ້າສູ່ລະບົບດ້ວຍ `root`."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/install-proxy-vm.adoc:34
msgid "Register {productname} Proxy with SCC:"
msgstr "ລົງທະບຽນ {productname} Proxy ກັບ SCC:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/install-proxy-vm.adoc:35
#, no-wrap
msgid "SUSEConnect -e <EMAIL_ADDRESS> -r <SUSE_MANAGER_PROXY_CODE>\n"
msgstr "SUSEConnect -e <ອີເມລ໌> -r <ລະຫັດ_SUSE_MANAGER_PROXY>\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/install-proxy-vm.adoc:36
msgid ""
"Prepare {productname} Proxy storage: [command]``suma-storage`` command "
"automatically prepares and configures previously created external storage "
"for use with the proxy.  In the following command, the first parameter is "
"the device for {productname} Proxy Squid cache that "
"[command]``suma-storage`` can handle:"
msgstr "ກຽມບ່ອນເກັບຂໍ້ມູນ {productname} Proxy: ຄຳສັ່ງ [command]``suma-storage`` ຈະກຽມ ແລະ ຕັ້ງຄ່າບ່ອນເກັບຂໍ້ມູນພາຍນອກທີ່ສ້າງໄວ້ກ່ອນໜ້ານີ້ໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດ ເພື່ອໃຊ້ກັບພຣັອກຊີ. ໃນຄຳສັ່ງຕໍ່ໄປນີ້, ພາຣາມິເຕີທຳອິດແມ່ນອຸປະກອນສຳລັບ Squid cache ຂອງ {productname} Proxy ທີ່ [command]``suma-storage`` ສາມາດຈັດການໄດ້:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/install-proxy-vm.adoc:37
#, no-wrap
msgid "suma-storage /dev/vdb\n"
msgstr "suma-storage /dev/vdb\n"

#.  FIXME info about network configuration and applying update in readme
#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/install-proxy-vm.adoc:38
msgid "The virtual machine is now ready for {productname} Proxy to be set up."
msgstr "ເຄື່ອງສະເໝືອນພ້ອມແລ້ວສຳລັບການຕັ້ງຄ່າ {productname} Proxy."

