msgid "{productname} Virtual Machine Creation - VMware"
msgstr "ການສ້າງເຄື່ອງສະເໝືອນ {productname} - VMware"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/install-proxy-vmdk.adoc:8
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/install-vm.adoc:28
msgid ""
"This sections describes VMware configurations, focusing on the creation of "
"an extra virtual disk essential for the {productname} storage partition "
"within VMware environments."
msgstr "ພາກສ່ວນນີ້ອະທິບາຍກ່ຽວກັບການຕັ້ງຄ່າ VMware, ໂດຍເນັ້ນໃສ່ການສ້າງດິສກ໌ສະເໝືອນເພີ່ມເຕີມ ທີ່ຈຳເປັນສຳລັບພາທິຊັນເກັບຂໍ້ມູນຂອງ {productname} ໃນສະພາບແວດລ້ອມ VMware."

#. type: Block title
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/install-proxy-vmdk.adoc:9
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/install-vm.adoc:29
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Creating the VMware Virtual Machine"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການສ້າງເຄື່ອງສະເໝືອນ VMware"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/install-proxy-vmdk.adoc:10
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/install-vm.adoc:30
msgid ""
"Download {productname} Server [filename]``.vmdk`` file.  Then transfer a "
"copy to your VMware storage."
msgstr "ດາວໂຫຼດໄຟລ໌ [filename]``.vmdk`` ຂອງ {productname} Server. ຈາກນັ້ນໂອນສຳເນົາ ໄປຍັງບ່ອນເກັບຂໍ້ມູນ VMware ຂອງທ່ານ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/install-proxy-vmdk.adoc:11
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/install-vm.adoc:31
msgid ""
"Make a copy of uploaded [filename]``.vmdk`` file using VMware web "
"interface.  This will convert provided [filename]``.vmdk`` file to the "
"format suitable for vSphere hypervisor.  Use this new copy as a base image "
"for the virtual machine."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/install-proxy-vmdk.adoc:12
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/install-vm.adoc:32
msgid ""
"Create and name a new virtual machine based on the Guest OS Family "
"[systemitem]``Linux`` and Guest OS Version {sle} 15 (64-bit)."
msgstr "ສ້າງ ແລະ ຕັ້ງຊື່ເຄື່ອງສະເໝືອນໃໝ່ໂດຍອີງຕາມ Guest OS Family [systemitem]``Linux`` ແລະ Guest OS Version {sle} 15 (64-bit)."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/install-proxy-vmdk.adoc:13
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/install-vm.adoc:33
msgid "Add an additional [systemitem]``Hard Disk 2`` of 500 GB (or more)."
msgstr "ເພີ່ມ [systemitem]``Hard Disk 2`` ເພີ່ມເຕີມຂະໜາດ 500 GB (ຫຼື ຫຼາຍກວ່າ)."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/install-proxy-vmdk.adoc:14
msgid "Configure RAM and number of CPUs (at least 8 GB RAM and 2 CPUs)."
msgstr "ກຳນົດຄ່າ RAM ແລະ ຈຳນວນ CPU (ຢ່າງຕ່ຳ 8 GB RAM ແລະ 2 CPU)."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/install-proxy-vmdk.adoc:15
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/install-vm.adoc:35
msgid "Set the network adapter as required."
msgstr "ຕັ້ງຄ່າອະແດັບເຕີເຄືອຂ່າຍຕາມຄວາມຕ້ອງການ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/install-proxy-vmdk.adoc:16
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/install-vm.adoc:36
msgid "Power on the VM."
msgstr "ເປີດເຄື່ອງ VM."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/install-proxy-vmdk.adoc:17
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/install-vm.adoc:37
msgid ""
"At the JeOS Firstboot screen select start to continue and check the "
"following configuration dialogs (keyboard layout, license agreement, time "
"zone, password for root)."
msgstr "ທີ່ໜ້າຈໍ JeOS Firstboot ໃຫ້ເລືອກ start ເພື່ອດຳເນີນການຕໍ່ ແລະ ກວດສອບຂັ້ນຕອນການຕັ້ງຄ່າ (ຮູບແບບແປ້ນພິມ, ຂໍ້ຕົກລົງໃບອະນຸຍາດ, ເຂດເວລາ, ລະຫັດຜ່ານສຳລັບ root)."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/install-proxy-vmdk.adoc:18
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/install-vm.adoc:38
msgid "When installation completes log in as root."
msgstr "ເມື່ອການຕິດຕັ້ງສຳເລັດແລ້ວ ໃຫ້ເຂົ້າສູ່ລະບົບດ້ວຍ root."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/install-proxy-vmdk.adoc:19
msgid ""
"For registering {productname} Proxy with SCC, preparing {productname} Proxy "
"storage, and further steps, proceed with "
"xref:installation-and-upgrade:install-proxy-vm.adoc#minimal.susemgrproxy.prep[]."
msgstr "ສຳລັບການລົງທະບຽນ {productname} Proxy ກັບ SCC, ການກຽມບ່ອນເກັບຂໍ້ມູນ {productname} Proxy, ແລະ ຂັ້ນຕອນຕໍ່ໄປ, ໃຫ້ເບິ່ງທີ່ xref:installation-and-upgrade:install-proxy-vm.adoc#minimal.susemgrproxy.prep[]."

#. type: Title =
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/install-proxy.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Install {productname} Proxy from packages"
msgstr "ຕິດຕັ້ງ {productname} Proxy ຈາກແພັກເກັດ"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/install-proxy.adoc:2
msgid ""
"To install {productname} Proxy from packages, you will need to start by "
"installing {sles} media.  This section covers the KVM settings required to "
"perform a {sles} installation as the base for {productname} Proxy.  In this "
"section, we use a KVM and a virtual machine manager as a sandbox for the "
"installation."
msgstr "ເພື່ອຕິດຕັ້ງ {productname} Proxy ຈາກແພັກເກັດ, ທ່ານຕ້ອງເລີ່ມດ້ວຍການຕິດຕັ້ງຈາກ ແຜ່ນ {sles}. ພາກສ່ວນນີ້ກວມເອົາການຕັ້ງຄ່າ KVM ທີ່ຈຳເປັນເພື່ອຕິດຕັ້ງ {sles} ເປັນພື້ນຖານສຳລັບ {productname} Proxy. ໃນພາກສ່ວນນີ້, ພວກເຮົາຈະໃຊ້ KVM ແລະ ຕົວຈັດການເຄື່ອງສະເໝືອນເປັນບ່ອນທົດສອບການຕິດຕັ້ງ."

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/install-proxy.adoc:3
#, no-wrap
msgid "SLES KVM Requirements"
msgstr "ຄວາມຕ້ອງການ SLES ສຳລັບ KVM"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/install-proxy.adoc:4
msgid ""
"Use these settings to create a new virtual machine with "
"[command]``virt-manager`` (replace [literal]``<version>`` with the actual "
"version string):"
msgstr "ໃຊ້ການຕັ້ງຄ່າເຫຼົ່ານີ້ເພື່ອສ້າງເຄື່ອງສະເໝືອນໃໝ່ດ້ວຍ [command]``virt-manager`` (ປ່ຽນ [literal]``<version>`` ເປັນເວີຊັນຕົວຈິງ):"

#. type: Block title
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/install-proxy.adoc:5
#, no-wrap
msgid "KVM Settings for SLES"
msgstr "ການຕັ້ງຄ່າ KVM ສຳລັບ SLES"

#. type: Table
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/install-proxy.adoc:6
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Installation Method: | Local install media (ISO image or CDROM)\n"
"| OS:                  | Linux\n"
"| Version:             "
"|``SLE-``[literal]``<version>````-Server-x86_64-GM-DVD1.iso``\n"
"| Memory:              | _Test Server_ Minumum 2{nbsp}GB\n"
"|                      | _Production Server_ Minimum 8{nbsp}GB\n"
"| CPUs:                | 2\n"
"| Storage Format:      | ISO 3{nbsp}GB\n"
"| Disk Space:          | 230{nbsp}GB split between\n"
"|                      | [path]``/`` _(root)_ Minimum 24{nbsp}GB\n"
"|                      | (Virtual Disk 1) [path]``/srv`` Minimum "
"100{nbsp}GB\n"
"|                      | (Virtual Disk 2) [path]``/var/cache`` _(Squid)_ "
"Minimum 100{nbsp}GB\n"
"| Name:                | example-proxy\n"
"| Network              | Bridge br0\n"
msgstr ""
"| ວິທີການຕິດຕັ້ງ: | ແຜ່ນຕິດຕັ້ງພາຍໃນ (ISO image ຫຼື CDROM)\n"
"| ລະບົບປະຕິບັດການ: | Linux\n"
"| ເວີຊັນ:             |``SLE-``[literal]``<version>````-Server-x86_64-GM-DVD1.iso``\n"
"| ໜ່ວຍຄວາມຈຳ:       | _ເຊີເວີທົດສອບ_ ຢ່າງຕ່ຳ 2{nbsp}GB\n"
"|                      | _ເຊີເວີໃຊ້ງານຈິງ_ ຢ່າງຕ່ຳ 8{nbsp}GB\n"
"| CPU:                | 2\n"
"| ຮູບແບບບ່ອນເກັບຂໍ້ມູນ: | ISO 3{nbsp}GB\n"
"| ພື້ນທີ່ດິສກ໌:          | 230{nbsp}GB ແບ່ງລະຫວ່າງ\n"
"|                      | [path]``/`` _(root)_ ຢ່າງຕ່ຳ 24{nbsp}GB\n"
"|                      | (Virtual Disk 1) [path]``/srv`` ຢ່າງຕ່ຳ 100{nbsp}GB\n"
"|                      | (Virtual Disk 2) [path]``/var/cache`` _(Squid)_ ຢ່າງຕ່ຳ 100{nbsp}GB\n"
"| ຊື່:                | example-proxy\n"
"| ເຄືອຂ່າຍ             | Bridge br0\n"

#. type: Title ===
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/install-proxy.adoc:7
#, no-wrap
msgid "SLES KVM Settings"
msgstr "ການຕັ້ງຄ່າ SLES KVM"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/install-proxy.adoc:8
msgid ""
"This section covers the {productname} Proxy installation, using the full "
"installation media with KVM and [command]``virt-manager``.  Before you "
"begin, you will need to have created an account with {scc}, and downloaded "
"the {sles} installation media."
msgstr "ພາກສ່ວນນີ້ກວມເອົາການຕິດຕັ້ງ {productname} Proxy ໂດຍໃຊ້ແຜ່ນຕິດຕັ້ງແບບເຕັມກັບ KVM ແລະ [command]``virt-manager``. ກ່ອນຈະເລີ່ມ, ທ່ານຕ້ອງສ້າງບັນຊີກັບ {scc} ແລະ ດາວໂຫຼດແຜ່ນຕິດຕັ້ງ {sles} ໄວ້ກ່ອນ."

#. type: Block title
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/install-proxy.adoc:9
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Preparing for SLES Installation"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການກຽມພ້ອມສຳລັບການຕິດຕັ້ງ SLES"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/install-proxy.adoc:10
msgid ""
"In the Virtual Machine Manager tool ([command]``virt-manager``), click "
"menu:File[New Virtual Machine]."
msgstr "ໃນເຄື່ອງມື Virtual Machine Manager ([command]``virt-manager``), ຄລິກ menu:File[New Virtual Machine]."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/install-proxy.adoc:11
msgid "Click btn:[Local install media (ISO image or CDROM)]."
msgstr "ຄລິກ btn:[Local install media (ISO image ຫຼື CDROM)]."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/install-proxy.adoc:12
msgid ""
"In the [guimenu]``Create a new virtual machine`` dialog, click btn:[Browse] "
"and locate the full SLES image you downloaded from your SCC account."
msgstr "ໃນໜ້າຕ່າງ [guimenu]``Create a new virtual machine``, ຄລິກ btn:[Browse] ແລ້ວເລືອກອິມເມຈ SLES ແບບເຕັມທີ່ທ່ານດາວໂຫຼດມາຈາກບັນຊີ SCC."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/install-proxy.adoc:13
msgid "Configure your machine with at least 2 GB RAM and a minimum of 2 CPUs."
msgstr "ກຳນົດຄ່າເຄື່ອງຂອງທ່ານດ້ວຍ RAM ຢ່າງຕ່ຳ 2 GB ແລະ CPU ຢ່າງຕ່ຳ 2 ຕົວ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/install-proxy.adoc:14
msgid ""
"Create a storage device with a minimum of 230 GB storage space for the "
"installation.  During the SLES installation this disk should be partitioned "
"into the following partitions:"
msgstr "ສ້າງອຸປະກອນເກັບຂໍ້ມູນທີ່ມີພື້ນທີ່ຢ່າງຕ່ຳ 230 GB ສຳລັບການຕິດຕັ້ງ. ໃນລະຫວ່າງການຕິດຕັ້ງ SLES ດິສກ໌ນີ້ຄວນຖືກແບ່ງອອກເປັນພາທິຊັນດັ່ງນີ້:"

#. type: Table
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/install-proxy.adoc:15
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Disk Space Requirements\n"
"| 100{nbsp}GB XFS partition (or dedicated virtual disk) for "
"[path]``/srv/``\n"
"| 100{nbsp}GB XFS partition (or dedicated virtual disk) for "
"[path]``/var/cache/``\n"
msgstr ""
"| ຄວາມຕ້ອງການພື້ນທີ່ດິສກ໌\n"
"| 100{nbsp}GB ພາທິຊັນ XFS (ຫຼື ດິສກ໌ສະເໝືອນແຍກ) ສຳລັບ [path]``/srv/``\n"
"| 100{nbsp}GB ພາທິຊັນ XFS (ຫຼື ດິສກ໌ສະເໝືອນແຍກ) ສຳລັບ [path]``/var/cache/``\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/install-proxy.adoc:16
msgid ""
"The remaining storage space will be used by the operating system for the "
"root partition."
msgstr "ພື້ນທີ່ເກັບຂໍ້ມູນທີ່ເຫຼືອຈະຖືກໃຊ້ໂດຍລະບົບປະຕິບັດການສຳລັບພາທິຊັນ root."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/install-proxy.adoc:17
msgid ""
"Click btn:[Finish] to save the installation settings and begin the "
"installation."
msgstr "ຄລິກ btn:[Finish] ເພື່ອບັນທຶກການຕັ້ງຄ່າ ແລະ ເລີ່ມການຕິດຕັ້ງ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/install-proxy.adoc:18
msgid "For more information on installing {sles}, see:"
msgstr "ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບການຕິດຕັ້ງ {sles}, ເບິ່ງໄດ້ທີ່:"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/install-proxy.adoc:19
msgid "link:https://documentation.suse.com/sles/15-SP4/html/SLES-all/article-installation.html[]."
msgstr "link:https://documentation.suse.com/sles/15-SP4/html/SLES-all/article-installation.html[]."

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/install-proxy.adoc:20
#, no-wrap
msgid "Change SLES for SUSE Manager Proxy"
msgstr "ປ່ຽນ SLES ເປັນ SUSE Manager Proxy"

#. type: Block title
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/install-proxy.adoc:21
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Changing SLES for {productname} Proxy Installation"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການປ່ຽນ SLES ສຳລັບການຕິດຕັ້ງ {productname} Proxy"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/install-proxy.adoc:23
msgid "Uninstall the `sles-release` package:"
msgstr "ຖອນການຕິດຕັ້ງແພັກເກັດ `sles-release`:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/install-proxy.adoc:24
#, no-wrap
msgid "rpm -e --nodeps sles-release\n"
msgstr "rpm -e --nodeps sles-release\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/install-proxy.adoc:25
msgid ""
"Register {productname} Proxy with SCC (for example, replace "
"`<productversion>` with `{productnumber}` and `<architecture>` with "
"`x86_64`):"
msgstr "ລົງທະບຽນ {productname} Proxy ກັບ SCC (ຕົວຢ່າງ: ປ່ຽນ `<productversion>` ເປັນ `{productnumber}` ແລະ `<architecture>` ເປັນ `x86_64`):"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/install-proxy.adoc:26
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"SUSEConnect -e <EMAIL_ADDRESS> -r <SUSE_MANAGER_PROXY_CODE> \\\n"
"-p SUSE-Manager-Proxy/<productversion>/<architecture>\n"
msgstr ""
"SUSEConnect -e <ອີເມລ໌> -r <ລະຫັດ_SUSE_MANAGER_PROXY> \\\n"
"-p SUSE-Manager-Proxy/<productversion>/<architecture>\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/install-proxy.adoc:27
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/install-vm.adoc:48
msgid "Add {productname} repositories:"
msgstr "ເພີ່ມຄັງເກັບຊອບແວ (repositories) ຂອງ {productname}:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/install-proxy.adoc:28
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"SUSEConnect -p sle-module-basesystem/15.4/x86_64\n"
"SUSEConnect -p sle-module-server-applications/15.4/x86_64\n"
"SUSEConnect -p sle-module-suse-manager-proxy/4.3/x86_64\n"
msgstr ""
"SUSEConnect -p sle-module-basesystem/15.4/x86_64\n"
"SUSEConnect -p sle-module-server-applications/15.4/x86_64\n"
"SUSEConnect -p sle-module-suse-manager-proxy/4.3/x86_64\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/install-proxy.adoc:29
msgid ""
"Check that you have allowed installing recommended packages.  Check the "
"settings in `/etc/zypp/zypp.conf`:"
msgstr "ກວດສອບວ່າທ່ານໄດ້ອະນຸຍາດໃຫ້ຕິດຕັ້ງແພັກເກັດທີ່ແນະນຳ (recommended packages) ຫຼື ບໍ່. ກວດສອບການຕັ້ງຄ່າໃນ `/etc/zypp/zypp.conf`:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/install-proxy.adoc:30
#, no-wrap
msgid "solver.onlyRequires = false\n"
msgstr "solver.onlyRequires = false\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/install-proxy.adoc:31
msgid "Install the {productname} Proxy pattern:"
msgstr "ຕິດຕັ້ງແພັດເທີນ (pattern) ຂອງ {productname} Proxy:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/install-proxy.adoc:32
#, no-wrap
msgid "zypper in -t pattern suma_proxy\n"
msgstr "zypper in -t pattern suma_proxy\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/install-proxy.adoc:33
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/install-uyuni.adoc:17
msgid "Reboot."
msgstr "ເລີ່ມລະບົບໃໝ່ (Reboot)."

#. type: Title =
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/install-pubcloud.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Installation on Public Cloud"
msgstr "ການຕິດຕັ້ງໃນລະບົບຄລາວສາທາລະນະ (Public Cloud)"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/install-pubcloud.adoc:2
msgid ""
"Public clouds provide {productname} under a Bring Your Own Subscription "
"(BYOS) model.  That means that they pre-install {productname}, so you do not "
"need to perform any installation steps."
msgstr "ລະບົບຄລາວສາທາລະນະໃຫ້ບໍລິການ {productname} ພາຍໃຕ້ຮູບແບບ Bring Your Own Subscription (BYOS). ເຊິ່ງໝາຍຄວາມວ່າພວກເຂົາໄດ້ຕິດຕັ້ງ {productname} ໄວ້ກ່ອນແລ້ວ, ດັ່ງນັ້ນທ່ານຈຶ່ງບໍ່ຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງເຮັດຂັ້ນຕອນການຕິດຕັ້ງໃດໆ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/install-pubcloud.adoc:3
msgid ""
"However, you will need to perform some additional setup steps before you can "
"use {productname}.  For public cloud setup instructions, see "
"xref:installation-and-upgrade:pubcloud-setup.adoc[]."
msgstr "ແນວໃດກໍຕາມ, ທ່ານຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງເຮັດບາງຂັ້ນຕອນການຕັ້ງຄ່າເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ອນຈະເລີ່ມໃຊ້ {productname}. ສຳລັບຄຳແນະນຳການຕັ້ງຄ່າໃນຄລາວສາທາລະນະ, ເບິ່ງໄດ້ທີ່ xref:installation-and-upgrade:pubcloud-setup.adoc[]."

#. type: Title =
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/install-server-unified.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Install {productname} {productnumber} Server"
msgstr "ຕິດຕັ້ງ {productname} {productnumber} Server"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/install-server-unified.adoc:2
msgid ""
"{susemgr} is a {suse} product within the {sle} product family.  This section "
"describes how to install {susemgr} Server from the {sle} installation "
"media.  For this topic we assume that you already have valid organization "
"credentials with {scc} and have obtained a registration code for your "
"{susemgr}, for example from a \"SUSE Manager Lifecycle Management+\" "
"subscription."
msgstr "{susemgr} ແມ່ນຜະລິດຕະພັນຂອງ {suse} ໃນຕະກູນ {sle}. ພາກສ່ວນນີ້ອະທິບາຍເຖິງວິທີການຕິດຕັ້ງ {susemgr} Server ຈາກແຜ່ນຕິດຕັ້ງ {sle}. ສຳລັບຫົວຂໍ້ນີ້ ພວກເຮົາຖືວ່າທ່ານມີຂໍ້ມູນປະຈຳຕົວ ຂອງອົງກອນທີ່ຖືກຕ້ອງກັບ {scc} ແລ້ວ ແລະ ໄດ້ຮັບລະຫັດລົງທະບຽນສຳລັບ {susemgr} ຂອງທ່ານແລ້ວ, ຕົວຢ່າງ: ຈາກການສະໝັກໃຊ້ \"SUSE Manager Lifecycle Management+\"."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/install-server-unified.adoc:4
msgid ""
"Before installing {susemgr}, ensure your physical or virtual machine has "
"enough disk space and RAM by checking the requirements at "
"xref:installation-and-upgrade:hardware-requirements.adoc[]."
msgstr "ກ່ອນຕິດຕັ້ງ {susemgr}, ໃຫ້ແນ່ໃຈວ່າເຄື່ອງຄອມພິວເຕີ ຫຼື ເຄື່ອງສະເໝືອນຂອງທ່ານ ມີພື້ນທີ່ດິສກ໌ ແລະ RAM ພຽງພໍ ໂດຍການກວດສອບຄວາມຕ້ອງການທີ່ xref:installation-and-upgrade:hardware-requirements.adoc[]."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/install-server-unified.adoc:5
msgid ""
"The recommended way of installing {susemgr} is from the {sle} installation "
"media with the {unifiedinstaller}."
msgstr "ວິທີທີ່ແນະນຳໃນການຕິດຕັ້ງ {susemgr} ແມ່ນຕິດຕັ້ງຈາກແຜ່ນ {sle} ດ້ວຍ {unifiedinstaller}."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/install-server-unified.adoc:6
msgid ""
"In case of installing {susemgr} in a public cloud where {susemgr} image is "
"available, use that image."
msgstr "ໃນກໍລະນີທີ່ຕິດຕັ້ງ {susemgr} ໃນຄລາວສາທາລະນະທີ່ມີອິມເມຈ {susemgr} ໃຫ້ບໍລິການ, ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ອິມເມຈນັ້ນ."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/install-server-unified.adoc:7
msgid ""
"For more information, see "
"xref:specialized-guides:public-cloud-guide/overview.adoc[]."
msgstr "ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມ, ເບິ່ງໄດ້ທີ່ xref:specialized-guides:public-cloud-guide/overview.adoc[]."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/install-server-unified.adoc:8
msgid ""
"In case of installing {susemgr} in a public cloud where a {susemgr} image is "
"not available, it is possible to start from a "
"{sles}{nbsp}{sles-version}{nbsp}{sp-base} and switch the base product to "
"{susemgr}{nbsp}{productnumber}.  For more information, see "
"xref:installation-and-upgrade:install-vm.adoc[]."
msgstr "ໃນກໍລະນີຕິດຕັ້ງ {susemgr} ໃນຄລາວສາທາລະນະທີ່ບໍ່ມີອິມເມຈ {susemgr} ໃຫ້ບໍລິການ, ທ່ານສາມາດເລີ່ມຈາກ {sles}{nbsp}{sles-version}{nbsp}{sp-base} ແລ້ວປ່ຽນຜະລິດຕະພັນພື້ນຖານເປັນ {susemgr}{nbsp}{productnumber} ແທນ. ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມ, ເບິ່ງໄດ້ທີ່ xref:installation-and-upgrade:install-vm.adoc[]."

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/install-server-unified.adoc:9
#, no-wrap
msgid "Installing {susemgr}"
msgstr "ກຳລັງຕິດຕັ້ງ {susemgr}"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/install-server-unified.adoc:14
msgid ""
"In the [guimenu]``Language, Keyboard and Product Selection`` screen, check "
"[guimenu]``SUSE Manager Server``, and click btn:[Next]."
msgstr "ໃນໜ້າຈໍ [guimenu]``Language, Keyboard and Product Selection``, ໃຫ້ເລືອກ [guimenu]``SUSE Manager Server``, ແລ້ວຄລິກ btn:[Next]."

#.  image::unifiedinstaller-registration.png[scaledwidth=80%]
#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/install-server-unified.adoc:17
msgid ""
"In the [guimenu]``Extension and Module Selection`` screen, select additional "
"extensions or modules you require, and click btn:[Next]."
msgstr "ໃນໜ້າຈໍ [guimenu]``Extension and Module Selection``, ເລືອກສ່ວນຂະຫຍາຍ ຫຼື ໂມດູນເພີ່ມເຕີມທີ່ທ່ານຕ້ອງການ, ແລ້ວຄລິກ btn:[Next]."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/install-server-unified.adoc:18
msgid "Mandatory modules are pre-selected and you cannot disable them."
msgstr "ໂມດູນທີ່ຈຳເປັນຖືກເລືອກໄວ້ໃຫ້ແລ້ວ ແລະ ທ່ານບໍ່ສາມາດຍົກເລີກການເລືອກໄດ້."

#.  The registration server offers update repositories.
#.  image::unifiedinstaller-extensions.png[scaledwidth=80%]
#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/install-server-unified.adoc:19
msgid ""
"OPTIONAL: In the [guimenu]``Add On Product`` screen, select any additional "
"or add-on products you require, and click btn:[Next].  We do not recommend "
"that you run any other workloads on {productname}.  Only use add-ons that "
"you absolutely require, such as driver repositories from your hardware "
"vendor."
msgstr "ທາງເລືອກ: ໃນໜ້າຈໍ [guimenu]``Add On Product``, ເລືອກຜະລິດຕະພັນເສີມທີ່ທ່ານຕ້ອງການ, ແລ້ວຄລິກ btn:[Next]. ພວກເຮົາບໍ່ແນະນຳໃຫ້ທ່ານເປີດໃຊ້ວຽກອື່ນໆໃນ {productname}. ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ສະເພາະສ່ວນເສີມທີ່ຈຳເປັນແທ້ໆເທົ່ານັ້ນ, ເຊັ່ນ: ຄັງເກັບໄດຣເວີຈາກຜູ້ຜະລິດຮາດແວຂອງທ່ານ."

#.  image::unifiedinstaller-addon.png[scaledwidth=80%]
#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/install-server-unified.adoc:20
msgid ""
"In the [guimenu]``System Role`` screen, check the [guimenu]``SUSE Manager "
"Server`` checkbox, and click btn:[Next]."
msgstr "ໃນໜ້າຈໍ [guimenu]``System Role``, ເລືອກຊ່ອງ [guimenu]``SUSE Manager Server``, ແລ້ວຄລິກ btn:[Next]."

#.  image::unifiedinstaller-systemrole.png[scaledwidth=80%]
#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/install-server-unified.adoc:21
msgid ""
"In the [guimenu]``Suggested Partitioning`` screen, either accept the default "
"values, or use the btn:[Guided Setup] or btn:[Expert Partitioner] options to "
"customize your partitioning model, and click btn:[Next]."
msgstr "ໃນໜ້າຈໍ [guimenu]``Suggested Partitioning``, ທ່ານສາມາດເລືອກໃຊ້ຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ, ຫຼື ໃຊ້ btn:[Guided Setup] ຫຼື btn:[Expert Partitioner] ເພື່ອປັບແຕ່ງຮູບແບບພາທິຊັນຂອງທ່ານເອງ, ແລ້ວຄລິກ btn:[Next]."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/install-server-unified.adoc:24
msgid ""
"In the [guimenu]``System Administrator \"root\"`` screen, create the "
"\"root\" user, and click btn:[Next]."
msgstr "ໃນໜ້າຈໍ [guimenu]``System Administrator \"root\"``, ໃຫ້ສ້າງຜູ້ໃຊ້ \"root\", ແລ້ວຄລິກ btn:[Next]."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/install-server-unified.adoc:25
msgid "Review the settings on the [guimenu]``Installation Settings`` screen."
msgstr "ກວດສອບການຕັ້ງຄ່າໃນໜ້າຈໍ [guimenu]``Installation Settings``."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/install-server-unified.adoc:26
msgid "On the [guimenu]``Installation Settings`` screen click btn:[Install]."
msgstr "ໃນໜ້າຈໍ [guimenu]``Installation Settings`` ໃຫ້ຄລິກ btn:[Install]."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/install-server-unified.adoc:27
msgid ""
"The default {productname} server installation does not enable a graphical "
"desktop environment. If you want to run setup tools such as {yast} with a "
"graphical interface locally on the {productname} server, click "
"[guimenu]``Software`` and select the [guimenu]``X Window System`` pattern."
msgstr "ການຕິດຕັ້ງ {productname} server ແບບເລີ່ມຕົ້ນຈະບໍ່ເປີດໃຊ້ງານສະພາບແວດລ້ອມເດັສທັອບແບບກຣາບຟິກ (GUI). ຫາກທ່ານຕ້ອງການໃຊ້ເຄື່ອງມືຕັ້ງຄ່າເຊັ່ນ {yast} ຜ່ານອິນເຕີເຟດກຣາບຟິກໃນເຄື່ອງ {productname} server ໂດຍກົງ, ໃຫ້ຄລິກ [guimenu]``Software`` ແລ້ວເລືອກແພັດເທີນ [guimenu]``X Window System``."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/install-server-unified.adoc:28
msgid ""
"When the installation procedure has finished, you can check that you have "
"all the required modules by using the [command]``SUSEConnect --status-text`` "
"command at a command prompt.  For {susemgr} Server, the expected modules "
"are:"
msgstr "ເມື່ອຂັ້ນຕອນການຕິດຕັ້ງສຳເລັດ, ທ່ານສາມາດກວດສອບໄດ້ວ່າທ່ານມີໂມດູນທີ່ຈຳເປັນຄົບຖ້ວນ ຫຼື ບໍ່ ໂດຍໃຊ້ຄຳສັ່ງ [command]``SUSEConnect --status-text`` ທີ່ໜ້າຈໍຄຳສັ່ງ. ສຳລັບ {susemgr} Server, ໂມດູນທີ່ຄວນຈະມີແມ່ນ:"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/install-server-unified.adoc:30
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/pubcloud-setup.adoc:20
msgid "Python 3 Module"
msgstr "ໂມດູນ Python 3"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/install-server-unified.adoc:32
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/pubcloud-setup.adoc:22
msgid "Web and Scripting Module"
msgstr "ໂມດູນ Web and Scripting"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/install-server-unified.adoc:33
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/pubcloud-setup.adoc:23
msgid "SUSE Manager Server Module"
msgstr "ໂມດູນ SUSE Manager Server"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/install-server-unified.adoc:34
msgid ""
"When you have finished installing the {productname} Server, you need to set "
"it up so it is ready to use.  For more information, see "
"xref:installation-and-upgrade:server-setup.adoc[]."
msgstr "ເມື່ອທ່ານຕິດຕັ້ງ {productname} Server ສຳເລັດແລ້ວ, ທ່ານຕ້ອງຕັ້ງຄ່າມັນເພື່ອໃຫ້ພ້ອມໃຊ້ງານ. ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມ, ເບິ່ງໄດ້ທີ່ xref:installation-and-upgrade:server-setup.adoc[]."

#. type: Title =
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/install-uyuni.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Install Uyuni Server with openSUSE"
msgstr "ຕິດຕັ້ງ Uyuni Server ດ້ວຍ openSUSE"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/install-uyuni.adoc:2
msgid "{productname} Server can be installed on openSUSE."
msgstr "{productname} Server ສາມາດຕິດຕັ້ງໄດ້ໃນ openSUSE."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/install-uyuni.adoc:3
msgid ""
"For requirements, see "
"xref:installation-and-upgrade:uyuni-install-requirements.adoc[]."
msgstr "ສຳລັບຄວາມຕ້ອງການຕ່າງໆ, ເບິ່ງໄດ້ທີ່ xref:installation-and-upgrade:uyuni-install-requirements.adoc[]."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/install-uyuni.adoc:4
msgid ""
"For more information about the latest version and updates of openSUSE Leap, "
"see https://doc.opensuse.org/release-notes/."
msgstr "ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບເວີຊັນຫຼ້າສຸດ ແລະ ການອັບເດດຂອງ openSUSE Leap, ເບິ່ງໄດ້ທີ່ https://doc.opensuse.org/release-notes/."

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/install-uyuni.adoc:5
#, no-wrap
msgid "Install Uyuni on openSUSE Leap"
msgstr "ຕິດຕັ້ງ Uyuni ໃນ openSUSE Leap"

#. type: Block title
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/install-uyuni.adoc:6
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Installing openSUSE Leap with Uyuni"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການຕິດຕັ້ງ openSUSE Leap ດ້ວຍ Uyuni"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/install-uyuni.adoc:7
msgid ""
"As the base system, install openSUSE Leap with all available service packs "
"and package updates applied."
msgstr "ຕິດຕັ້ງ openSUSE Leap ເປັນລະບົບພື້ນຖານ ພ້ອມທັງລົງ service packs ແລະ ອັບເດດແພັກເກັດທັງໝົດທີ່ມີ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/install-uyuni.adoc:9
msgid "Set variables to use to create repository as [systemitem]``root``:"
msgstr "ກຳນົດຄ່າຕົວແປ (variables) ເພື່ອສ້າງຄັງເກັບຊອບແວໃນຖານະ [systemitem]``root``:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/install-uyuni.adoc:10
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"repo=repositories/systemsmanagement:/\n"
"repo=${repo}Uyuni:/Stable/images/repo/Uyuni-Server-POOL-x86_64-Media1/\n"
msgstr ""
"repo=repositories/systemsmanagement:/\n"
"repo=${repo}Uyuni:/Stable/images/repo/Uyuni-Server-POOL-x86_64-Media1/\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/install-uyuni.adoc:11
msgid ""
"Add the repository for installing the {productname} Server software as "
"[systemitem]``root``:"
msgstr "ເພີ່ມຄັງເກັບຊອບແວສຳລັບຕິດຕັ້ງ {productname} Server ໃນຖານະ [systemitem]``root``:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/install-uyuni.adoc:12
#, no-wrap
msgid "zypper ar https://download.opensuse.org/$repo uyuni-server-stable\n"
msgstr "zypper ar https://download.opensuse.org/$repo uyuni-server-stable\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/install-uyuni.adoc:13
msgid "Refresh metadata from the repositories as [systemitem]``root``:"
msgstr "ຣີເຟຣຊຂໍ້ມູນເມຕາເດຕາຈາກຄັງເກັບຊອບແວໃນຖານະ [systemitem]``root``:"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/install-uyuni.adoc:15
msgid "Install the pattern for the {productname} Server as [systemitem]``root``:"
msgstr "ຕິດຕັ້ງແພັດເທີນ (pattern) ສຳລັບ {productname} Server ໃນຖານະ [systemitem]``root``:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/install-uyuni.adoc:16
#, no-wrap
msgid "zypper in patterns-uyuni_server\n"
msgstr "zypper in patterns-uyuni_server\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/install-uyuni.adoc:20
msgid ""
"When the installation is complete, you can continue with {productname} "
"setup.  For more information, see "
"xref:installation-and-upgrade:uyuni-server-setup.adoc[]."
msgstr "ເມື່ອການຕິດຕັ້ງສຳເລັດ, ທ່ານສາມາດດຳເນີນການຕັ້ງຄ່າ {productname} ຕໍ່ໄດ້. ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມ, ເບິ່ງໄດ້ທີ່ xref:installation-and-upgrade:uyuni-server-setup.adoc[]."

#. type: Title =
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/install-vm.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Install {productname} in a Virtual Machine Environment Using {productname} "
"VM Image"
msgstr "ຕິດຕັ້ງ {productname} ໃນສະພາບແວດລ້ອມເຄື່ອງສະເໝືອນ ໂດຍໃຊ້ອິມເມຈ VM ຂອງ {productname}"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/install-vm.adoc:2
msgid ""
"This chapter provides procedures for deploying Kernel Virtual Machine (KVM) "
"or VMware images."
msgstr "ບົດນີ້ໃຫ້ຂັ້ນຕອນໃນການຕິດຕັ້ງອິມເມຈ Kernel Virtual Machine (KVM) ຫຼື VMware."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/install-vm.adoc:3
msgid ""
"You will find the images for {productname} {productnumber} in various "
"formats.  They include {sles} {sles-version} {sp-base} as the underlying "
"operating system and the {productname} software current at the time of "
"build.  Download the appropriate {productname} image for your environment "
"from https://download.suse.com/."
msgstr "ທ່ານຈະພົບອິມເມຈສຳລັບ {productname} {productnumber} ໃນຮູບແບບຕ່າງໆ. ເຊິ່ງລວມມີ {sles} {sles-version} {sp-base} ເປັນລະບົບປະຕິບັດການພື້ນຖານ ແລະ ຊອບແວ {productname} ເວີຊັນຫຼ້າສຸດໃນເວລານັ້ນ. ດາວໂຫຼດອິມເມຈ {productname} ທີ່ເໝາະສົມກັບສະພາບແວດລ້ອມຂອງທ່ານຈາກ https://download.suse.com/."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/install-vm.adoc:4
msgid ""
"Using a tool such as [systemitem]``Ignition`` to set up a "
"[systemitem]``root`` password is optional now.  For more information about "
"[systemitem]``Ignition``, see "
"xref:installation-and-upgrade:install-ignition.adoc[]."
msgstr "ການໃຊ້ເຄື່ອງມືເຊັ່ນ [systemitem]``Ignition`` ເພື່ອຕັ້ງລະຫັດຜ່ານ [systemitem]``root`` ແມ່ນເປັນທາງເລືອກໃນຕອນນີ້. ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບ [systemitem]``Ignition``, ເບິ່ງໄດ້ທີ່ xref:installation-and-upgrade:install-ignition.adoc[]."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/install-vm.adoc:6
msgid ""
"This section provides the required Kernel Virtual Machine (KVM) settings for "
"{productname}.  KVM combined with Virtual Machine Manager (_virt-manager_) "
"will be used as a sandbox for this installation."
msgstr "ພາກສ່ວນນີ້ໃຫ້ຂໍ້ມູນການຕັ້ງຄ່າ Kernel Virtual Machine (KVM) ທີ່ຈຳເປັນສຳລັບ {productname}. ໂດຍຈະໃຊ້ KVM ຮ່ວມກັບ Virtual Machine Manager (_virt-manager_) ເປັນບ່ອນທົດສອບ (sandbox) ສຳລັບການຕິດຕັ້ງນີ້."

#. type: Table
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/install-vm.adoc:8
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"2+<| Virtual machine settings overview\n"
"| Installation Method | Import Existing Disk Image\n"
"| OS:                 | SUSE Linux Enterprise 15 SP4\n"
"| Memory:             | 16 GB\n"
"| CPU's:              | 4\n"
"| Virtual Disks:      |\n"
"| VirtIO Disk 1       | SUSE-Manager-Server.x86_64-4.3.10-KVM.qcow2\n"
"| VirtIO Disk 2       | 101 GB for [path]``/var/spacewalk``\n"
"| VirtIO Disk 3       | 50 GB for [path]``/var/lib/pgsql``\n"
"| VirtIO Disk 4       | 4 GB for swap\n"
"| Name:               | suse-manager-test-setup\n"
"| Network:            | Bridge _br0_\n"
msgstr ""
"2+<| ພາບລວມການຕັ້ງຄ່າເຄື່ອງສະເໝືອນ\n"
"| ວິທີການຕິດຕັ້ງ | ນຳເຂົ້າອິມເມຈດິສກ໌ທີ່ມີຢູ່ (Import Existing Disk Image)\n"
"| ລະບົບປະຕິບັດການ: | SUSE Linux Enterprise 15 SP4\n"
"| ໜ່ວຍຄວາມຈຳ:       | 16 GB\n"
"| CPU:              | 4\n"
"| ດິສກ໌ສະເໝືອນ:       |\n"
"| VirtIO Disk 1       | SUSE-Manager-Server.x86_64-4.3.10-KVM.qcow2\n"
"| VirtIO Disk 2       | 101 GB ສຳລັບ [path]``/var/spacewalk``\n"
"| VirtIO Disk 3       | 50 GB ສຳລັບ [path]``/var/lib/pgsql``\n"
"| VirtIO Disk 4       | 4 GB ສຳລັບ swap\n"
"| ຊື່:               | suse-manager-test-setup\n"
"| ເຄືອຂ່າຍ:            | Bridge _br0_\n"

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/install-vm.adoc:10
#, no-wrap
msgid "{productname} Virtual Machine Creation - KVM"
msgstr "ການສ້າງເຄື່ອງສະເໝືອນ {productname} - KVM"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/install-vm.adoc:11
msgid ""
"Create a virtual machine with three additional virtual disks required for "
"the {productname} storage partitions."
msgstr "ສ້າງເຄື່ອງສະເໝືອນພ້ອມກັບດິສກ໌ສະເໝືອນເພີ່ມເຕີມ 3 ຕົວ ທີ່ຈຳເປັນສຳລັບພາທິຊັນເກັບຂໍ້ມູນຂອງ {productname}."

#. type: Block title
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/install-vm.adoc:12
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Procedure: Creating the VM and Additional Partitions with  "
"[command]``virt-manager``"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການສ້າງ VM ແລະ ພາທິຊັນເພີ່ມເຕີມດ້ວຍ [command]``virt-manager``"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/install-vm.adoc:15
msgid ""
"Enter the filename of the downloaded {productname} KVM image and set "
"[literal]``SUSE Linux Enterprise 15 SP4`` as the operating system.  Confirm "
"with btn:[Forward]."
msgstr "ປ້ອນຊື່ໄຟລ໌ຂອງອິມເມຈ {productname} KVM ທີ່ດາວໂຫຼດມາ ແລະ ຕັ້ງຄ່າ [literal]``SUSE Linux Enterprise 15 SP4`` ເປັນລະບົບປະຕິບັດການ. ຍືນຍັນດ້ວຍ btn:[Forward]."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/install-vm.adoc:16
msgid ""
"Configure RAM and number of CPUs (at least 16 GB RAM and 4 CPUs).  Confirm "
"with btn:[Forward]."
msgstr "ກຳນົດຄ່າ RAM ແລະ ຈຳນວນ CPU (ຢ່າງຕ່ຳ 16 GB RAM ແລະ 4 CPU). ຍືນຍັນດ້ວຍ btn:[Forward]."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/install-vm.adoc:18
msgid ""
"From the [guimenu]``Network selection`` drop-down menu select the configured "
"bridge device."
msgstr "ຈາກເມນູເລືອກ [guimenu]``Network selection`` ໃຫ້ເລືອກອຸປະກອນ bridge ທີ່ໄດ້ຕັ້ງຄ່າໄວ້."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/install-vm.adoc:20
msgid ""
"In the overview dashboard, at the bottom of the left navigation bar, click "
"btn:[Add Hardware] to create additional virtual disks with the following "
"specifications.  These disks will be partitioned and mounted in "
"<<proc.minimal.susemgr.prep>>."
msgstr "ໃນແຜງຄວບຄຸມພາບລວມ, ທີ່ສ່ວນລຸ່ມຂອງແຖບນຳທາງເບື້ອງຊ້າຍ, ຄລິກ btn:[Add Hardware] ເພື່ອສ້າງດິສກ໌ສະເໝືອນເພີ່ມເຕີມຕາມລາຍລະອຽດຕໍ່ໄປນີ້. ດິສກ໌ເຫຼົ່ານີ້ຈະຖືກແບ່ງພາທິຊັນ ແລະ mount ໃນ <<proc.minimal.susemgr.prep>>."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/install-vm.adoc:21
msgid ""
"Storage size values are the absolute minimum—only suitable for a small test "
"or demo installation.  Especially [path]``/var/spacewalk/`` may quickly need "
"more space.  Also consider to create a separate partition for [path]``/srv`` "
"where Kiwi images are stored."
msgstr "ຄ່າຂະໜາດພື້ນທີ່ເກັບຂໍ້ມູນແມ່ນຂັ້ນຕ່ຳສຸດ—ເໝາະສຳລັບການທົດສອບຂະໜາດນ້ອຍ ຫຼື ການສາທິດເທົ່ານັ້ນ. ໂດຍສະເພາະ [path]``/var/spacewalk/`` ອາດຈະຕ້ອງການພື້ນທີ່ເພີ່ມຢ່າງໄວວາ. ຄວນພິຈາລະນາສ້າງ ພາທິຊັນແຍກສຳລັບ [path]``/srv`` ບ່ອນທີ່ເກັບອິມເມຈ Kiwi."

#. type: Table
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/install-vm.adoc:22
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| VirtIO Storage Disks | Name      | Sizing\n"
"| VirtIO Disk 2        | spacewalk | 500{nbsp}GB\n"
"| VirtIO Disk 3        | pgsql     | 100{nbsp}GB\n"
"| VirtIO Disk 4        | swap      | 4{nbsp}GB\n"
msgstr ""
"| ດິສກ໌ເກັບຂໍ້ມູນ VirtIO | ຊື່      | ຂະໜາດ\n"
"| VirtIO Disk 2        | spacewalk | 500{nbsp}GB\n"
"| VirtIO Disk 3        | pgsql     | 100{nbsp}GB\n"
"| VirtIO Disk 4        | swap      | 4{nbsp}GB\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/install-vm.adoc:23
msgid ""
"Click btn:[Begin Installation] to boot the new VM from the {productname} "
"image."
msgstr "ຄລິກ btn:[Begin Installation] ເພື່ອບູດ VM ໃໝ່ຈາກອິມເມຈ {productname}."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/install-vm.adoc:24
msgid ""
"At the JeOS Firstboot screen select btn:[Start] to continue and check the "
"following configuration options (keyboard layout, license agreement, time "
"zone, password for root)."
msgstr "ທີ່ໜ້າຈໍ JeOS Firstboot ໃຫ້ເລືອກ btn:[Start] ເພື່ອດຳເນີນການຕໍ່ ແລະ ກວດສອບຕົວເລືອກການຕັ້ງຄ່າ (ຮູບແບບແປ້ນພິມ, ຂໍ້ຕົກລົງໃບອະນຸຍາດ, ເຂດເວລາ, ລະຫັດຜ່ານສຳລັບ root)."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/install-vm.adoc:25
msgid "When installation completes, log in as root."
msgstr "ເມື່ອການຕິດຕັ້ງສຳເລັດແລ້ວ, ໃຫ້ເຂົ້າສູ່ລະບົບດ້ວຍ root."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/install-vm.adoc:26
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/install-vm.adoc:39
msgid ""
"Proceed with "
"xref:installation-and-upgrade:install-vm.adoc#minimal.susemgr.prep[]."
msgstr "ດຳເນີນການຕໍ່ທີ່ xref:installation-and-upgrade:install-vm.adoc#minimal.susemgr.prep[]."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/install-vm.adoc:34
msgid "Configure RAM and number of CPUs (at least 16 GB RAM and 4 CPUs)."
msgstr "ກຳນົດຄ່າ RAM ແລະ ຈຳນວນ CPU (ຢ່າງຕ່ຳ 16 GB RAM ແລະ 4 CPU)."

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/install-vm.adoc:40
#, no-wrap
msgid "Preparing Virtual Machine for {productname}"
msgstr "ກຳລັງກຽມເຄື່ອງສະເໝືອນສຳລັບ {productname}"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/install-vm.adoc:41
msgid ""
"Before starting obtain your SUSE Manager Registration Code from SUSE "
"Customer Center - https://scc.suse.com."
msgstr "ກ່ອນເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ, ໃຫ້ຂໍລະຫັດລົງທະບຽນ SUSE Manager ຂອງທ່ານຈາກ SUSE Customer Center - https://scc.suse.com."

#. type: Block title
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/install-vm.adoc:42
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Preparing for {productname} run"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການກຽມພ້ອມສຳລັບການເປີດໃຊ້ {productname}"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/install-vm.adoc:44
msgid ""
"Register {productname} with SCC.  For example, replace `<productnumber>` "
"with `{productnumber}` and `<architecture>` with `x86_64`:"
msgstr "ລົງທະບຽນ {productname} ກັບ SCC. ຕົວຢ່າງ: ປ່ຽນ `<productnumber>` ເປັນ `{productnumber}` ແລະ `<architecture>` ເປັນ `x86_64`:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/install-vm.adoc:45
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/lts.adoc:7
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"SUSEConnect -e <EMAIL_ADDRESS> -r <SUSE_MANAGER_CODE> \\\n"
"  -p SUSE-Manager-Server/<productnumber>/<architecture>\n"
msgstr ""
"SUSEConnect -e <ອີເມລ໌> -r <ລະຫັດ_SUSE_MANAGER> \\\n"
"  -p SUSE-Manager-Server/<productnumber>/<architecture>\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/install-vm.adoc:46
msgid "Validate the authorized extensions by running the list extensions command:"
msgstr "ກວດສອບຄວາມຖືກຕ້ອງຂອງສ່ວນຂະຫຍາຍທີ່ໄດ້ຮັບອະນຸຍາດ ໂດຍໃຊ້ຄຳສັ່ງລາຍການສ່ວນຂະຫຍາຍ:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/install-vm.adoc:47
#, no-wrap
msgid "SUSEConnect --list-extensions\n"
msgstr "SUSEConnect --list-extensions\n"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/install-vm.adoc:49
#, no-wrap
