"SUSEConnect -p sle-module-basesystem/15.4/x86_64\n"
"SUSEConnect -p sle-module-server-applications/15.4/x86_64\n"
"SUSEConnect -p sle-module-web-scripting/15.4/x86_64\n"
"SUSEConnect -p sle-module-suse-manager-server/<productnumber>/x86_64\n"
msgstr ""
"SUSEConnect -p sle-module-basesystem/15.4/x86_64\n"
"SUSEConnect -p sle-module-server-applications/15.4/x86_64\n"
"SUSEConnect -p sle-module-web-scripting/15.4/x86_64\n"
"SUSEConnect -p sle-module-suse-manager-server/<productnumber>/x86_64\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/install-vm.adoc:50
msgid ""
"Prepare {productname} storage: [path]``suma-storage`` command automatically "
"prepares and configures previously created external storage for use with "
"{productname}.  In the following command the first parameter is the device "
"for {productname} data, the second parameter is the device for the database."
msgstr "ກຽມບ່ອນເກັບຂໍ້ມູນ {productname}: ຄຳສັ່ງ [path]``suma-storage`` ຈະກຽມ ແລະ ຕັ້ງຄ່າບ່ອນເກັບຂໍ້ມູນ ພາຍນອກທີ່ສ້າງໄວ້ກ່ອນໜ້ານີ້ເພື່ອໃຊ້ກັບ {productname} ໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດ. ໃນຄຳສັ່ງຕໍ່ໄປນີ້, ພາຣາມິເຕີທຳອິດແມ່ນອຸປະກອນສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນ {productname}, ພາຣາມິເຕີທີສອງແມ່ນອຸປະກອນສຳລັບຖານຂໍ້ມູນ."

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/install-vm.adoc:51
#, no-wrap
msgid "suma-storage /dev/vdb /dev/vdc\n"
msgstr "suma-storage /dev/vdb /dev/vdc\n"

#.  FIXME info about network configuration and applying update in readme
#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/install-vm.adoc:52
msgid "The virtual machine is now ready for {productname} to be set up."
msgstr "ເຄື່ອງສະເໝືອນພ້ອມແລ້ວສຳລັບການຕັ້ງຄ່າ {productname}."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/install-vm.adoc:53
msgid ""
"For proceeding with {productname} setup, see "
"xref:installation-and-upgrade:server-setup.adoc[SUSE Manager Setup]."
msgstr "ສຳລັບການດຳເນີນການຕັ້ງຄ່າ {productname} ຕໍ່, ເບິ່ງໄດ້ທີ່ xref:installation-and-upgrade:server-setup.adoc[ການຕັ້ງຄ່າ SUSE Manager]."

#. type: Title =
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/installation-and-upgrade-overview.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Installation and Upgrade Guide Overview"
msgstr "ພາບລວມຄຳແນະນຳການຕິດຕັ້ງ ແລະ ການອັບເກຣດ"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/installation-and-upgrade-overview.adoc:2
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/upgrade-intro.adoc:2
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Updated:** {docdate}\n"
msgstr "**ອັບເດດຫຼ້າສຸດ:** {docdate}\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/installation-and-upgrade-overview.adoc:3
msgid ""
"This book provides guidance on installing and upgrading {productname} Server "
"and Proxy.  It is split into the following sections:"
msgstr "ປຶ້ມຫົວນີ້ໃຫ້ຄຳແນະນຳໃນການຕິດຕັ້ງ ແລະ ອັບເກຣດ {productname} Server ແລະ Proxy. ໂດຍແບ່ງອອກເປັນພາກສ່ວນດັ່ງນີ້:"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/installation-and-upgrade-overview.adoc:4
msgid ""
"Requirements: Describes the hardware, software, and networking requirements "
"that you require before you begin."
msgstr "ຄວາມຕ້ອງການ: ອະທິບາຍກ່ຽວກັບຮາດແວ, ຊອບແວ ແລະ ຄວາມຕ້ອງການດ້ານເຄືອຂ່າຍທີ່ທ່ານຕ້ອງມີກ່ອນເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/installation-and-upgrade-overview.adoc:5
msgid "Installation: Describes the process to install {productname} components."
msgstr "ການຕິດຕັ້ງ: ອະທິບາຍຂັ້ນຕອນການຕິດຕັ້ງອົງປະກອບຕ່າງໆຂອງ {productname}."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/installation-and-upgrade-overview.adoc:6
msgid ""
"Setting Up: Describes the initial steps you need to take after installation "
"to make your {productname} environment ready to use."
msgstr "ການຕັ້ງຄ່າ: ອະທິບາຍຂັ້ນຕອນເບື້ອງຕົ້ນທີ່ທ່ານຕ້ອງເຮັດຫຼັງຈາກການຕິດຕັ້ງ ເພື່ອໃຫ້ສະພາບແວດລ້ອມ {productname} ພ້ອມໃຊ້ງານ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/installation-and-upgrade-overview.adoc:7
msgid ""
"Upgrade: Describes upgrading of the {productname} components, including the "
"underlying database."
msgstr "ການອັບເກຣດ: ອະທິບາຍການອັບເກຣດອົງປະກອບຂອງ {productname}, ລວມທັງຖານຂໍ້ມູນພື້ນຖານ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/installation-and-upgrade-overview.adoc:8
msgid ""
"It is possible to use a public cloud instance to install {productname}.  For "
"more information on using {productname} on a public cloud, see "
"xref:specialized-guides:public-cloud-guide/overview.adoc[].  For more "
"information on upgrading clients, see "
"xref:client-configuration:client-upgrades.adoc[]."
msgstr "ທ່ານສາມາດໃຊ້ Public Cloud Instance ເພື່ອຕິດຕັ້ງ {productname} ໄດ້. ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມ ກ່ຽວກັບການໃຊ້ {productname} ໃນຄລາວສາທາລະນະ, ເບິ່ງໄດ້ທີ່ xref:specialized-guides:public-cloud-guide/overview.adoc[]. ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບການອັບເກຣດໄຄເອັນ, ເບິ່ງໄດ້ທີ່ xref:client-configuration:client-upgrades.adoc[]."

