"| Host ຕ້ອງໄດ້ຮັບການຕັ້ງຄ່າເປັນ {salt} client\n"
"\n"

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/proxy-container-installation.adoc:15
#, no-wrap
msgid "Install Container Services on the Host System"
msgstr "ຕິດຕັ້ງ Container Services ໃນລະບົບ Host"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/proxy-container-installation.adoc:16
msgid ""
"{productname} Proxy containers are using [literal]``podman`` and "
"[literal]``systemd`` to run and manage all proxy containers."
msgstr "{productname} Proxy containers ໃຊ້ [literal]``podman`` ແລະ [literal]``systemd`` ໃນການເປີດໃຊ້ ແລະ ຈັດການ proxy containers ທັງໝົດ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/proxy-container-installation.adoc:17
msgid ""
"The first step is to install container control files provided by package "
"[literal]``uyuni-proxy-systemd-services``."
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນທຳອິດແມ່ນຕິດຕັ້ງໄຟລ໌ຄວບຄຸມຄອນເທນເນີ ທີ່ໃຫ້ມາພ້ອມກັບແພັກເກັດ [literal]``uyuni-proxy-systemd-services``."

#. type: Block title
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/proxy-container-installation.adoc:18
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Installation of Container Services for {productname} Proxy"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການຕິດຕັ້ງ Container Services ສຳລັບ {productname} Proxy"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/proxy-container-installation.adoc:19
msgid ""
"Assign [literal]``Containers Module`` software channel to the container host "
"in the {productname}.  For more information about assigning software "
"channels to the system, see xref:administration:channel-management.adoc[]."
msgstr "ກຳນົດຊ່ອງທາງຊອບແວ (software channel) [literal]``Containers Module`` ໃຫ້ກັບ container host ໃນ {productname}. ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບການກຳນົດຊ່ອງທາງຊອບແວໃຫ້ກັບລະບົບ, ເບິ່ງໄດ້ທີ່ xref:administration:channel-management.adoc[]."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/proxy-container-installation.adoc:20
msgid "Log in as `root` on the container host."
msgstr "ເຂົ້າສູ່ລະບົບດ້ວຍ `root` ໃນ container host."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/proxy-container-installation.adoc:21
msgid "Manually install {productname} Proxy service package:"
msgstr "ຕິດຕັ້ງແພັກເກັດບໍລິການ {productname} Proxy ດ້ວຍຕົນເອງ:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/proxy-container-installation.adoc:22
#, no-wrap
msgid "zypper install uyuni-proxy-systemd-services\n"
msgstr "zypper install uyuni-proxy-systemd-services\n"

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/proxy-container-installation.adoc:23
msgid ""
"Package [literal]``uyuni-proxy-systemd-service`` comes from the following "
"channels:"
msgstr "ແພັກເກັດ [literal]``uyuni-proxy-systemd-service`` ມາຈາກຊ່ອງທາງຕໍ່ໄປນີ້:"

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/proxy-container-installation.adoc:24
msgid "SLE-Manager-Tools_15"
msgstr "SLE-Manager-Tools_15"

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/proxy-container-installation.adoc:25
msgid "SLE-Manager-Tools-For-Micro_5 in the case of {sle-micro}"
msgstr "SLE-Manager-Tools-For-Micro_5 ໃນກໍລະນີຂອງ {sle-micro}"

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/proxy-container-installation.adoc:26
#, no-wrap
msgid "Customize {productname} Proxy Configuration"
msgstr "ປັບແຕ່ງການຕັ້ງຄ່າ {productname} Proxy"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/proxy-container-installation.adoc:27
msgid ""
"{productname} Proxy containers require some volumes to be mounted for long "
"term storage.  Those volumes are automatically created by "
"[literal]``podman`` and can be listed using the [command]``podman volume "
"ls`` command.  By default, [literal]``podman`` stores the files of the "
"volumes in [path]``/var/lib/containers/storage/volumes``.  The volumes are "
"named:"
msgstr "{productname} Proxy containers ຕ້ອງການບາງ volumes ເພື່ອ mount ສຳລັບການເກັບຂໍ້ມູນໄລຍະຍາວ. volumes ເຫຼົ່ານັ້ນຈະຖືກສ້າງໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດໂດຍ [literal]``podman`` ແລະ ສາມາດເບິ່ງລາຍການໄດ້ ໂດຍໃຊ້ຄຳສັ່ງ [command]``podman volume ls``. ໂດຍເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ, [literal]``podman`` ຈະເກັບໄຟລ໌ ຂອງ volumes ໄວ້ໃນ [path]``/var/lib/containers/storage/volumes``. volumes ຈະມີຊື່ວ່າ:"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/proxy-container-installation.adoc:28
msgid "[path]``uyuni-proxy-squid-cache``"
msgstr "[path]``uyuni-proxy-squid-cache``"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/proxy-container-installation.adoc:29
msgid "[path]``uyuni-proxy-rhn-cache``"
msgstr "[path]``uyuni-proxy-rhn-cache``"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/proxy-container-installation.adoc:30
msgid "[path]``uyuni-proxy-tftpboot``"
msgstr "[path]``uyuni-proxy-tftpboot``"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/proxy-container-installation.adoc:31
msgid ""
"To override default volume settings, create the volumes prior to the first "
"start of the pod using the [command]``podman volume create`` command."
msgstr "ເພື່ອປ່ຽນການຕັ້ງຄ່າ volume ເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ, ໃຫ້ສ້າງ volumes ກ່ອນທີ່ຈະເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ pod ເປັນຄັ້ງທຳອິດ ໂດຍໃຊ້ຄຳສັ່ງ [command]``podman volume create``."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/proxy-container-installation.adoc:32
msgid ""
"It is possible to add custom arguments passed to podman container pod to "
"[path]``/etc/sysconfig/uyuni-proxy-systemd-services.config``:"
msgstr "ທ່ານສາມາດເພີ່ມອາກິວເມັນ (arguments) ແບບກຳນົດເອງເພື່ອສົ່ງໃຫ້ podman container pod ໄດ້ທີ່ [path]``/etc/sysconfig/uyuni-proxy-systemd-services.config``:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/proxy-container-installation.adoc:33
#, no-wrap
msgid "EXTRA_POD_ARGS=''\n"
msgstr "EXTRA_POD_ARGS=''\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/proxy-container-installation.adoc:34
msgid "In this file it is possible to modify tag to use for container images:"
msgstr "ໃນໄຟລ໌ນີ້, ທ່ານສາມາດແກ້ໄຂ tag ທີ່ຈະໃຊ້ສຳລັບ container images ໄດ້:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/proxy-container-installation.adoc:35
#, no-wrap
msgid "TAG=latest\n"
msgstr "TAG=latest\n"

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/proxy-container-installation.adoc:36
msgid ""
"Changing the [path]``uyuni-proxy-systemd-services.config`` file and "
"especially the [literal]``TAG`` setting is dangerous and can cause a "
"non-functional system."
msgstr "ການປ່ຽນແປງໄຟລ໌ [path]``uyuni-proxy-systemd-services.config`` ໂດຍສະເພາະການຕັ້ງຄ່າ [literal]``TAG`` ແມ່ນມີຄວາມສ່ຽງ ແລະ ອາດຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ລະບົບໃຊ້ງານບໍ່ໄດ້."

#. type: Title ===
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/proxy-container-installation.adoc:37
#, no-wrap
msgid "Using a Custom Container Image for a Service"
msgstr "ການໃຊ້ Container Image ແບບກຳນົດເອງສຳລັບບໍລິການ"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/proxy-container-installation.adoc:38
msgid ""
"By default, the {productname} Proxy suite is set to use the same image "
"version and registry path for each of its services.  However, it is possible "
"to override the default values for a specific service.  The "
"[literal]``uyuni-proxy`` CLI bundled with the package, runs "
"[command]``update image`` with the following parameters:"
msgstr "ໂດຍເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ, {productname} Proxy suite ຖືກຕັ້ງຄ່າໃຫ້ໃຊ້ເວີຊັນອິມເມຈ ແລະ ເສັ້ນທາງ registry ດຽວກັນສຳລັບທຸກບໍລິການ. ແນວໃດກໍຕາມ, ທ່ານສາມາດປ່ຽນຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນສຳລັບບາງບໍລິການໄດ້. ເຄື່ອງມື [literal]``uyuni-proxy`` CLI ທີ່ມາພ້ອມກັບແພັກເກັດ ຈະໃຊ້ຄຳສັ່ງ [command]``update image`` ພ້ອມກັບພາຣາມິເຕີຕໍ່ໄປນີ້:"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/proxy-container-installation.adoc:39
msgid "[literal]``-s`` for the service name"
msgstr "[literal]``-s`` ສຳລັບຊື່ບໍລິການ"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/proxy-container-installation.adoc:40
msgid "[literal]``-t`` for the version tag"
msgstr "[literal]``-t`` ສຳລັບເວີຊັນແທັກ (version tag)"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/proxy-container-installation.adoc:41
msgid "[literal]``-r`` for the registry path"
msgstr "[literal]``-r`` ສຳລັບເສັ້ນທາງ registry"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/proxy-container-installation.adoc:42
msgid "For example, use it like this:"
msgstr "ຕົວຢ່າງ: ໃຊ້ງານແບບນີ້:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/proxy-container-installation.adoc:43
#, no-wrap
msgid "uyuni-proxy update image -s httpd -t 0.1.0 -r registry.opensuse.org/uyuni\n"
msgstr "uyuni-proxy update image -s httpd -t 0.1.0 -r registry.opensuse.org/uyuni\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/proxy-container-installation.adoc:44
msgid ""
"It adjusts the configuration file for the httpd service, where "
"[path]``registry.opensuse.org/uyuni`` is the registry and [literal]``0.1.0`` "
"is the version tag, before restarting it."
msgstr "ມັນຈະປັບປຸງໄຟລ໌ການຕັ້ງຄ່າສຳລັບບໍລິການ httpd, ໂດຍທີ່ [path]``registry.opensuse.org/uyuni`` ແມ່ນ registry ແລະ [literal]``0.1.0`` ແມ່ນເວີຊັນແທັກ, ກ່ອນທີ່ຈະເລີ່ມລະບົບໃໝ່."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/proxy-container-installation.adoc:45
msgid ""
"To reset the values to defaults, run the proxy reset command, specifying the "
"service with the [literal]``-s`` parameter:"
msgstr "ເພື່ອຣີເຊັດຄ່າໃຫ້ເປັນຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ, ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ຄຳສັ່ງ proxy reset ໂດຍລະບຸບໍລິການດ້ວຍພາຣາມິເຕີ [literal]``-s``:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/proxy-container-installation.adoc:46
#, no-wrap
msgid "uyuni-proxy reset -s httpd\n"
msgstr "uyuni-proxy reset -s httpd\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/proxy-container-installation.adoc:47
msgid ""
"This command first resets the configuration of the [literal]``httpd`` "
"service to the global defaults and then reloads it."
msgstr "ຄຳສັ່ງນີ້ຈະຣີເຊັດການຕັ້ງຄ່າຂອງບໍລິການ [literal]``httpd`` ໃຫ້ເປັນຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນທົ່ວໂລກ ແລະ ຈາກນັ້ນກໍໂຫຼດຂໍ້ມູນໃໝ່."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/proxy-container-installation.adoc:48
msgid "For more information, see [command]``uyuni-proxy --help``."
msgstr "ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມ, ເບິ່ງໄດ້ທີ່ [command]``uyuni-proxy --help``."

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/proxy-container-installation.adoc:49
#, no-wrap
msgid "Allow Network Access for Provided Services on Container Host Firewall"
msgstr "ອະນຸຍາດການເຂົ້າເຖິງເຄືອຂ່າຍສຳລັບບໍລິການຕ່າງໆໃນ Container Host Firewall"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/proxy-container-installation.adoc:50
msgid ""
"{productname} Proxy containers work as so called node-port service.  This "
"means proxy container pod shares container host network TCP and UDP port "
"space.  For this reason container host firewall must be configured to accept "
"incoming traffic on ports used by {productname} Proxy containers.  Those "
"ports are:"
msgstr "{productname} Proxy containers ເຮັດວຽກໃນຮູບແບບທີ່ເອີ້ນວ່າ node-port service. ເຊິ່ງໝາຍຄວາມວ່າ proxy container pod ຈະໃຊ້ພື້ນທີ່ພອດ TCP ແລະ UDP ຮ່ວມກັບເຄືອຂ່າຍຂອງ container host. ດ້ວຍເຫດນີ້, container host firewall ຕ້ອງໄດ້ຮັບການຕັ້ງຄ່າເພື່ອຮັບການຈະລາຈອນຂາເຂົ້າ ໃນພອດທີ່ {productname} Proxy containers ໃຊ້. ພອດເຫຼົ່ານັ້ນແມ່ນ:"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/proxy-container-installation.adoc:51
msgid "69/UDP - TFTP"
msgstr "69/UDP - TFTP"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/proxy-container-installation.adoc:52
msgid "80/TCP - HTTP"
msgstr "80/TCP - HTTP"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/proxy-container-installation.adoc:53
msgid "443/TCP - HTTPS"
msgstr "443/TCP - HTTPS"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/proxy-container-installation.adoc:54
msgid "4505/TCP - Salt"
msgstr "4505/TCP - Salt"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/proxy-container-installation.adoc:55
msgid "4506/TCP - Salt"
msgstr "4506/TCP - Salt"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/proxy-container-installation.adoc:56
msgid "8022/TCP - SSH"
msgstr "8022/TCP - SSH"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/proxy-container-installation.adoc:57
msgid ""
"Continue with setting up the installed {productname} Proxy as a containers "
"at xref:installation-and-upgrade:proxy-container-setup.adoc[]."
msgstr "ດຳເນີນການຕັ້ງຄ່າ {productname} Proxy ທີ່ຕິດຕັ້ງແລ້ວໃນຮູບແບບ containers ຕໍ່ໄດ້ທີ່ xref:installation-and-upgrade:proxy-container-setup.adoc[]."

#. type: Title =
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/proxy-container-k3s-installation.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Install Containerized {productname} Proxy on k3s"
msgstr "ຕິດຕັ້ງ {productname} Proxy ແບບຄອນເທນເນີໃນ k3s"

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/proxy-container-k3s-installation.adoc:2
#, no-wrap
msgid "Installing k3s"
msgstr "ກຳລັງຕິດຕັ້ງ k3s"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/proxy-container-k3s-installation.adoc:3
msgid ""
"On the container host machine, install [literal]``k3s`` without the load "
"balancer and traefik router (replace [literal]``<K3S_HOST_FQDN>`` with the "
"FQDN of your k3s host):"
msgstr "ໃນເຄື່ອງ container host, ໃຫ້ຕິດຕັ້ງ [literal]``k3s`` ໂດຍບໍ່ມີ load balancer ແລະ traefik router (ປ່ຽນ [literal]``<K3S_HOST_FQDN>`` ເປັນ FQDN ຂອງ k3s host ຂອງທ່ານ):"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/proxy-container-k3s-installation.adoc:4
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"curl -sfL https://get.k3s.io | INSTALL_K3S_EXEC=\"--disable=traefik "
"--disable=servicelb --tls-san=<K3S_HOST_FQDN>\" sh -\n"
msgstr "curl -sfL https://get.k3s.io | INSTALL_K3S_EXEC=\"--disable=traefik --disable=servicelb --tls-san=<K3S_HOST_FQDN>\" sh -\n"

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/proxy-container-k3s-installation.adoc:5
#, no-wrap
msgid "Configuring cluster access"
msgstr "ການຕັ້ງຄ່າການເຂົ້າເຖິງຄລັສເຕີ (cluster)"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/proxy-container-k3s-installation.adoc:6
msgid ""
"[literal]``helm`` needs a configuration file to connect to the target "
"kubernetes cluster."
msgstr "[literal]``helm`` ຕ້ອງການໄຟລ໌ການຕັ້ງຄ່າເພື່ອເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ກັບ kubernetes cluster ປາຍທາງ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/proxy-container-k3s-installation.adoc:7
msgid ""
"On the cluster server machine run the following command to create the "
"[path]``kubeconfig-k3s.yaml`` configuration file.  The "
"[path]``kubeconfig-k3s.yaml`` file can be optionally transferred to a work "
"machine:"
msgstr "ໃນເຄື່ອງ cluster server ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ຄຳສັ່ງຕໍ່ໄປນີ້ເພື່ອສ້າງໄຟລ໌ການຕັ້ງຄ່າ [path]``kubeconfig-k3s.yaml``. ທ່ານສາມາດໂອນໄຟລ໌ [path]``kubeconfig-k3s.yaml`` ໄປຍັງເຄື່ອງອື່ນໄດ້ຫາກຕ້ອງການ:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/proxy-container-k3s-installation.adoc:8
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"kubectl config view --flatten=true | sed 's/127.0.0.1/<K3S_HOST_FQDN>/' "
">kubeconfig-k3s.yaml\n"
msgstr "kubectl config view --flatten=true | sed 's/127.0.0.1/<K3S_HOST_FQDN>/' >kubeconfig-k3s.yaml\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/proxy-container-k3s-installation.adoc:9
msgid "Before calling [literal]``helm``, run:"
msgstr "ກ່ອນຈະເອີ້ນໃຊ້ [literal]``helm``, ໃຫ້ພິມ:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/proxy-container-k3s-installation.adoc:10
#, no-wrap
msgid "export KUBECONFIG=/path/to/kubeconfig-k3s.yaml\n"
msgstr "export KUBECONFIG=/ເສັ້ນທາງ/ໄປຫາ/kubeconfig-k3s.yaml\n"

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/proxy-container-k3s-installation.adoc:11
#, no-wrap
msgid "Installing helm"
msgstr "ກຳລັງຕິດຕັ້ງ helm"

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/proxy-container-k3s-installation.adoc:12
msgid "The Containers Module is required to install [literal]``helm``."
msgstr "ຕ້ອງມີ Containers Module ເພື່ອຕິດຕັ້ງ [literal]``helm``."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/proxy-container-k3s-installation.adoc:13
msgid "To install it run:"
msgstr "ວິທີຕິດຕັ້ງແມ່ນໃຫ້ພິມ:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/proxy-container-k3s-installation.adoc:14
#, no-wrap
msgid "zypper in helm\n"
msgstr "zypper in helm\n"

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/proxy-container-k3s-installation.adoc:15
#, no-wrap
msgid "Installing [literal]``metalLB``"
msgstr "ກຳລັງຕິດຕັ້ງ [literal]``metalLB``"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/proxy-container-k3s-installation.adoc:16
msgid ""
"[literal]``MetalLB`` is the load balancer that will expose the {productname} "
"proxy pod services to the outside world.  To install it, run:"
msgstr "[literal]``MetalLB`` ແມ່ນ load balancer ທີ່ຈະເປີດບໍລິການ {productname} proxy pod ໃຫ້ໂລກພາຍນອກເຂົ້າເຖິງໄດ້. ວິທີຕິດຕັ້ງໃຫ້ພິມ:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/proxy-container-k3s-installation.adoc:17
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"helm repo add metallb https://metallb.github.io/metallb\n"
"helm install --create-namespace -n metallb metallb metallb/metallb \n"
msgstr ""
"helm repo add metallb https://metallb.github.io/metallb\n"
"helm install --create-namespace -n metallb metallb metallb/metallb \n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/proxy-container-k3s-installation.adoc:18
msgid ""
"[literal]``MetalLB`` still requires a configuration to know the virtual IP "
"address range to be used.  In this example, the virtual IP addresses will be "
"from [literal]``192.168.122.240`` to [literal]``192.168.122.250``, but that "
"range could be lowered to a single address if the host only exposes the "
"{productname} proxy.  These addresses need to be a subset of the server "
"network."
msgstr "[literal]``MetalLB`` ຍັງຕ້ອງໄດ້ຮັບການຕັ້ງຄ່າເພື່ອຮູ້ຈັກຊ່ວງທີ່ຢູ່ virtual IP ທີ່ຈະໃຊ້. ໃນຕົວຢ່າງນີ້, virtual IP ຈະເລີ່ມຈາກ [literal]``192.168.122.240`` ຫາ [literal]``192.168.122.250``, ແຕ່ຊ່ວງນີ້ສາມາດຫຼຸດລົງເຫຼືອທີ່ຢູ່ດຽວໄດ້ຫາກ host ເປີດໃຊ້ງານພຽງແຕ່ {productname} proxy. ທີ່ຢູ່ເຫຼົ່ານີ້ຕ້ອງເປັນສ່ວນໜຶ່ງຂອງເຄືອຂ່າຍເຊີເວີ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/proxy-container-k3s-installation.adoc:19
msgid ""
"Create a [path]``metallb-config.yaml`` configuration file with the following "
"settings and an IP address range that aligns with the deployed network:"
msgstr "ສ້າງໄຟລ໌ການຕັ້ງຄ່າ [path]``metallb-config.yaml`` ດ້ວຍຄ່າຕໍ່ໄປນີ້ ແລະ ກຳນົດຊ່ວງທີ່ຢູ່ IP ໃຫ້ສອດຄ່ອງກັບເຄືອຂ່າຍທີ່ທ່ານໃຊ້:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/proxy-container-k3s-installation.adoc:20
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"apiVersion: metallb.io/v1beta1\n"
"kind: IPAddressPool\n"
"metadata:\n"
"  name: l2-pool\n"
"  namespace: metallb\n"
"spec:\n"
"  addresses:\n"
"  - 192.168.122.240-192.168.122.250\n"
"---\n"
msgstr ""
"apiVersion: metallb.io/v1beta1\n"
"kind: IPAddressPool\n"
"metadata:\n"
"  name: l2-pool\n"
"  namespace: metallb\n"
"spec:\n"
"  addresses:\n"
"  - 192.168.122.240-192.168.122.250\n"
"---\n"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/proxy-container-k3s-installation.adoc:21
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"apiVersion: metallb.io/v1beta1\n"
"kind: L2Advertisement\n"
"metadata:\n"
"  name: l2 \n"
"  namespace: metallb\n"
"spec:\n"
"  ipAddressPools:\n"
"  - l2-pool\n"
msgstr ""
"apiVersion: metallb.io/v1beta1\n"
"kind: L2Advertisement\n"
"metadata:\n"
"  name: l2 \n"
"  namespace: metallb\n"
"spec:\n"
"  ipAddressPools:\n"
"  - l2-pool\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/proxy-container-k3s-installation.adoc:22
msgid "Apply this configuration by running:"
msgstr "ໃຊ້ງານການຕັ້ງຄ່ານີ້ໂດຍພິມ:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/proxy-container-k3s-installation.adoc:23
#, no-wrap
msgid "kubectl apply -f metallb-config.yaml\n"
msgstr "kubectl apply -f metallb-config.yaml\n"

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/proxy-container-k3s-installation.adoc:24
#, no-wrap
msgid "Deploying the {productname} proxy helm chart"
msgstr "ກຳລັງຕິດຕັ້ງ {productname} proxy helm chart"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/proxy-container-k3s-installation.adoc:25
msgid ""
"Create a configuration file forcing the IP address that [literal]``MetalLB`` "
"will use for the {productname} Proxy services.  This IP address needs to be "
"the one to which the proxy FQDN entered when creating the proxy "
"configuration.  It also needs to be resolvable from both the {productname} "
"Server and the client systems to connect to the proxy."
msgstr "ສ້າງໄຟລ໌ການຕັ້ງຄ່າເພື່ອບັງຄັບໃຫ້ [literal]``MetalLB`` ໃຊ້ທີ່ຢູ່ IP ທີ່ກຳນົດສຳລັບບໍລິການ {productname} Proxy. ທີ່ຢູ່ IP ນີ້ຕ້ອງເປັນທີ່ຢູ່ທີ່ກົງກັບ FQDN ຂອງ proxy ທີ່ປ້ອນໄວ້ຕອນສ້າງການຕັ້ງຄ່າ proxy. ນອກຈາກນີ້, ມັນຕ້ອງສາມາດລະບຸຕົວຕົນໄດ້ທັງຈາກ {productname} Server ແລະ ລະບົບໄຄເອັນ ເພື່ອເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ຫາ proxy."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/proxy-container-k3s-installation.adoc:26
msgid "This example will use [literal]``192.168.122.241``."
msgstr "ຕົວຢ່າງນີ້ຈະໃຊ້ [literal]``192.168.122.241``."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/proxy-container-k3s-installation.adoc:27
msgid ""
"Create a [path]``custom-values.yaml`` file with the following content.  If "
"the [literal]``MetalLB`` IP address range only contains a single address, "
"the last line can be removed."
msgstr "ສ້າງໄຟລ໌ [path]``custom-values.yaml`` ທີ່ມີເນື້ອຫາຕໍ່ໄປນີ້. ຫາກຊ່ວງທີ່ຢູ່ IP ຂອງ [literal]``MetalLB`` ມີພຽງແຕ່ທີ່ຢູ່ດຽວ, ທ່ານສາມາດລຶບແຖວສຸດທ້າຍອອກໄດ້."

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/proxy-container-k3s-installation.adoc:28
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"services:\n"
"  annotations:\n"
"    metallb.universe.tf/allow-shared-ip: key-to-share-ip\n"
"    metallb.universe.tf/loadBalancerIPs: 192.168.122.241\n"
msgstr ""
"services:\n"
"  annotations:\n"
"    metallb.universe.tf/allow-shared-ip: key-to-share-ip\n"
"    metallb.universe.tf/loadBalancerIPs: 192.168.122.241\n"

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/proxy-container-k3s-installation.adoc:29
msgid ""
"The parameter [literal]``metallb.universe.tf/allow-shared-ip`` does not need "
"changing.  You need to adjust the parameter "
"[literal]``metallb.universe.tf/loadBalancerIPs`` to your network setup."
msgstr "ພາຣາມິເຕີ [literal]``metallb.universe.tf/allow-shared-ip`` ບໍ່ຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງປ່ຽນແປງ. ທ່ານພຽງແຕ່ຕ້ອງປັບພາຣາມິເຕີ [literal]``metallb.universe.tf/loadBalancerIPs`` ໃຫ້ກົງກັບການຕັ້ງຄ່າເຄືອຂ່າຍຂອງທ່ານ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/proxy-container-k3s-installation.adoc:30
msgid ""
"To configure the storage of the volumes to be used by the {productname} "
"Proxy pod, define persistent volumes for the following claims.  For more "
"informationm see "
"https://kubernetes.io/docs/concepts/storage/persistent-volumes/ (kubernetes) "
"or https://rancher.com/docs/k3s/latest/en/storage/ (k3s) documentation.  The "
"persistent volume claims are named:"
msgstr "ເພື່ອຕັ້ງຄ່າການເກັບຂໍ້ມູນຂອງ volumes ທີ່ຈະໃຊ້ໂດຍ {productname} Proxy pod, ໃຫ້ກຳນົດ persistent volumes ສຳລັບຄຳຮ້ອງຂໍ (claims) ຕໍ່ໄປນີ້. ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມ, ເບິ່ງໄດ້ທີ່ ເອກະສານຂອງ kubernetes ຫຼື k3s. ຊື່ຂອງ persistent volume claims ແມ່ນ:"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/proxy-container-k3s-installation.adoc:31
msgid "[literal]``squid-cache-pv-claim``"
msgstr "[literal]``squid-cache-pv-claim``"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/proxy-container-k3s-installation.adoc:32
msgid "[literal]``/package-cache-pv-claim``"
msgstr "[literal]``/package-cache-pv-claim``"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/proxy-container-k3s-installation.adoc:33
msgid "[literal]``/tftp-boot-pv-claim``"
msgstr "[literal]``/tftp-boot-pv-claim``"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/proxy-container-k3s-installation.adoc:34
msgid ""
"Create the configuration for the {productname} Proxy as documented in "
"xref:installation-and-upgrade:proxy-container-setup.adoc[].  Copy and "
"extract the configuration [literal]``tar.gz`` file and then deploy the helm "
"chart:"
msgstr "ສ້າງການຕັ້ງຄ່າສຳລັບ {productname} Proxy ຕາມທີ່ລະບຸໄວ້ໃນ xref:installation-and-upgrade:proxy-container-setup.adoc[]. ສຳເນົາ ແລະ ແຕກໄຟລ໌ ການຕັ້ງຄ່າ [literal]``tar.gz`` ຈາກນັ້ນໃຫ້ຕິດຕັ້ງ helm chart:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/proxy-container-k3s-installation.adoc:35
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"tar xf /path/to/config.tar.gz\n"
"helm install uyuni-proxy oci://registry.opensuse.org/uyuni/proxy -f "
"config.yaml -f httpd.yaml -f ssh.yaml -f custom-values.yaml\n"
msgstr ""
"tar xf /path/to/config.tar.gz\n"
"helm install uyuni-proxy oci://registry.opensuse.org/uyuni/proxy -f config.yaml -f httpd.yaml -f ssh.yaml -f custom-values.yaml\n"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/proxy-container-k3s-installation.adoc:36
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"tar xf /path/to/config.tar.gz\n"
"helm install uyuni-proxy oci://registry.suse.com/suse/manager/4.3/proxy -f "
"config.yaml -f httpd.yaml -f ssh.yaml -f custom-values.yaml\n"
msgstr ""
"tar xf /path/to/config.tar.gz\n"
"helm install uyuni-proxy oci://registry.suse.com/suse/manager/4.3/proxy -f config.yaml -f httpd.yaml -f ssh.yaml -f custom-values.yaml\n"

#. type: Title =
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/proxy-container-setup.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Containerized {productname} Proxy Setup"
msgstr "ການຕັ້ງຄ່າ {productname} Proxy ແບບຄອນເທນເນີ"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/proxy-container-setup.adoc:2
msgid ""
"Once container host for {productname} Proxy containers is prepared, setup of "
"containers require few additional steps to finish configuration."
msgstr "ເມື່ອ container host ສຳລັບ {productname} Proxy containers ພ້ອມແລ້ວ, ການຕັ້ງຄ່າ containers ຍັງມີອີກສອງສາມຂັ້ນຕອນເພື່ອໃຫ້ສຳເລັດ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/proxy-container-setup.adoc:3
msgid "Generate {productname} Proxy configuration archive file"
msgstr "ສ້າງໄຟລ໌ເກັບຂໍ້ມູນການຕັ້ງຄ່າ {productname} Proxy (configuration archive)"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/proxy-container-setup.adoc:4
msgid ""
"Transfer configuration archive to the container host prepared in "
"installation step and extract it"
msgstr "ໂອນໄຟລ໌ການຕັ້ງຄ່າໄປຍັງ container host ທີ່ກຽມໄວ້ໃນຂັ້ນຕອນການຕິດຕັ້ງ ແລະ ແຕກໄຟລ໌ນັ້ນອອກ"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/proxy-container-setup.adoc:5
msgid "Start [literal]``systemd`` proxy services"
msgstr "ເລີ່ມຕົ້ນບໍລິການ [literal]``systemd`` proxy"

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/proxy-container-setup.adoc:6
#, no-wrap
msgid "Create and generate {productname} Proxy configuration"
msgstr "ສ້າງ ແລະ ຜະລິດການຕັ້ງຄ່າ {productname} Proxy"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/proxy-container-setup.adoc:7
msgid ""
"Configuration of {productname} Proxy is generated by {productname} Server "
"and this configuration generation is required to be done for each "
"containerized proxy.  There are two ways how to generate {productname} "
"configuration: use the {webui} or the [literal]``spacecmd`` command."
msgstr "ການຕັ້ງຄ່າຂອງ {productname} Proxy ຈະຖືກສ້າງຂຶ້ນໂດຍ {productname} Server ແລະ ຕ້ອງເຮັດ ສຳລັບແຕ່ລະ containerized proxy. ມີສອງວິທີໃນການສ້າງການຕັ້ງຄ່າ {productname}: ໃຊ້ {webui} ຫຼື ໃຊ້ຄຳສັ່ງ [literal]``spacecmd``."

#. type: Block title
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/proxy-container-setup.adoc:8
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Generating Of Container Services Configuration using Web UI"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການສ້າງການຕັ້ງຄ່າ Container Services ໂດຍໃຊ້ Web UI"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/proxy-container-setup.adoc:9
msgid ""
"In the {webui}, navigate to menu:Systems[Proxy Configuration] and fill the "
"required data:"
msgstr "ໃນ {webui}, ໃຫ້ໄປທີ່ menu:Systems[Proxy Configuration] ແລ້ວປ້ອນຂໍ້ມູນທີ່ຈຳເປັນ:"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/proxy-container-setup.adoc:10
msgid ""
"In the [guimenu]``Proxy FQDN`` field type fully qualified domain name for "
"the proxy."
msgstr "ໃນຊ່ອງ [guimenu]``Proxy FQDN`` ໃຫ້ພິມຊື່ໂດເມນທີ່ສົມບູນ (FQDN) ສຳລັບ proxy."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/proxy-container-setup.adoc:11
msgid ""
"In the [guimenu]``Parent FQDN`` field type fully qualified domain name for "
"the {productname} Server or another {productname} Proxy."
msgstr "ໃນຊ່ອງ [guimenu]``Parent FQDN`` ໃຫ້ພິມ FQDN ຂອງ {productname} Server ຫຼື {productname} Proxy ອື່ນ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/proxy-container-setup.adoc:12
msgid ""
"In the [guimenu]``Proxy SSH port`` field type SSH port on which SSH service "
"is listening on {productname} Proxy. Recommended is to keep default 8022."
msgstr "ໃນຊ່ອງ [guimenu]``Proxy SSH port`` ໃຫ້ພິມພອດ SSH ທີ່ບໍລິການ SSH ໃຊ້ຟັງຢູ່ ໃນ {productname} Proxy. ແນະນຳໃຫ້ໃຊ້ຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນແມ່ນ 8022."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/proxy-container-setup.adoc:13
msgid ""
"In the [guimenu]``Max Squid cache size [MB]`` field type maximal allowed "
"size for Squid cache. Typically this should be at most 60% of available "
"storage for the containers."
msgstr "ໃນຊ່ອງ [guimenu]``Max Squid cache size [MB]`` ໃຫ້ພິມຂະໜາດສູງສຸດທີ່ອະນຸຍາດສຳລັບ Squid cache. ໂດຍປົກກະຕິຄວນບໍ່ເກີນ 60% ຂອງພື້ນທີ່ເກັບຂໍ້ມູນທີ່ມີສຳລັບ containers."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/proxy-container-setup.adoc:14
msgid ""
"In the [guimenu]``SSL certificate`` selection list choose if new server "
"certificate should be generated for {productname} Proxy or an existing one "
"should be used.  You can consider generated certificates as {productname} "
"builtin (self signed) certificates."
msgstr "ໃນລາຍການເລືອກ [guimenu]``SSL certificate`` ໃຫ້ເລືອກວ່າຈະສ້າງໃບຢັ້ງຢືນເຊີເວີໃໝ່ສຳລັບ {productname} Proxy ຫຼື ຈະໃຊ້ໃບຢັ້ງຢືນທີ່ມີຢູ່ແລ້ວ. ໃບຢັ້ງຢືນທີ່ສ້າງຂຶ້ນຈະຖືວ່າເປັນ ໃບຢັ້ງຢືນທີ່ {productname} ສ້າງເອງ (self signed)."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/proxy-container-setup.adoc:15
msgid ""
"Depending on the choice then provide either path to signing CA certificate "
"to generate a new certificate or path to an existing certificate and its key "
"to be used as proxy certificate."
msgstr "ຂຶ້ນຢູ່ກັບທາງເລືອກ, ຈາກນັ້ນໃຫ້ລະບຸເສັ້ນທາງໄປຫາໃບຢັ້ງຢືນ CA ທີ່ໃຊ້ເຊັນເພື່ອສ້າງໃບຢັ້ງຢືນໃໝ່ ຫຼື ເສັ້ນທາງໄປຫາໃບຢັ້ງຢືນທີ່ມີຢູ່ແລ້ວ ແລະ ກຸນແຈ (key) ທີ່ຈະໃຊ້ເປັນໃບຢັ້ງຢືນ proxy."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/proxy-container-setup.adoc:16
msgid ""
"The CA certificates generated on the server are stored in the "
"[path]``/root/ssl-build`` directory."
msgstr "ໃບຢັ້ງຢືນ CA ທີ່ສ້າງຂຶ້ນໃນເຊີເວີຈະຖືກເກັບໄວ້ໃນໄດເຣັກທໍຣີ [path]``/root/ssl-build``."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/proxy-container-setup.adoc:17
msgid ""
"For more information about existing or custom certificates and the concept "
"of corporate and intermediate certificates, see "
"xref:administration:ssl-certs-imported.adoc[]."
msgstr "ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບໃບຢັ້ງຢືນທີ່ມີຢູ່ແລ້ວ ຫຼື ແບບກຳນົດເອງ ແລະ ແນວຄິດກ່ຽວກັບ corporate ແລະ intermediate certificates, ເບິ່ງໄດ້ທີ່ xref:administration:ssl-certs-imported.adoc[]."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/proxy-container-setup.adoc:18
msgid ""
"Click btn:[Generate] to register new proxy FQDN in {productname} Server and "
"generate configuration archive with details for container host."
msgstr "ຄລິກ btn:[Generate] ເພື່ອລົງທະບຽນ proxy FQDN ໃໝ່ໃນ {productname} Server ແລະ ສ້າງໄຟລ໌ເກັບການຕັ້ງຄ່າພ້ອມລາຍລະອຽດສຳລັບ container host."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/proxy-container-setup.adoc:19
msgid ""
"After a few moments you are presented with file to download. Save this file "
"locally."
msgstr "ຫຼັງຈາກນັ້ນຈັກພັກໜຶ່ງ, ທ່ານຈະເຫັນໄຟລ໌ໃຫ້ດາວໂຫຼດ. ໃຫ້ບັນທຶກໄຟລ໌ນີ້ໄວ້ໃນເຄື່ອງຂອງທ່ານ."

#. type: Target for macro image
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/proxy-container-setup.adoc:20
#, no-wrap
msgid "suma_proxy_containerized_webui.png"
msgstr "suma_proxy_containerized_webui.png"

#. type: Block title
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/proxy-container-setup.adoc:21
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Procedure: Generating Of Container Services Configuration using spacecmd "
"command"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການສ້າງການຕັ້ງຄ່າ Container Services ໂດຍໃຊ້ຄຳສັ່ງ spacecmd"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/proxy-container-setup.adoc:22
msgid "In the console run following command:"
msgstr "ໃນໜ້າຈໍຄຳສັ່ງ (console) ໃຫ້ພິມຄຳສັ່ງຕໍ່ໄປນີ້:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/proxy-container-setup.adoc:23
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"spacecmd proxy_container_config_generate_cert -- <proxy_fqdn> <parent_fqdn> "
"<squid_max_cache> <admin_email>\n"
msgstr "spacecmd proxy_container_config_generate_cert -- <proxy_fqdn> <parent_fqdn> <squid_max_cache> <admin_email>\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/proxy-container-setup.adoc:24
msgid ""
"Answer questions presented by script, namely {productname} credentials and "
"CA password."
msgstr "ຕອບຄຳຖາມທີ່ສະຄຣິບສະແດງຂຶ້ນ, ເຊັ່ນ: ຂໍ້ມູນປະຈຳຕົວຂອງ {productname} ແລະ ລະຫັດຜ່ານ CA."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/proxy-container-setup.adoc:25
msgid ""
"This will generate file `config.tar.gz` with configuration for the "
"{productname} Proxy containers."
msgstr "ສິ່ງນີ້ຈະສ້າງໄຟລ໌ `config.tar.gz` ເຊິ່ງມີການຕັ້ງຄ່າສຳລັບ {productname} Proxy containers."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/proxy-container-setup.adoc:26
msgid ""
"For more information about [literal]`spacecmd` container proxy generation, "
"see xref:reference:spacecmd/proxy_container.adoc[]."
msgstr "ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບການສ້າງ container proxy ດ້ວຍ [literal]`spacecmd`, ເບິ່ງໄດ້ທີ່ xref:reference:spacecmd/proxy_container.adoc[]."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/proxy-container-setup.adoc:27
msgid ""
"If a [literal]``Proxy FQDN`` is used to generate {productname} Proxy "
"container configuration that is not a registered minion, a new system entry "
"will appear in system list.  This new entry will be shown under previously "
"entered [literal]``Proxy FQDN`` value and will be of [literal]``Foreign`` "
"system type."
msgstr "ຫາກ [literal]``Proxy FQDN`` ທີ່ໃຊ້ສ້າງການຕັ້ງຄ່າ {productname} Proxy container ບໍ່ແມ່ນ minion ທີ່ລົງທະບຽນໄວ້, ຈະມີລາຍການລະບົບໃໝ່ປະກົດຂຶ້ນໃນລາຍການລະບົບ. ລາຍການໃໝ່ນີ້ຈະສະແດງພາຍໃຕ້ຄ່າ [literal]``Proxy FQDN`` ທີ່ປ້ອນໄວ້ກ່ອນໜ້ານີ້ ແລະ ຈະເປັນລະບົບປະເພດ [literal]``Foreign``."

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/proxy-container-setup.adoc:28
#, no-wrap
msgid "Transfer {productname} Proxy configuration"
msgstr "ໂອນຍ້າຍການຕັ້ງຄ່າ {productname} Proxy"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/proxy-container-setup.adoc:29
msgid ""
"Both [literal]``spacecmd``command and web UI ways generate configuration "
"archive. This archive needs to be made available on container host."
msgstr "ທັງການໃຊ້ຄຳສັ່ງ [literal]``spacecmd`` ແລະ ຜ່ານ Web UI ຈະສ້າງໄຟລ໌ເກັບການຕັ້ງຄ່າ. ໄຟລ໌ນີ້ຕ້ອງຖືກນຳໄປໄວ້ໃນ container host."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/proxy-container-setup.adoc:30
msgid ""
"Transfer this generated archive to the container host and extract it to "
"configuration directory (by default [path]`/etc/uyuni/proxy`)."
msgstr "ໂອນໄຟລ໌ເກັບຂໍ້ມູນທີ່ສ້າງຂຶ້ນນີ້ໄປຍັງ container host ແລະ ແຕກໄຟລ໌ອອກໄປຍັງ ໄດເຣັກທໍຣີການຕັ້ງຄ່າ (ໂດຍເລີ່ມຕົ້ນແມ່ນ [path]`/etc/uyuni/proxy`)."

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/proxy-container-setup.adoc:31
#, no-wrap
msgid "Start {productname} Proxy containers"
msgstr "ເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ {productname} Proxy containers"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/proxy-container-setup.adoc:32
msgid "Container can now be started by single [literal]`systemctl` command:"
msgstr "ຕອນນີ້ສາມາດເລີ່ມ container ໄດ້ດ້ວຍຄຳສັ່ງ [literal]`systemctl` ດຽວ:"

#. type: Block title
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/proxy-container-setup.adoc:33
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Start {productname} Proxy containers"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ {productname} Proxy containers"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/proxy-container-setup.adoc:34
#, no-wrap
msgid "systemctl start uyuni-proxy-pod\n"
msgstr "systemctl start uyuni-proxy-pod\n"

#. type: Block title
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/proxy-container-setup.adoc:35
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Start {productname} Proxy containers and make settings permanent"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ {productname} Proxy containers ແລະ ຕັ້ງຄ່າໃຫ້ເປັນແບບຖາວອນ"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/proxy-container-setup.adoc:36
#, no-wrap
msgid "systemctl enable --now uyuni-proxy-pod\n"
msgstr "systemctl enable --now uyuni-proxy-pod\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/proxy-container-setup.adoc:37
msgid "Check if all containers started up as expected by calling"
msgstr "ກວດສອບວ່າ containers ທັງໝົດເລີ່ມເຮັດວຽກຕາມທີ່ຄາດໄວ້ ຫຼື ບໍ່ ໂດຍການພິມ"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/proxy-container-setup.adoc:38
#, no-wrap
msgid "podman ps\n"
msgstr "podman ps\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/proxy-container-setup.adoc:39
msgid "Five {productname} Proxy containers should be present:"
msgstr "ຄວນມີ {productname} Proxy containers ທັງໝົດ 5 ຕົວ:"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/proxy-container-setup.adoc:40
msgid "proxy-salt-broker"
msgstr "proxy-salt-broker"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/proxy-container-setup.adoc:41
msgid "proxy-httpd"
msgstr "proxy-httpd"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/proxy-container-setup.adoc:42
msgid "proxy-tftpd"
msgstr "proxy-tftpd"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/proxy-container-setup.adoc:43
msgid "proxy-squid"
msgstr "proxy-squid"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/proxy-container-setup.adoc:44
msgid "proxy-ssh"
msgstr "proxy-ssh"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/proxy-container-setup.adoc:45
msgid "And should be part of [literal]``proxy-pod`` container pod."
msgstr "ແລະ ພວກມັນຄວນເປັນສ່ວນໜຶ່ງຂອງ [literal]``proxy-pod`` container pod."

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/proxy-intro.adoc:1
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/proxy-minor-uyuni.adoc:4
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/proxy-uyuni.adoc:9
#, no-wrap
msgid "Upgrade the Proxy"
msgstr "ອັບເກຣດ Proxy"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/proxy-intro.adoc:2
msgid "{productname} Proxies are managed in the same way as clients."
msgstr "{productname} Proxies ໄດ້ຮັບການຈັດການໃນຮູບແບບດຽວກັນກັບໄຄເອັນ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/proxy-intro.adoc:3
msgid ""
"Maintenance updates (MU) can be installed on the {productname} Proxy in the "
"same way as other clients.  MU updates require a restart of the proxy "
"service."
msgstr "ການອັບເດດບຳລຸງຮັກສາ (MU) ສາມາດຕິດຕັ້ງໃນ {productname} Proxy ໄດ້ຄືກັບໄຄເອັນອື່ນໆ. ການອັບເດດ MU ຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງມີການເລີ່ມຕົ້ນບໍລິການ proxy ໃໝ່."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/proxy-intro.adoc:4
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/proxy-minor-uyuni.adoc:2
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/proxy-uyuni.adoc:2
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/proxy-y-z.adoc:2
msgid ""
"Before you perform any proxy update, schedule a maintenance window.  The "
"clients registered to {productname} through the proxy will not be able to "
"connect to {productname} while the update is in progress.  For more "
"information about maintenance windows, see "
"xref:administration:maintenance-windows.adoc[]."
msgstr "ກ່ອນທີ່ທ່ານຈະເຮັດການອັບເດດ proxy ໃດໆ, ໃຫ້ກຳນົດເວລາບຳລຸງຮັກສາ (maintenance window) ໄວ້ກ່ອນ. ໄຄເອັນທີ່ລົງທະບຽນກັບ {productname} ຜ່ານ proxy ຈະບໍ່ສາມາດເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ຫາ {productname} ໃນຂະນະທີ່ກຳລັງອັບເດດ. ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບ maintenance windows, ເບິ່ງໄດ້ທີ່ xref:administration:maintenance-windows.adoc[]."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/proxy-intro.adoc:5
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/server-intro.adoc:2
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/upgrade-intro.adoc:6
msgid ""
"{productname} uses an [literal]``X.Y.Z`` versioning schema.  To determine "
"which upgrade procedure you need, look at which part of the version number "
"is changing."
msgstr "{productname} ໃຊ້ຮູບແບບການລະບຸເວີຊັນ [literal]``X.Y.Z``. ເພື່ອພິຈາລະນາວ່າທ່ານຕ້ອງໃຊ້ ຂັ້ນຕອນການອັບເກຣດໃດ, ໃຫ້ເບິ່ງວ່າເລກເວີຊັນສ່ວນໃດທີ່ມີການປ່ຽນແປງ."

#. type: Labeled list
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/proxy-intro.adoc:6
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/server-intro.adoc:4
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/upgrade-intro.adoc:8
#, no-wrap
msgid "Major Version Upgrade (X Upgrade)"
msgstr "ການອັບເກຣດເວີຊັນຫຼັກ (X Upgrade)"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/proxy-intro.adoc:7
msgid ""
"Upgrading to the next major version.  For example, upgrading from 3.2 to 4.0 "
"or to 4.1.  This type of upgrade does not apply to 4.3.  See "
"xref:installation-and-upgrade:proxy-x.adoc[]."
msgstr "ການອັບເກຣດໄປຍັງເວີຊັນຫຼັກຖັດໄປ. ຕົວຢ່າງ: ການອັບເກຣດຈາກ 3.2 ເປັນ 4.0 ຫຼື ເປັນ 4.1. ການອັບເກຣດປະເພດນີ້ບໍ່ໄດ້ໃຊ້ກັບ 4.3. ເບິ່ງ xref:installation-and-upgrade:proxy-x.adoc[]."

#. type: Labeled list
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/proxy-intro.adoc:8
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/server-intro.adoc:8
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/upgrade-intro.adoc:11
#, no-wrap
msgid "Minor Version Upgrade (Y Upgrade)"
msgstr "ການອັບເກຣດເວີຊັນຍ່ອຍ (Y Upgrade)"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/proxy-intro.adoc:9
msgid ""
"Upgrading to the next minor version.  This is often referred to as a service "
"pack (SP) migration.  For example, upgrading from 4.1 to 4.3 or from 4.2 to "
"4.3.  See xref:installation-and-upgrade:proxy-y-z.adoc[]."
msgstr "ການອັບເກຣດໄປຍັງເວີຊັນຍ່ອຍຖັດໄປ. ມັກຈະເອີ້ນວ່າການຍ້າຍ service pack (SP migration). ຕົວຢ່າງ: ການອັບເກຣດຈາກ 4.1 ເປັນ 4.3 ຫຼື ຈາກ 4.2 ເປັນ 4.3. ເບິ່ງ xref:installation-and-upgrade:proxy-y-z.adoc[]."

#. type: Labeled list
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/proxy-intro.adoc:10
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/server-intro.adoc:14
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/upgrade-intro.adoc:16
#, no-wrap
msgid "Patch Level Upgrade (Z Upgrade)"
msgstr "ການອັບເກຣດລະດັບແພັດ (Z Upgrade)"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/proxy-intro.adoc:11
msgid ""
"Upgrading within the same minor version.  This is often referred to as a "
"maintenance update.  For example, upgrading from 4.3.0 to 4.3.1.  See "
"xref:installation-and-upgrade:proxy-y-z.adoc[]."
msgstr "ການອັບເກຣດພາຍໃນເວີຊັນຍ່ອຍດຽວກັນ. ມັກຈະເອີ້ນວ່າການອັບເດດບຳລຸງຮັກສາ (maintenance update). ຕົວຢ່າງ: ການອັບເກຣດຈາກ 4.3.0 ເປັນ 4.3.1. ເບິ່ງ xref:installation-and-upgrade:proxy-y-z.adoc[]."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/proxy-intro.adoc:12
msgid ""
"The upgrade procedure to {productnumber} can either be a major or a minor "
"upgrade.  For more information, see the {productname} {productnumber} "
"release notes."
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນການອັບເກຣດເປັນ {productnumber} ສາມາດເປັນໄດ້ທັງການອັບເກຣດຫຼັກ ຫຼື ຍ່ອຍ. ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມ, ເບິ່ງໄດ້ທີ່ບັນທຶກການປ່ອຍ (release notes) ຂອງ {productname} {productnumber}."

#. type: Labeled list
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/proxy-intro.adoc:13
#, no-wrap
msgid "Major Upgrade"
msgstr "ການອັບເກຣດຫຼັກ"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/proxy-intro.adoc:14
msgid "See xref:installation-and-upgrade:proxy-uyuni.adoc[]."
msgstr "ເບິ່ງ xref:installation-and-upgrade:proxy-uyuni.adoc[]."

#. type: Labeled list
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/proxy-intro.adoc:15
#, no-wrap
msgid "Minor Upgrade"
msgstr "ການອັບເກຣດຍ່ອຍ"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/proxy-intro.adoc:16
msgid "See xref:installation-and-upgrade:proxy-minor-uyuni.adoc[]."
msgstr "ເບິ່ງ xref:installation-and-upgrade:proxy-minor-uyuni.adoc[]."

#. type: Title =
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/proxy-minor-uyuni.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Proxy - Minor Upgrade"
msgstr "Proxy - ການອັບເກຣດຍ່ອຍ"

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/proxy-minor-uyuni.adoc:3
msgid ""
"Minor proxy upgrades do not include a version upgrade of the operating "
"system.  For more information, see the {productname} {productnumber} release "
"notes."
msgstr "ການອັບເກຣດ proxy ແບບຍ່ອຍຈະບໍ່ລວມເຖິງການອັບເກຣດເວີຊັນຂອງລະບົບປະຕິບັດການ. ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມ, ເບິ່ງໄດ້ທີ່ບັນທຶກການປ່ອຍຂອງ {productname} {productnumber}."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/proxy-minor-uyuni.adoc:5
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/proxy-y-z.adoc:13
msgid ""
"To update a proxy you first stop the proxy service, then update the software "
"and finally restart the proxy service."
msgstr "ເພື່ອອັບເດດ proxy, ທຳອິດທ່ານຕ້ອງຢຸດບໍລິການ proxy, ຈາກນັ້ນອັບເດດຊອບແວ ແລະ ສຸດທ້າຍແມ່ນເລີ່ມຕົ້ນບໍລິການ proxy ໃໝ່."

#. type: Block title
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/proxy-minor-uyuni.adoc:6
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/proxy-uyuni.adoc:11
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/proxy-y-z.adoc:14
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Updating the {productname} Proxy"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການອັບເດດ {productname} Proxy"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/proxy-minor-uyuni.adoc:7
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/proxy-uyuni.adoc:12
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/proxy-y-z.adoc:15
msgid "On the {productname} Proxy, stop the proxy service:"
msgstr "ໃນເຄື່ອງ {productname} Proxy, ໃຫ້ຢຸດບໍລິການ proxy:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/proxy-minor-uyuni.adoc:8
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/proxy-uyuni.adoc:13
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/proxy-y-z.adoc:16
#, no-wrap
msgid "spacewalk-proxy stop\n"
msgstr "spacewalk-proxy stop\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/proxy-minor-uyuni.adoc:9
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/proxy-uyuni.adoc:14
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/proxy-y-z.adoc:17
msgid ""
"In the {productname} Server {webui}, navigate to menu:Systems[Proxy] and "
"click the name of the proxy."
msgstr "ໃນ {webui} ຂອງ {productname} Server, ໄປທີ່ menu:Systems[Proxy] ແລ້ວຄລິກທີ່ຊື່ຂອງ proxy."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/proxy-minor-uyuni.adoc:10
msgid ""
"Select all the packages to be updated on the proxy, and then apply the "
"selection."
msgstr "ເລືອກແພັກເກັດທັງໝົດທີ່ຈະອັບເດດໃນ proxy, ຈາກນັ້ນກົດຕົກລົງເພື່ອດຳເນີນການ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/proxy-minor-uyuni.adoc:11
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/proxy-uyuni.adoc:20
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/proxy-y-z.adoc:19
msgid "On the {productname} Proxy, start the proxy service:"
msgstr "ໃນເຄື່ອງ {productname} Proxy, ໃຫ້ເລີ່ມບໍລິການ proxy:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/proxy-minor-uyuni.adoc:12
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/proxy-uyuni.adoc:21
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/proxy-y-z.adoc:20
#, no-wrap
msgid "spacewalk-proxy start\n"
msgstr "spacewalk-proxy start\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/proxy-minor-uyuni.adoc:13
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/proxy-uyuni.adoc:22
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/proxy-y-z.adoc:21
msgid ""
"If you need to update many proxies, you can create an action chain of this "
"command sequence on the {productname} Server.  You can use the action chain "
"to perform updates on multiple proxies at the same time."
msgstr "ຖ້າທ່ານຕ້ອງການອັບເດດຫຼາຍພຣັອກຊີ (proxies), ທ່ານສາມາດສ້າງລະບົບຕ່ອງໂສ້ການດຳເນີນການ (action chain) ຂອງລຳດັບຄຳສັ່ງນີ້ຢູ່ເທິງເຊີເວີ {productname}. ທ່ານສາມາດໃຊ້ action chain ເພື່ອດຳເນີນການອັບເດດໃນຫຼາຍພຣັອກຊີພ້ອມກັນໄດ້."

#. type: Title =
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/proxy-registration.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "SUSE Manager Proxy Registration"
msgstr "ການລົງທະບຽນ SUSE Manager Proxy"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/proxy-registration.adoc:2
msgid ""
"{productname} Proxy systems are Salt or traditional clients that are "
"installed with the {unifiedinstaller} and registered to {productname} using "
"bootstrap script or GUI."
msgstr "ລະບົບ {productname} Proxy ແມ່ນ Salt ຫຼື ໄຄລແອນ (clients) ແບບດັ້ງເດີມທີ່ຖືກຕິດຕັ້ງດ້ວຍ {unifiedinstaller} ແລະ ລົງທະບຽນກັບ {productname} ໂດຍໃຊ້ bootstrap script ຫຼື GUI."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/proxy-registration.adoc:3
msgid ""
"For more information about installing proxies, see "
"xref:installation-and-upgrade:install-proxy-unified.adoc[]."
msgstr "ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບການຕິດຕັ້ງພຣັອກຊີ, ເບິ່ງທີ່ xref:installation-and-upgrade:install-proxy-unified.adoc[]."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/proxy-registration.adoc:4
msgid ""
"Migrating a traditional proxy to a Salt proxy is not possible.  If you want "
"to change a traditional proxy to a Salt proxy, you need to reinstall the "
"proxy.  For more information about reinstalling proxies, see "
"xref:installation-and-upgrade:proxy-setup.adoc[]."
msgstr "ການຍ້າຍ (Migrating) ຈາກພຣັອກຊີແບບດັ້ງເດີມ ໄປເປັນ Salt proxy ແມ່ນບໍ່ສາມາດເຮັດໄດ້. ຖ້າທ່ານຕ້ອງການປ່ຽນພຣັອກຊີແບບດັ້ງເດີມໃຫ້ເປັນ Salt proxy, ທ່ານຕ້ອງຕິດຕັ້ງພຣັອກຊີໃໝ່. ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບການຕິດຕັ້ງພຣັອກຊີໃໝ່, ເບິ່ງທີ່ xref:installation-and-upgrade:proxy-setup.adoc[]."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/proxy-registration.adoc:5
msgid ""
"After the Salt client is succesfully bootstrapped, it needs to be configured "
"as {productname} Proxy."
msgstr "ຫຼັງຈາກທີ່ Salt client ຖືກເຮັດ bootstrap ສຳເລັດແລ້ວ, ມັນຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງໄດ້ຮັບການຕັ້ງຄ່າໃຫ້ເປັນ {productname} Proxy."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/proxy-registration.adoc:6
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/uyuni-proxy-registration.adoc:3
msgid ""
"This procedure describes software channel setup and registering the "
"installed proxy as the {productname} client, using an activation key."
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນນີ້ອະທິບາຍກ່ຽວກັບການຕັ້ງຄ່າຊ່ອງທາງຊອບແວ (software channel) ແລະ ການລົງທະບຽນພຣັອກຊີທີ່ຕິດຕັ້ງແລ້ວໃຫ້ເປັນ {productname} client ໂດຍໃຊ້ activation key."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/proxy-registration.adoc:7
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/proxy-registration.adoc:21
msgid ""
"Before you can select the correct child channels while creating the "
"activation key, ensure you have completely downloaded the {productname} "
"Proxy {productnumber} channel and all the recommended and mandatory "
"{sle} {sles-version} {sp-base} channels."
msgstr "ກ່ອນທີ່ທ່ານຈະສາມາດເລືອກຊ່ອງທາງລູກ (child channels) ທີ່ຖືກຕ້ອງໃນຂະນະທີ່ສ້າງ activation key, ໃຫ້ແນ່ໃຈວ່າທ່ານໄດ້ດາວໂຫຼດຊ່ອງທາງ {productname} Proxy {productnumber} ແລະ ທຸກຊ່ອງທາງ {sle} {sles-version} {sp-base} ທີ່ແນະນຳ ແລະ ທີ່ຈຳເປັນຄົບຖ້ວນແລ້ວ."

