"Continue with setting up the registered {productname} Proxy: "
"xref:installation-and-upgrade:proxy-setup.adoc[]."
msgstr "ດຳເນີນການຕັ້ງຄ່າ {productname} Proxy ທີ່ລົງທະບຽນແລ້ວຕໍ່ໄດ້ທີ່: xref:installation-and-upgrade:proxy-setup.adoc[]."

#. type: Title =
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/proxy-setup.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "SUSE Manager Proxy Setup"
msgstr "ການຕັ້ງຄ່າ SUSE Manager Proxy"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/proxy-setup.adoc:2
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/uyuni-proxy-setup.adoc:2
msgid "{productname} Proxy requires additional configuration."
msgstr "{productname} Proxy ຕ້ອງການການຕັ້ງຄ່າເພີ່ມເຕີມ."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/proxy-setup.adoc:3
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/uyuni-proxy-setup.adoc:7
msgid ""
"It is possible to arrange Salt proxies in a chain.  In such a case, the "
"upstream proxy is named `parent`."
msgstr "ມັນເປັນໄປໄດ້ທີ່ຈະຈັດລຽງ Salt proxies ໃຫ້ເປັນແບບຕ່ອງໂສ້. ໃນກໍລະນີດັ່ງກ່າວ, ພຣັອກຊີຕົ້ນທາງ (upstream proxy) ຈະຖືກເອີ້ນວ່າ `parent`."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/proxy-setup.adoc:4
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/uyuni-proxy-setup.adoc:8
msgid ""
"Make sure the TCP ports `4505` and `4506` are open on the proxy.  The proxy "
"must be able to reach the {productname} Server or a parent proxy on these "
"ports."
msgstr "ໃຫ້ແນ່ໃຈວ່າພອດ TCP `4505` ແລະ `4506` ຖືກເປີດຢູ່ເທິງພຣັອກຊີ. ພຣັອກຊີຕ້ອງສາມາດເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ຫາ {productname} Server ຫຼື parent proxy ຜ່ານພອດເຫຼົ່ານີ້ໄດ້."

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/proxy-setup.adoc:5
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/uyuni-proxy-setup.adoc:9
#, no-wrap
msgid "Copy Server Certificate and Key"
msgstr "ຄັດລອກໃບຢັ້ງຢືນ (Certificate) ແລະ ຄີ (Key) ຂອງເຊີເວີ"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/proxy-setup.adoc:6
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/uyuni-proxy-setup.adoc:10
msgid ""
"The proxy will share some SSL information with the {productname} Server.  "
"Copy the certificate and its key from the {productname} Server or the parent "
"proxy."
msgstr "ພຣັອກຊີຈະແບ່ງປັນຂໍ້ມູນ SSL ບາງຢ່າງກັບ {productname} Server. ໃຫ້ຄັດລອກໃບຢັ້ງຢືນ ແລະ ຄີຂອງມັນຈາກ {productname} Server ຫຼື parent proxy."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/proxy-setup.adoc:7
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/uyuni-proxy-setup.adoc:11
msgid ""
"As root, enter the following commands on the proxy using your {productname} "
"Server or parent Proxy (named [replaceable]``PARENT``):"
msgstr "ໃນຖານະ root, ໃຫ້ປ້ອນຄຳສັ່ງຕໍ່ໄປນີ້ໃສ່ພຣັອກຊີ ໂດຍໃຊ້ {productname} Server ຫຼື parent Proxy ຂອງທ່ານ (ທີ່ຊື່ວ່າ [replaceable]``PARENT``):"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/proxy-setup.adoc:8
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/uyuni-proxy-setup.adoc:12
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"mkdir -m 700 /root/ssl-build\n"
"cd /root/ssl-build\n"
"scp root@PARENT:/root/ssl-build/RHN-ORG-PRIVATE-SSL-KEY .\n"
"scp root@PARENT:/root/ssl-build/RHN-ORG-TRUSTED-SSL-CERT .\n"
"scp root@PARENT:/root/ssl-build/rhn-ca-openssl.cnf .\n"
msgstr ""
"mkdir -m 700 /root/ssl-build\n"
"cd /root/ssl-build\n"
"scp root@PARENT:/root/ssl-build/RHN-ORG-PRIVATE-SSL-KEY .\n"
"scp root@PARENT:/root/ssl-build/RHN-ORG-TRUSTED-SSL-CERT .\n"
"scp root@PARENT:/root/ssl-build/rhn-ca-openssl.cnf .\n"

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/proxy-setup.adoc:9
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/uyuni-proxy-setup.adoc:13
msgid ""
"To keep the security chain intact, the {productname} Proxy functionality "
"requires the SSL certificate to be signed by the same CA as the "
"{productname} Server certificate.  Using certificates signed by different "
"CAs for proxies and server is not supported."
msgstr "ເພື່ອຮັກສາຄວາມປອດໄພໃຫ້ຄົບຖ້ວນ, ຟັງຊັນຂອງ {productname} Proxy ຕ້ອງການໃຫ້ໃບຢັ້ງຢືນ SSL ຖືກເຊັນໂດຍ CA ດຽວກັນກັບໃບຢັ້ງຢືນຂອງ {productname} Server. ການໃຊ້ໃບຢັ້ງຢືນທີ່ເຊັນໂດຍ CA ທີ່ຕ່າງກັນສຳລັບພຣັອກຊີ ແລະ ເຊີເວີ ແມ່ນບໍ່ຮອງຮັບ."

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/proxy-setup.adoc:10
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/uyuni-proxy-setup.adoc:14
#, no-wrap
msgid "Run [command]``configure-proxy.sh``"
msgstr "ລັນ [command]``configure-proxy.sh``"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/proxy-setup.adoc:11
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/uyuni-proxy-setup.adoc:15
msgid ""
"The [command]``configure-proxy.sh`` script finalizes the setup of your "
"{productname} Proxy."
msgstr "ສະຄຣິບ [command]``configure-proxy.sh`` ຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ການຕັ້ງຄ່າ {productname} Proxy ຂອງທ່ານສຳເລັດສົມບູນ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/proxy-setup.adoc:12
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/uyuni-proxy-setup.adoc:16
msgid ""
"Execute the interactive [command]``configure-proxy.sh`` script.  Pressing "
"kbd:[Enter] without further input will make the script use the default "
"values provided between brackets ``[]``.  Here is some information about the "
"requested settings:"
msgstr "ລັນສະຄຣິບ [command]``configure-proxy.sh`` ແບບໂຕ້ຕອບ. ການກົດ kbd:[Enter] ໂດຍບໍ່ໄດ້ປ້ອນຂໍ້ມູນໃດໆ ຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ສະຄຣິບໃຊ້ຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ (default) ທີ່ຢູ່ໃນວົງເລັບ ``[]``. ນີ້ແມ່ນຂໍ້ມູນບາງຢ່າງກ່ຽວກັບການຕັ້ງຄ່າທີ່ຖືກຖາມ:"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/proxy-setup.adoc:13
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/uyuni-proxy-setup.adoc:17
msgid ""
"{productname} Parent:: The {productname} parent can be either another proxy "
"or the {productname} Server."
msgstr "{productname} Parent:: {productname} parent ສາມາດເປັນໄດ້ທັງພຣັອກຊີອື່ນ ຫຼື {productname} Server."

#. type: Labeled list
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/proxy-setup.adoc:14
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/uyuni-proxy-setup.adoc:18
#, no-wrap
msgid "HTTP Proxy"
msgstr "HTTP Proxy"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/proxy-setup.adoc:15
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/uyuni-proxy-setup.adoc:19
msgid ""
"A HTTP proxy enables your {productname} proxy to access the Web.  This is "
"needed if direct access to the Web is prohibited by a firewall."
msgstr "HTTP proxy ຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ {productname} proxy ຂອງທ່ານສາມາດເຂົ້າເຖິງເວັບໄດ້. ນີ້ແມ່ນສິ່ງຈຳເປັນຖ້າການເຂົ້າເຖິງເວັບໂດຍກົງຖືກຫ້າມໂດຍໄຟວໍ (firewall)."

#. type: Labeled list
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/proxy-setup.adoc:16
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/uyuni-proxy-setup.adoc:20
#, no-wrap
msgid "Traceback Email"
msgstr "ອີເມລ Traceback"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/proxy-setup.adoc:17
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/uyuni-proxy-setup.adoc:21
msgid "An email address where to report problems."
msgstr "ທີ່ຢູ່ອີເມລສຳລັບລາຍງານບັນຫາ."

#. type: Labeled list
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/proxy-setup.adoc:18
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/uyuni-proxy-setup.adoc:24
#, no-wrap
msgid "Do You Want to Import Existing Certificates?"
msgstr "ທ່ານຕ້ອງການນຳເຂົ້າໃບຢັ້ງຢືນ (Certificates) ທີ່ມີຢູ່ແລ້ວບໍ່?"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/proxy-setup.adoc:19
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/uyuni-proxy-setup.adoc:25
msgid ""
"Answer ``N``.  This ensures using the new certificates that were copied "
"previously from the {productname} server."
msgstr "ໃຫ້ຕອບ ``N``. ນີ້ເພື່ອໃຫ້ແນ່ໃຈວ່າໄດ້ໃຊ້ໃບຢັ້ງຢືນໃໝ່ທີ່ຖືກຄັດລອກມາຈາກ {productname} server ກ່ອນໜ້ານີ້."

#. type: Labeled list
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/proxy-setup.adoc:20
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/uyuni-proxy-setup.adoc:26
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/webui-setup.adoc:25
#, no-wrap
msgid "Organization"
msgstr "ອົງກອນ (Organization)"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/proxy-setup.adoc:21
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/uyuni-proxy-setup.adoc:27
msgid ""
"The next questions are about the characteristics to use for the SSL "
"certificate of the proxy.  The organization might be the same organization "
"that was used on the server, unless of course your proxy is not in the same "
"organization as your main server."
msgstr "ຄຳຖາມຕໍ່ໄປແມ່ນກ່ຽວກັບຄຸນລັກສະນະທີ່ຈະໃຊ້ສຳລັບໃບຢັ້ງຢືນ SSL ຂອງພຣັອກຊີ. ຊື່ອົງກອນອາດຈະເປັນອົງກອນດຽວກັນກັບທີ່ໃຊ້ໃນເຊີເວີ, ເວັ້ນເສຍແຕ່ພຣັອກຊີຂອງທ່ານບໍ່ໄດ້ຢູ່ໃນອົງກອນດຽວກັນກັບເຊີເວີຫຼັກ."

#. type: Labeled list
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/proxy-setup.adoc:22
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/uyuni-proxy-setup.adoc:28
#, no-wrap
