msgstr "ຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນຢູ່ບ່ອນນີ້ແມ່ນ hostname ຂອງພຣັອກຊີ."

#. type: Labeled list
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/proxy-setup.adoc:24
#, no-wrap
