msgid "Further information attached to the proxy's certificate."
msgstr "ຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມທີ່ຕິດກັບໃບຢັ້ງຢືນຂອງພຣັອກຊີ."

#. type: Labeled list
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/proxy-setup.adoc:26
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/uyuni-proxy-setup.adoc:30
#, no-wrap
msgid "City"
msgstr "ເມືອງ/ແຂວງ (City)"

#. type: Labeled list
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/proxy-setup.adoc:28
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/uyuni-proxy-setup.adoc:32
#, no-wrap
msgid "State"
msgstr "ລັດ/ແຂວງ (State)"

#. type: Labeled list
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/proxy-setup.adoc:30
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/uyuni-proxy-setup.adoc:34
#, no-wrap
msgid "Country Code"
msgstr "ລະຫັດປະເທດ (Country Code)"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/proxy-setup.adoc:31
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/uyuni-proxy-setup.adoc:35
msgid ""
"In the [guimenu]``country code`` field, enter the country code set during "
"the {productname} installation.  For example, if your proxy is in the US and "
"your {productname} is in DE, enter `DE` for the proxy."
msgstr "ໃນຫ້ອງ [guimenu]``country code``, ໃຫ້ປ້ອນລະຫັດປະເທດທີ່ຕັ້ງໄວ້ໃນລະຫວ່າງການຕິດຕັ້ງ {productname}. ຕົວຢ່າງ: ຖ້າພຣັອກຊີຂອງທ່ານຢູ່ໃນ US ແລະ {productname} ຂອງທ່ານຢູ່ໃນ DE, ໃຫ້ປ້ອນ `DE` ສຳລັບພຣັອກຊີ."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/proxy-setup.adoc:32
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/uyuni-proxy-setup.adoc:36
msgid ""
"The country code must be two upper case letters.  For a complete list of "
"country codes, see https://www.iso.org/obp/ui/#search."
msgstr "ລະຫັດປະເທດຕ້ອງເປັນຕົວອັກສອນພາສາອັງກິດພິມໃຫຍ່ສອງຕົວ. ສຳລັບລາຍຊື່ລະຫັດປະເທດທັງໝົດ, ເບິ່ງໄດ້ທີ່ https://www.iso.org/obp/ui/#search."

#. type: Labeled list
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/proxy-setup.adoc:33
#, no-wrap
msgid "E-mail"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/proxy-setup.adoc:34
msgid "Use this field for e-mail address."
msgstr ""

#. type: Labeled list
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/proxy-setup.adoc:35
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/uyuni-proxy-setup.adoc:37
#, no-wrap
msgid "Cname Aliases (Separated by Space)"
msgstr "ຊື່ນາມແຝງ Cname (ແຍກດ້ວຍຍະຫວ່າງ)"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/proxy-setup.adoc:36
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/uyuni-proxy-setup.adoc:38
msgid ""
"Use this if your proxy can be accessed through various DNS CNAME aliases.  "
"Otherwise it can be left empty."
msgstr "ໃຊ້ສິ່ງນີ້ຖ້າພຣັອກຊີຂອງທ່ານສາມາດເຂົ້າເຖິງໄດ້ຜ່ານ DNS CNAME aliases ຕ່າງໆ. ຖ້າບໍ່ດັ່ງນັ້ນ ສາມາດປະຫວ່າງໄວ້ໄດ້."

#. type: Labeled list
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/proxy-setup.adoc:37
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/uyuni-proxy-setup.adoc:39
#, no-wrap
msgid "CA Password"
msgstr "ລະຫັດຜ່ານ CA"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/proxy-setup.adoc:38
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/uyuni-proxy-setup.adoc:40
msgid ""
"Enter the password that was used for the certificate of your {productname} "
"Server."
msgstr "ປ້ອນລະຫັດຜ່ານທີ່ເຄີຍໃຊ້ສຳລັບໃບຢັ້ງຢືນຂອງ {productname} Server ຂອງທ່ານ."

#. type: Labeled list
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/proxy-setup.adoc:39
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/uyuni-proxy-setup.adoc:41
#, no-wrap
msgid "Do You Want to Use an Existing SSH Key for Proxying SSH-Push Salt Minion?"
msgstr "ທ່ານຕ້ອງການໃຊ້ SSH Key ທີ່ມີຢູ່ແລ້ວສຳລັບການເຮັດ Proxy ໃຫ້ SSH-Push Salt Minion ບໍ່?"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/proxy-setup.adoc:40
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/uyuni-proxy-setup.adoc:42
msgid ""
"Use this option if you want to reuse a SSH key that was used for SSH-Push "
"Salt clients on the server."
msgstr "ໃຊ້ຕົວເລືອກນີ້ຖ້າທ່ານຕ້ອງການໃຊ້ SSH key ທີ່ເຄີຍໃຊ້ສຳລັບ SSH-Push Salt clients ໃນເຊີເວີຄືນໃໝ່."

#. type: Labeled list
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/proxy-setup.adoc:41
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/uyuni-proxy-setup.adoc:43
#, no-wrap
msgid "Create and Populate Configuration Channel rhn_proxy_config_1000010001?"
msgstr "ສ້າງ ແລະ ບັນຈຸຂໍ້ມູນລົງໃນ Configuration Channel rhn_proxy_config_1000010001 ບໍ່?"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/proxy-setup.adoc:42
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/uyuni-proxy-setup.adoc:44
msgid "Accept default ``Y``."
msgstr "ຍອມຮັບຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ ``Y``."

#. type: Labeled list
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/proxy-setup.adoc:43
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/uyuni-proxy-setup.adoc:45
#, no-wrap
msgid "SUSE Manager Username"
msgstr "ຊື່ຜູ້ໃຊ້ SUSE Manager"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/proxy-setup.adoc:44
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/uyuni-proxy-setup.adoc:46
msgid "Use same user name and password as on the {productname} server."
msgstr "ໃຊ້ຊື່ຜູ້ໃຊ້ ແລະ ລະຫັດຜ່ານດຽວກັນກັບທີ່ໃຊ້ໃນ {productname} server."

#. type: Labeled list
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/proxy-setup.adoc:45
#, no-wrap
msgid "Activate Advertising via SLP"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/proxy-setup.adoc:46
msgid "Select one of the options."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/proxy-setup.adoc:47
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/uyuni-proxy-setup.adoc:47
msgid ""
"If parts are missing, such as CA key and public certificate, the script "
"prints commands that you must execute to integrate the needed files.  When "
"the mandatory files are copied, run [command]``configure-proxy.sh`` again.  "
"If you receive an HTTP error during script execution, run the script again."
msgstr "ຫາກມີບາງສ່ວນທີ່ຂາດຫາຍໄປ ເຊັ່ນ CA key ແລະ public certificate, ສະຄຣິບຈະສະແດງຄຳສັ່ງທີ່ທ່ານຕ້ອງລັນເພື່ອລວມໄຟລ໌ທີ່ຈຳເປັນເຂົ້າກັນ. ເມື່ອຄັດລອກໄຟລ໌ທີ່ຈຳເປັນແລ້ວ, ໃຫ້ລັນ [command]``configure-proxy.sh`` ອີກຄັ້ງ. ຫາກທ່ານໄດ້ຮັບຂໍ້ຜິດພາດ HTTP ໃນລະຫວ່າງການລັນສະຄຣິບ, ໃຫ້ລັນສະຄຣິບໃໝ່ອີກຄັ້ງ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/proxy-setup.adoc:48
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/uyuni-proxy-setup.adoc:48
msgid ""
"[command]``configure-proxy.sh`` activates services required by {productname} "
"Proxy, such as [systemitem]``squid``, [systemitem]``apache2``, "
"[systemitem]``salt-broker``, and [systemitem]``jabberd``."
msgstr "[command]``configure-proxy.sh`` ຈະເປີດໃຊ້ງານບໍລິການຕ່າງໆທີ່ {productname} Proxy ຕ້ອງການ ເຊັ່ນ [systemitem]``squid``, [systemitem]``apache2``, [systemitem]``salt-broker``, ແລະ [systemitem]``jabberd``."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/proxy-setup.adoc:49
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/uyuni-proxy-setup.adoc:49
msgid ""
"To check the status of the proxy system and its clients, click the proxy "
"system's details page on the {webui} (menu:Systems[Proxy], then the system "
"name).  [guimenu]``Connection`` and [guimenu]``Proxy`` subtabs display "
"various status information."
msgstr "ເພື່ອທົດສອບສະຖານະຂອງລະບົບພຣັອກຊີ ແລະ clients ຂອງມັນ, ໃຫ້ຄລິກທີ່ໜ້າລາຍລະອຽດຂອງລະບົບພຣັອກຊີໃນ {webui} (menu:Systems[Proxy], ແລ້ວເລືອກຊື່ລະບົບ). ແຖບຍ່ອຍ [guimenu]``Connection`` ແລະ [guimenu]``Proxy`` ຈະສະແດງຂໍ້ມູນສະຖານະຕ່າງໆ."

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/proxy-setup.adoc:50
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/uyuni-proxy-setup.adoc:50
#, no-wrap
msgid "Enable PXE Boot"
msgstr "ເປີດໃຊ້ງານ PXE Boot"

#. type: Title ===
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/proxy-setup.adoc:51
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/uyuni-proxy-setup.adoc:51
#, no-wrap
msgid "Synchronize Profiles and System Information"
msgstr "ຊິງໂຄຣໄນ (Synchronize) ໂປຣໄຟລ໌ ແລະ ຂໍ້ມູນລະບົບ"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/proxy-setup.adoc:52
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/uyuni-proxy-setup.adoc:52
msgid ""
"To enable PXE boot through a proxy, additional software must be installed "
"and configured on both the {productname} Proxy and the {productname} Server."
msgstr "ເພື່ອເປີດໃຊ້ງານ PXE boot ຜ່ານພຣັອກຊີ, ຕ້ອງມີການຕິດຕັ້ງ ແລະ ຕັ້ງຄ່າຊອບແວເພີ່ມເຕີມທັງໃນ {productname} Proxy ແລະ {productname} Server."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/proxy-setup.adoc:53
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/uyuni-proxy-setup.adoc:53
msgid ""
"On the {productname} Proxy, install the "
"[package]``susemanager-tftpsync-recv`` package:"
msgstr "ຢູ່ເທິງ {productname} Proxy, ໃຫ້ຕິດຕັ້ງແພັກເກດ [package]``susemanager-tftpsync-recv``:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/proxy-setup.adoc:54
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/uyuni-proxy-setup.adoc:54
#, no-wrap
msgid "zypper in susemanager-tftpsync-recv\n"
msgstr "zypper in susemanager-tftpsync-recv\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/proxy-setup.adoc:55
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/uyuni-proxy-setup.adoc:55
msgid ""
"On the {productname} Proxy, run the [command]``configure-tftpsync.sh`` setup "
"script and enter the requested information:"
msgstr "ຢູ່ເທິງ {productname} Proxy, ໃຫ້ລັນສະຄຣິບຕັ້ງຄ່າ [command]``configure-tftpsync.sh`` ແລະ ປ້ອນຂໍ້ມູນທີ່ຖືກຖາມ:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/proxy-setup.adoc:56
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/uyuni-proxy-setup.adoc:56
#, no-wrap
msgid "configure-tftpsync.sh\n"
msgstr "configure-tftpsync.sh\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/proxy-setup.adoc:57
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/uyuni-proxy-setup.adoc:57
msgid ""
"You need to provide the hostname and IP address of the {productname} Server "
"and the proxy.  You also need to enter the path to the tftpboot directory on "
"the proxy."
msgstr "ທ່ານຕ້ອງລະບຸ hostname ແລະ ທີ່ຢູ່ IP ຂອງ {productname} Server ແລະ ພຣັອກຊີ. ນອກຈາກນັ້ນ ທ່ານຍັງຕ້ອງປ້ອນເສັ້ນທາງ (path) ໄປຫາໄດເຣັກທໍຣີ tftpboot ໃນພຣັອກຊີ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/proxy-setup.adoc:58
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/uyuni-proxy-setup.adoc:58
msgid "On the {productname} Server, install [package]``susemanager-tftpsync``:"
msgstr "ຢູ່ເທິງ {productname} Server, ໃຫ້ຕິດຕັ້ງ [package]``susemanager-tftpsync``:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/proxy-setup.adoc:59
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/uyuni-proxy-setup.adoc:59
#, no-wrap
msgid "zypper in susemanager-tftpsync\n"
msgstr "zypper in susemanager-tftpsync\n"

#.  same file name on the server and proxy!
#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/proxy-setup.adoc:60
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/uyuni-proxy-setup.adoc:60
msgid "On the {productname} Server, run [command]``configure-tftpsync.sh``."
msgstr "ຢູ່ເທິງ {productname} Server, ໃຫ້ລັນ [command]``configure-tftpsync.sh``."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/proxy-setup.adoc:61
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/uyuni-proxy-setup.adoc:61
msgid "This creates the configuration, and uploads it to the {productname} Proxy:"
msgstr "ສິ່ງນີ້ຈະສ້າງການຕັ້ງຄ່າ ແລະ ອັບໂຫຼດມັນໄປທີ່ {productname} Proxy:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/proxy-setup.adoc:62
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/uyuni-proxy-setup.adoc:62
#, no-wrap
msgid "configure-tftpsync.sh FQDN_of_Proxy\n"
msgstr "configure-tftpsync.sh FQDN_of_Proxy\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/proxy-setup.adoc:63
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/uyuni-proxy-setup.adoc:63
msgid "Start an initial synchronization on the {productname} Server:"
msgstr "ເລີ່ມການຊິງໂຄຣໄນຄັ້ງທຳອິດໃນ {productname} Server:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/proxy-setup.adoc:64
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/uyuni-proxy-setup.adoc:64
#, no-wrap
msgid "cobbler sync\n"
msgstr "cobbler sync\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/proxy-setup.adoc:65
msgid ""
"It can also be done after a change within {cobbler} that needs to be "
"synchronized immediately.  Otherwise {cobbler} synchronization will run "
"automatically when needed.  For more information about autoinstallation "
"powered by {cobbler}, "
"xref:client-configuration:autoinst-intro.adoc[Operating System "
"Installation]."
msgstr "ມັນຍັງສາມາດເຮັດໄດ້ຫຼັງຈາກມີການປ່ຽນແປງພາຍໃນ {cobbler} ທີ່ຕ້ອງການຊິງໂຄຣໄນທັນທີ. ຖ້າບໍ່ດັ່ງນັ້ນ ການຊິງໂຄຣໄນ {cobbler} ຈະເຮັດວຽກໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດເມື່ອຈຳເປັນ. ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບການຕິດຕັ້ງອັດຕະໂນມັດທີ່ຂັບເຄື່ອນໂດຍ {cobbler}, ເບິ່ງ xref:client-configuration:autoinst-intro.adoc[Operating System Installation]."

#. type: Title ===
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/proxy-setup.adoc:66
#, no-wrap
msgid "Configure DHCP for PXE through {productname} Proxy"
msgstr "ຕັ້ງຄ່າ DHCP ສຳລັບ PXE ຜ່ານ {productname} Proxy"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/proxy-setup.adoc:67
msgid ""
"{productname} uses {cobbler} for client provisioning.  PXE (tftp) is "
"installed and activated by default.  Clients must be able to find the PXE "
"boot on the {productname} Proxy using DHCP.  Use this DHCP configuration for "
"the zone that contains the clients to be provisioned:"
msgstr "{productname} ໃຊ້ {cobbler} ສຳລັບການຈັດກຽມ client (provisioning). PXE (tftp) ຖືກຕິດຕັ້ງ ແລະ ເປີດໃຊ້ງານໄວ້ເປັນຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ. Clients ຕ້ອງສາມາດຊອກຫາ PXE boot ໃນ {productname} Proxy ໂດຍໃຊ້ DHCP. ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ການຕັ້ງຄ່າ DHCP ນີ້ສຳລັບໂຊນທີ່ມີ clients ທີ່ຕ້ອງການຈັດກຽມ:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/proxy-setup.adoc:68
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/uyuni-proxy-setup.adoc:68
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"next-server: <IP_Address_of_Proxy>\n"
"filename: \"pxelinux.0\"\n"
msgstr ""
"next-server: <IP_Address_of_Proxy>\n"
"filename: \"pxelinux.0\"\n"

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/proxy-setup.adoc:69
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/uyuni-proxy-setup.adoc:69
#, no-wrap
msgid "Replace the {productname} Proxy"
msgstr "ປ່ຽນແທນ {productname} Proxy"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/proxy-setup.adoc:70
msgid ""
"You can replace a proxy at any time, as it does not store any information "
"about the clients that are connected to it.  This process is handled using a "
"reactivation key, which prevents you from losing the history of the proxy.  "
"If you do not use a reactivation key, the replacement proxy will become a "
"new one with a new ID.  The replacement proxy must have the same name and IP "
"address as its predecessor."
msgstr "ທ່ານສາມາດປ່ຽນແທນພຣັອກຊີໄດ້ທຸກເວລາ ເນື່ອງຈາກມັນບໍ່ໄດ້ເກັບຂໍ້ມູນໃດໆ ກ່ຽວກັບ clients ທີ່ເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ກັບມັນ. ຂັ້ນຕອນນີ້ຖືກຈັດການໂດຍໃຊ້ reactivation key ເພື່ອປ້ອງກັນບໍ່ໃຫ້ປະຫວັດຂອງພຣັອກຊີສູນຫາຍ. ຖ້າທ່ານບໍ່ໃຊ້ reactivation key, ພຣັອກຊີທີ່ມາແທນຈະກາຍເປັນຕົວໃໝ່ທີ່ມີ ID ໃໝ່. ພຣັອກຊີທີ່ມາແທນຕ້ອງມີຊື່ ແລະ ທີ່ຢູ່ IP ດຽວກັນກັບຕົວເກົ່າ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/proxy-setup.adoc:71
msgid ""
"You can also reinstall a proxy to change it from a traditional proxy to a "
"Salt proxy."
msgstr "ທ່ານຍັງສາມາດຕິດຕັ້ງພຣັອກຊີໃໝ່ເພື່ອປ່ຽນຈາກພຣັອກຊີແບບດັ້ງເດີມໄປເປັນ Salt proxy."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/proxy-setup.adoc:72
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/uyuni-proxy-setup.adoc:86
msgid ""
"During the installation of the proxy, clients will not be able to reach the "
"{productname} Server.  After you have deleted a proxy, the systems list can "
"be temporarily incorrect.  All clients that were previously connected to the "
"proxy will show as being directly connected to the server instead.  After "
"the first successful operation on a client, such as execution of a remote "
"command or installation of a package or patch, this information will "
"automatically be corrected.  This may take some hours."
msgstr "ໃນລະຫວ່າງການຕິດຕັ້ງພຣັອກຊີ, clients ຈະບໍ່ສາມາດເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ຫາ {productname} Server ໄດ້. ຫຼັງຈາກທີ່ທ່ານລຶບພຣັອກຊີແລ້ວ, ລາຍຊື່ລະບົບອາດຈະບໍ່ຖືກຕ້ອງຊົ່ວຄາວ. ທຸກ clients ທີ່ເຄີຍເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ກັບພຣັອກຊີຈະສະແດງວ່າເປັນການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ໂດຍກົງກັບເຊີເວີແທນ. ຫຼັງຈາກການດຳເນີນການຄັ້ງທຳອິດໃນ client ສຳເລັດ ເຊັ່ນ ການລັນຄຳສັ່ງທາງໄກ ຫຼື ການຕິດຕັ້ງແພັກເກດ ຫຼື ແພັດ (patch), ຂໍ້ມູນນີ້ຈະຖືກແກ້ໄຂໃຫ້ຖືກຕ້ອງໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດ. ນີ້ອາດຈະໃຊ້ເວລາບາງຊົ່ວໂມງ."

#. type: Title ===
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/proxy-setup.adoc:73
#, no-wrap
msgid "Replace a Proxy"
msgstr "ປ່ຽນແທນ Proxy"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/proxy-setup.adoc:74
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/uyuni-proxy-setup.adoc:71
msgid ""
"Shut down the old proxy, and leave it installed while you prepare the "
"replacement.  Create a reactivation key for this system and then register "
"the new proxy using the reactivation key.  If you do not use the "
"reactivation key, you will need to re-register all the clients against the "
"new proxy."
msgstr "ປິດພຣັອກຊີຕົວເກົ່າ ແລະ ປ່ອຍມັນໄວ້ແບບນັ້ນໃນຂະນະທີ່ທ່ານກຽມຕົວປ່ຽນແທນ. ສ້າງ reactivation key ສຳລັບລະບົບນີ້ ແລະ ລົງທະບຽນພຣັອກຊີໃໝ່ໂດຍໃຊ້ reactivation key. ຖ້າທ່ານບໍ່ໃຊ້ reactivation key, ທ່ານຈະຕ້ອງລົງທະບຽນ clients ທັງໝົດໃໝ່ກັບພຣັອກຊີຕົວໃໝ່."

#. type: Block title
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/proxy-setup.adoc:75
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Replacing a Traditional Proxy and Keeping the Clients Registered"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການປ່ຽນແທນພຣັອກຊີແບບດັ້ງເດີມ ແລະ ຮັກສາການລົງທະບຽນຂອງ Clients ໄວ້"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/proxy-setup.adoc:76
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/proxy-setup.adoc:85
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/proxy-setup.adoc:100
msgid ""
"Before starting the migration, save the data from the old proxy, if needed.  "
"Consider copying important or custom data to a central place that can also "
"be accessed by the new proxy."
msgstr "ກ່ອນເລີ່ມການຍ້າຍລະບົບ, ໃຫ້ບັນທຶກຂໍ້ມູນຈາກພຣັອກຊີຕົວເກົ່າຫາກຈຳເປັນ. ພິຈາລະນາການຄັດລອກຂໍ້ມູນທີ່ສຳຄັນ ຫຼື ຂໍ້ມູນທີ່ກຳນົດເອງໄປໄວ້ບ່ອນກາງທີ່ພຣັອກຊີຕົວໃໝ່ສາມາດເຂົ້າເຖິງໄດ້."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/proxy-setup.adoc:77
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/proxy-setup.adoc:86
msgid "Shut down the old proxy."
msgstr "ປິດພຣັອກຊີຕົວເກົ່າ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/proxy-setup.adoc:78
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/proxy-setup.adoc:89
msgid ""
"Install a new {productname} Proxy.  For installation instructions, see "
"xref:installation-and-upgrade:install-proxy-unified.adoc[Proxy "
"Installation]."
msgstr "ຕິດຕັ້ງ {productname} Proxy ໃໝ່. ສຳລັບຄຳແນະນຳການຕິດຕັ້ງ, ເບິ່ງ xref:installation-and-upgrade:install-proxy-unified.adoc[Proxy Installation]."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/proxy-setup.adoc:79
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/uyuni-proxy-setup.adoc:79
msgid ""
"In the {productname} {webui}, select the newly installed {productname} "
"Proxy, and delete it from the systems list."
msgstr "ໃນ {productname} {webui}, ໃຫ້ເລືອກ {productname} Proxy ທີ່ຕິດຕັ້ງໃໝ່ ແລະ ລຶບມັນອອກຈາກລາຍຊື່ລະບົບ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/proxy-setup.adoc:80
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/proxy-setup.adoc:87
msgid ""
"In the {webui}, create a reactivation key for the old proxy system.  On the "
"[guimenu]``System Details`` tab of the old proxy click "
"[guimenu]``Reactivation``.  Click [guimenu]``Generate New Key``, and make a "
"note of the new key."
msgstr "ໃນ {webui}, ໃຫ້ສ້າງ reactivation key ສຳລັບລະບົບພຣັອກຊີຕົວເກົ່າ. ໃນແຖບ [guimenu]``System Details`` ຂອງພຣັອກຊີຕົວເກົ່າ ໃຫ້ຄລິກ [guimenu]``Reactivation``. ຄລິກ [guimenu]``Generate New Key``, ແລະ ຈົດບັນທຶກຄີໃໝ່ໄວ້."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/proxy-setup.adoc:81
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/proxy-setup.adoc:90
msgid ""
"Register the new proxy with a bootstrap script as described in "
"xref:installation-and-upgrade:proxy-registration.adoc[].  In the bootstrap "
"script, set the reactivation key with the [systemitem]``REACTIVATION_KEY`` "
"parameter."
msgstr "ລົງທະບຽນພຣັອກຊີໃໝ່ດ້ວຍ bootstrap script ຕາມທີ່ອະທິບາຍໃນ xref:installation-and-upgrade:proxy-registration.adoc[]. ໃນ bootstrap script, ໃຫ້ຕັ້ງ reactivation key ດ້ວຍພາຣາມິເຕີ [systemitem]``REACTIVATION_KEY``."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/proxy-setup.adoc:82
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/proxy-setup.adoc:91
msgid ""
"Restore the proxy data from the backup you made earlier.  See step 1 of this "
"procedure."
msgstr "ກູ້ຄືນຂໍ້ມູນພຣັອກຊີຈາກການສຳຮອງຂໍ້ມູນທີ່ທ່ານເຮັດໄວ້ກ່ອນໜ້ານີ້. ເບິ່ງຂັ້ນຕອນທີ 1 ຂອງຂັ້ນຕອນນີ້."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/proxy-setup.adoc:83
msgid ""
"For Salt proxies, you need to do some additional steps before you bootstrap "
"the new proxy."
msgstr "ສຳລັບ Salt proxies, ທ່ານຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງເຮັດບາງຂັ້ນຕອນເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ອນທີ່ຈະເຮັດ bootstrap ໃຫ້ພຣັອກຊີໃໝ່."

#. type: Block title
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/proxy-setup.adoc:84
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Replacing a Salt Proxy and Keeping the Clients Registered"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການປ່ຽນແທນ Salt Proxy ແລະ ຮັກສາການລົງທະບຽນຂອງ Clients ໄວ້"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/proxy-setup.adoc:88
msgid ""
"In the {webui}, navigate to menu:Salt[Keys], locate the Salt key associated "
"with the old proxy, and click btn:[delete]."
msgstr "ໃນ {webui}, ໄປທີ່ menu:Salt[Keys], ຊອກຫາ Salt key ທີ່ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງກັບພຣັອກຊີຕົວເກົ່າ, ແລະ ຄລິກ btn:[delete]."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/proxy-setup.adoc:92
msgid ""
"For more information about using reactivation keys, see "
"xref:client-configuration:activation-keys.adoc[]."
msgstr "ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບການໃຊ້ reactivation keys, ເບິ່ງ xref:client-configuration:activation-keys.adoc[]."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/proxy-setup.adoc:93
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/proxy-setup.adoc:104
msgid "After the installation of the new proxy, you might also need to:"
msgstr "ຫຼັງຈາກການຕິດຕັ້ງພຣັອກຊີໃໝ່, ທ່ານອາດຈະຕ້ອງໄດ້:"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/proxy-setup.adoc:94
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/proxy-setup.adoc:105
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/uyuni-proxy-setup.adoc:83
msgid "Copy the centrally saved data to the new proxy system"
msgstr "ຄັດລອກຂໍ້ມູນທີ່ບັນທຶກໄວ້ບ່ອນກາງໄປຫາລະບົບພຣັອກຊີໃໝ່"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/proxy-setup.adoc:95
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/proxy-setup.adoc:106
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/uyuni-proxy-setup.adoc:84
msgid "Install any other needed software"
msgstr "ຕິດຕັ້ງຊອບແວອື່ນໆ ທີ່ຈຳເປັນ"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/proxy-setup.adoc:96
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/proxy-setup.adoc:107
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/uyuni-proxy-setup.adoc:85
msgid "Set up TFTP synchronization if the proxy is used for autoinstallation"
msgstr "ຕັ້ງຄ່າການຊິງໂຄຣໄນ TFTP ຫາກພຣັອກຊີຖືກໃຊ້ສຳລັບການຕິດຕັ້ງອັດຕະໂນມັດ"

#. type: Title ===
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/proxy-setup.adoc:97
#, no-wrap
msgid "Change a Proxy from Traditional to Salt"
msgstr "ປ່ຽນພຣັອກຊີຈາກແບບດັ້ງເດີມເປັນ Salt"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/proxy-setup.adoc:98
msgid ""
"You can reinstall the proxy to switch from a traditional to a Salt proxy.  "
"In this method, instead of a reactivation key, reuse the same activation key "
"you used to originally register the proxy.  This means you do not have to "
"re-register the clients."
msgstr "ທ່ານສາມາດຕິດຕັ້ງພຣັອກຊີໃໝ່ເພື່ອປ່ຽນຈາກພຣັອກຊີແບບດັ້ງເດີມໄປເປັນ Salt proxy. ໃນວິທີນີ້, ແທນທີ່ຈະໃຊ້ reactivation key, ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ activation key ເດີມທີ່ທ່ານເຄີຍໃຊ້ລົງທະບຽນພຣັອກຊີໃນຕອນທຳອິດ. ນີ້ໝາຍຄວາມວ່າທ່ານບໍ່ຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງລົງທະບຽນ clients ໃໝ່."

#. type: Block title
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/proxy-setup.adoc:99
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Replacing a Traditional Proxy with a Salt Proxy"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການປ່ຽນແທນພຣັອກຊີແບບດັ້ງເດີມດ້ວຍ Salt Proxy"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/proxy-setup.adoc:101
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/uyuni-proxy-setup.adoc:76
msgid "Shut down the proxy."
msgstr "ປິດພຣັອກຊີ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/proxy-setup.adoc:102
msgid ""
"Install a new {productname} Proxy, and ensure it has the same IP address as "
"the proxy you are replacing.  For installation instructions, see "
"xref:installation-and-upgrade:install-proxy-unified.adoc[Proxy "
"Installation]."
msgstr "ຕິດຕັ້ງ {productname} Proxy ໃໝ່, ແລະ ໃຫ້ແນ່ໃຈວ່າມັນມີທີ່ຢູ່ IP ດຽວກັນກັບພຣັອກຊີທີ່ທ່ານກຳລັງປ່ຽນແທນ. ສຳລັບຄຳແນະນຳການຕິດຕັ້ງ, ເບິ່ງ xref:installation-and-upgrade:install-proxy-unified.adoc[Proxy Installation]."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/proxy-setup.adoc:103
msgid ""
"Register the proxy with a bootstrap script as described in "
"xref:installation-and-upgrade:proxy-registration.adoc[].  In the bootstrap "
"script set the activation key used with the old proxy with the "
"[systemitem]``ACTIVATION_KEYS`` parameter."
msgstr "ລົງທະບຽນພຣັອກຊີດ້ວຍ bootstrap script ຕາມທີ່ອະທິບາຍໃນ xref:installation-and-upgrade:proxy-registration.adoc[]. ໃນ bootstrap script ໃຫ້ຕັ້ງ activation key ທີ່ໃຊ້ກັບພຣັອກຊີຕົວເກົ່າດ້ວຍພາຣາມິເຕີ [systemitem]``ACTIVATION_KEYS``."

#. type: Title ===
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/proxy-setup.adoc:108
#, no-wrap
msgid "Serving big files"
msgstr "ການໃຫ້ບໍລິການໄຟລ໌ຂະໜາດໃຫຍ່"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/proxy-setup.adoc:109
msgid ""
"If you need to distribute big files such as ISO images to your network "
"through the proxy, go to PROXY_HOSTNAME system and copy the big files to the "
"[guimenu]``/srv/www/htdocs/pub`` directory."
msgstr "ຫາກທ່ານຕ້ອງການແຈກຢາຍໄຟລ໌ຂະໜາດໃຫຍ່ ເຊັ່ນ ໄຟລ໌ ISO ໄປຫາເຄືອຂ່າຍຂອງທ່ານຜ່ານພຣັອກຊີ, ໃຫ້ໄປທີ່ລະບົບ PROXY_HOSTNAME ແລະ ຄັດລອກໄຟລ໌ຂະໜາດໃຫຍ່ນັ້ນໄປໄວ້ທີ່ໄດເຣັກທໍຣີ [guimenu]``/srv/www/htdocs/pub``."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/proxy-setup.adoc:110
msgid "Afterwards, the files can be downloaded from"
msgstr "ຫຼັງຈາກນັ້ນ, ສາມາດດາວໂຫຼດໄຟລ໌ໄດ້ຈາກ"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/proxy-setup.adoc:111
#, no-wrap
msgid "http://PROXY_HOSTNAME/pub\n"
msgstr "http://PROXY_HOSTNAME/pub\n"

#. type: Title =
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/proxy-uyuni.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Proxy - Major Upgrade"
msgstr "Proxy - ການອັບເກຣດເວີຊັນຫຼັກ (Major Upgrade)"

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/proxy-uyuni.adoc:3
msgid ""
"Major proxy upgrades include a version upgrade of the operating system.  For "
"more information, see the {productname} {productnumber} release notes."
msgstr "ການອັບເກຣດພຣັອກຊີເວີຊັນຫຼັກຈະລວມເຖິງການອັບເກຣດເວີຊັນຂອງລະບົບປະຕິບັດການ. ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມ, ເບິ່ງບົດບັນທຶກການປ່ອຍ (release notes) ຂອງ {productname} {productnumber}."

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/proxy-uyuni.adoc:4
#, no-wrap
msgid "Preparation for the Upgrade"
msgstr "ການກຽມພ້ອມສຳລັບການອັບເກຣດ"

#. type: Block title
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/proxy-uyuni.adoc:5
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Procedure: Adding openSUSE Leap {opensuse-version} Software Channels at the "
"Command Prompt"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການເພີ່ມຊ່ອງທາງຊອບແວ (Software Channels) ຂອງ openSUSE Leap {opensuse-version} ຜ່ານ Command Prompt"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/proxy-uyuni.adoc:6
msgid ""
"At the command prompt on the {productname} Server, as root, use the "
"[command]``spacewalk-common-channels`` command to add the appropriate "
"channels:"
msgstr "ທີ່ command prompt ຂອງ {productname} Server, ໃນຖານະ root, ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ຄຳສັ່ງ [command]``spacewalk-common-channels`` ເພື່ອເພີ່ມຊ່ອງທາງທີ່ເໝາະສົມ:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/proxy-uyuni.adoc:7
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"spacewalk-common-channels opensuse_leap15_4 \\\n"
"opensuse_leap15_4-non-oss \\\n"
"opensuse_leap15_4-non-oss-updates \\\n"
"opensuse_leap15_4-updates \\\n"
"opensuse_leap15_4-backports-updates \\\n"
"opensuse_leap15_4-sle-updates \\\n"
"uyuni-proxy-stable-leap-154\n"
msgstr ""
"spacewalk-common-channels opensuse_leap15_4 \\\n"
"opensuse_leap15_4-non-oss \\\n"
"opensuse_leap15_4-non-oss-updates \\\n"
"opensuse_leap15_4-updates \\\n"
"opensuse_leap15_4-backports-updates \\\n"
"opensuse_leap15_4-sle-updates \\\n"
"uyuni-proxy-stable-leap-154\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/proxy-uyuni.adoc:8
msgid "Fully synchronize all channels with [command]``spacewalk-repo-sync``."
msgstr "ຊິງໂຄຣໄນທຸກຊ່ອງທາງໃຫ້ຄົບຖ້ວນດ້ວຍ [command]``spacewalk-repo-sync``."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/proxy-uyuni.adoc:10
msgid ""
"To upgrade a proxy you first stop the proxy service, then you replace the "
"software repositories and update the software, and finally you restart the "
"proxy service."
msgstr "ໃນການອັບເກຣດພຣັອກຊີ, ທຳອິດທ່ານຕ້ອງຢຸດບໍລິການພຣັອກຊີ, ຈາກນັ້ນປ່ຽນແທນຄັງຊອບແວ (software repositories) ແລະ ອັບເດດຊອບແວ, ແລະ ສຸດທ້າຍແມ່ນເລີ່ມການບໍລິການພຣັອກຊີໃໝ່."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/proxy-uyuni.adoc:15
msgid ""
"Click menu:Software[Software Channels], and as the base channel select the "
"openSUSE Leap {opensuse-version} channel that is listed in the "
"[systemitem]``Customs Channels`` list."
msgstr "ຄລິກ menu:Software[Software Channels], ແລະ ເລືອກຊ່ອງທາງ openSUSE Leap {opensuse-version} ທີ່ຢູ່ໃນລາຍການ [systemitem]``Customs Channels`` ເປັນຊ່ອງທາງພື້ນຖານ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/proxy-uyuni.adoc:16
msgid ""
"In the [guimenu]``Child Channels`` pane, select the {opensuse-version} child "
"channels."
msgstr "ໃນສ່ວນ [guimenu]``Child Channels``, ໃຫ້ເລືອກຊ່ອງທາງລູກຂອງ {opensuse-version}."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/proxy-uyuni.adoc:17
msgid ""
"Click btn:[Next], and [guimenu]``Confirm Software Channel Change`` with "
"btn:[Confirm]."
msgstr "ຄລິກ btn:[Next], ແລະ [guimenu]``Confirm Software Channel Change`` ດ້ວຍ btn:[Confirm]."

#. At least not for the migration from 15.2 to 153.
#. . Click menu:Software[Packages > Upgrade], and select all the packages to be updated on the proxy, and then apply the selection.
#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/proxy-uyuni.adoc:18
msgid ""
"Click menu:Details[Remote Command], add `zypper --non-interactive dup "
"--allow-vendor-change --replacefiles` to the script field, and click "
"btn:[Schedule]"
msgstr "ຄລິກ menu:Details[Remote Command], ເພີ່ມ `zypper --non-interactive dup --allow-vendor-change --replacefiles` ໃສ່ໃນຊ່ອງສະຄຣິບ, ແລະ ຄລິກ btn:[Schedule]"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/proxy-uyuni.adoc:19
msgid "Wait until the remote command is executed."
msgstr "ລໍຖ້າຈົນກວ່າຄຳສັ່ງທາງໄກຈະຖືກດຳເນີນການ."

