#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/proxy-x.adoc:2
msgid ""
"In some cases {productname} Proxy can be upgraded from one major version to "
"the next.  For example, Proxy can be upgraded from 3.2 to 4.1, but not from "
"3.2 to 4.3."
msgstr "ໃນບາງກໍລະນີ {productname} Proxy ສາມາດອັບເກຣດຈາກເວີຊັນຫຼັກໜຶ່ງໄປຫາເວີຊັນຖັດໄປໄດ້. ຕົວຢ່າງ: ພຣັອກຊີສາມາດອັບເກຣດຈາກ 3.2 ໄປເປັນ 4.1 ໄດ້, ແຕ່ບໍ່ສາມາດອັບເກຣດຈາກ 3.2 ໄປຫາ 4.3 ໂດຍກົງ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/proxy-x.adoc:3
msgid ""
"For more information on upgrading from 4.2 to 4.3, see "
"xref:installation-and-upgrade:proxy-y-z.adoc[]"
msgstr "ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບການອັບເກຣດຈາກ 4.2 ໄປຫາ 4.3, ເບິ່ງ xref:installation-and-upgrade:proxy-y-z.adoc[]"

#. type: Title =
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/proxy-y-z.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Proxy - Minor Version or Patch Level Upgrade (Y or Z Upgrade)"
msgstr "Proxy - ການອັບເກຣດເວີຊັນຍ່ອຍ ຫຼື ລະດັບແພັດ (Y ຫຼື Z Upgrade)"

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/proxy-y-z.adoc:3
msgid ""
"When upgrading {productname} Proxy 4.0, ignore the option to upgrade it to "
"version 4.1 or 4.2 as target product.  Always select to upgrade "
"{productname} Proxy 4.0 to {productname} Proxy 4.3 only."
msgstr "ເມື່ອອັບເກຣດ {productname} Proxy 4.0, ໃຫ້ຂ້າມຕົວເລືອກການອັບເກຣດເປັນເວີຊັນ 4.1 ຫຼື 4.2 ເປັນຜະລິດຕະພັນເປົ້າໝາຍ. ໃຫ້ເລືອກອັບເກຣດ {productname} Proxy 4.0 ໄປຫາ {productname} Proxy 4.3 ເທົ່ານັ້ນ."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/proxy-y-z.adoc:4
msgid ""
"When upgrading {productname} Proxy 4.2 based on JeOS image, before proceding "
"with the migration, please uninstall the `kernel-default-base` package."
msgstr "ເມື່ອອັບເກຣດ {productname} Proxy 4.2 ທີ່ອີງໃສ່ JeOS image, ກ່ອນຈະດຳເນີນການຍ້າຍລະບົບ, ກະລຸນາຖອນການຕິດຕັ້ງແພັກເກດ `kernel-default-base`."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/proxy-y-z.adoc:5
